<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Jeremia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Jeremia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jer</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">JEREMIA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Lanebi Jeremia okwo i agiki me mwaka miya abiro nio kwede wa i acaki me mwaka miya abicel (i mwaka ma peya kinywalo Yecu Kricito). Ikare ducu me tice, en obedo ka juku jo pa Lubanga kun tito pi peko ma bipoto ikom lobogi pi timgi me woro cal jogigu kacel ki pi balgi. En obedo kwo nio ka lok ducu ma en otito ocobe kakare, kadi wa kit ma taun madit me Jerucalem opoto kwede i cing Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon, ki kit ma kimuku kwede ki Ot pa Lubanga, kacel ki tero rwot me Juda ki lwake i Babilon. En bene otito pi dwogo cen pa lwak ma kiterogi i opii ki kit ma kibiroco kwede ki lobogi odoco.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok ma i <char style="bk">Buk pa Jeremia</char> kitwero poko i dul magi: (1) Lubanga olwongo Jeremia; (2) Kwena ma oa ki bot Lubanga pi jo Juda ki luloce ikare me loc pa Jocia, Yekoyakim, Yekoyakin, ki Jedekia; (3) Coc mogo ma kikwanyo ki ikom coc pa Baruk, ma obedo karan pa Jeremia, kacel ki lok mogo me nebi pa Jeremia wa ki jami mogo ma pirgi tego ma mako kwone; (4) Lok me kwena ma oa ki bot Lubanga ikom rok mapatpat; (5) Lok ikom gin mogo ma otime wacon ma kicoyo, matito kit ma Jerucalem opoto kwede, ki kit ma kitero kwede ki lwak jo ma iye i opii i lobo Babilon.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jeremia onongo obedo dano ma paro pi dano dok onongo omaro jone matek tutwal, ki dok bene onongo iye dag tucu lok me ngolo kop ma kiore kwede ikomgi. I dul coc mapol en obedo kalok ikom can ma en owok ki iye pien Lubanga onongo olwonge me bedo lanebi. Lok pa Lubanga onongo obedo calo mac ma wang i cwinye ma en pe twero gwokone i cwinye labongo titone kamaleng.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok mogo madito tutwal ki i buk man cimo pi gin ma bitime inge peko ma opoto ikom Jeremia oo kwede bene wa ikare ma kibibedo ki gicike manyen, ma en aye gicike ma jo pa Lubanga gibilubu labongo lapwony mo ma myero kong dok opo wigi pire, pien nongo dong kicoyo loke woko i cwinygi 31:31-34.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lubanga olwongo Jeremia <char style="ior"><ref loc="JER 1:1-19">1:1-19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me nebi ikare me loc pa Jocia, Yekoyakim, Yekoyakin, ki Jedekia <char style="ior"><ref loc="JER 2:1-25:38">2:1—25:38</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gin ma otime i kwo pa Jeremia <char style="ior"><ref loc="JER 26:1-45:5">26:1—45:5</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me nebi ikom rok mapatpat <char style="ior"><ref loc="JER 46:1-51:64">46:1—51:64</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Poto pa Jerucalem<char style="ior"><ref loc="JER 52:1-34">52:1-34</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1" />I buk man kicoyo iye lok pa Jeremia wod pa Kilkia, ma en ngat acel ikin ajwaki mayam onongo gibedo i Anatot i lobo pa Benjamin. <verse eid="JER 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:3-23:27">2 Luk 22:3—23:27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:8-35:19">2 Tek 34:8—35:19</ref></char></note> Rwot oloko ki Jeremia i mwaka me apar wiye adek me loc pa Yocia wod pa Amon, rwot me Juda. <verse eid="JER 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:7">2 Luk 23:36—24:7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18-25">18—25</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-8">2 Tek 36:5-8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 11:21">11:21</ref></char></note> Lacen Rwot dok omede ki loko loke bot Jeremia ikare me loc pa Yekoyakim wod pa Yocia rwot me Juda, oo kwede wa i agiki mwaka me apar wiye acel me loc pa Jedekia, wod pa Yocia, rwot me Juda, oo kwede wa ikare ma dong kitero jo Jerucalem woko i opii i dwe me abic.<verse eid="JER 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga olwongo Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4" />Ikare meno Rwot oloko kweda kun waca ni, <verse eid="JER 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5" />“Ikare ma onongo peya acweyo in ii meni, onongo dong angeyi, dok ikare ma peya kinywali onongo dong atyeko yero in woko me bedo lanebi bot rok ducu.”<verse eid="JER 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6" />Ka dong agamo loke kun awaco ni, “Aya, Rwot Lubanga! Nen, an pe angeyo lok, pien an pud latin mamwa.”<verse eid="JER 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7" />Ento Rwot odok iye bota kun waca ni, “Pe iwac ni, ‘An latin mamwa’; pien ibicito bot jo ducu ma abicwalo in ni icit botgi, dok bene lok ducu ma an abiciki kwede en aye in ibiloko. <verse eid="JER 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8" />Pe ibed ki lworo mo ikomgi, pien atye kwede, abilari, man an Rwot aye ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9" />Cutcut Rwot ocwalo cinge ogudu doga, ci Rwot owaca ni, “Nen, dong atyeko keto loka idogi. <verse eid="JER 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10" />Nen, dong atyeko keti inino man, me loyo rok mapol ki ker mapol, pi putu gi ki pi mukugi woko bene, ki pi balogi ki turugi woko bene, ka gerogi odoco ki ka pitogi bene.”<verse eid="JER 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11" />Rwot dok oloko kweda kun penya ni, “Jeremia, itye kaneno ango?” Ci agamo ni, “Atye kaneno jang yat yaa.”<verse eid="JER 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12" />Ci Rwot owaco ni, “Ineno kara maber, pien atiti ni atye kaneno loka, amito ni otii tice ocob kakare.”<verse eid="JER 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13" />Rwot dok oloko kweda tyen me aryone, kun penya ni, “Itye kaneno gin ango?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:13">Ci an dok adok iye ni, “Aneno agulu ma pii tye kawalo ki iye ki yo tung kumalo, ma doge oloke okemo yo tung bota.”<verse eid="JER 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14" />Ci Rwot owaco bota ni, “Gin marac matye kawalo bia ki yo tung kumalo bibino poto ikom jo ducu ma gibedo i lobo man. <verse eid="JER 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15" />Pien nen, atye kalwongo rok ducu ma gitye ite ker ducu ma yo tung kumalo. Rwodigi gibibino ci ngat acel acel bicibo komkere i dog taun me Jerucalem, ma gibirumu cele woko litit pi lweny ikome, ki pi lweny ikom taun madito ducu me Juda. Man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16" />Dok abipwodo jona pi timgi maracu ducu ki pi bwota woko; kun gubedo kawango odok eceta bot lubanga mogo mukenegu, kun gin bene gibedo ka woro gin ma gutiyo atiya ki cinggi. <verse eid="JER 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17" />Ento in, bed ma itere, wek icitit botgi kit lok ducu ma aciki kwede. Pe ilworgi, wek an bene pe aryang cwinyi ki inyimgi. <verse eid="JER 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18" />Dong inen, ki tung bota dong atye ka miyo in me bedo matek macalo taun madit ma kicelo woko matek liking ki cel gogo ma pe kitwero loyone, macalo wir nyonyo, ki cel mola, pi gwoki ki ikom jo me lobo man ducu, pi gwoki ki ikom luker me Juda, rwodine, ajwakine, ki ikom lwak ducu me lobo man. <verse eid="JER 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19" />Gibilweny ikomi, ento pe gibitwero loyo in, pien an atye kwedi pi lari.” Man lok pa an Rwot kikome.<verse eid="JER 1:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2" />
  <para style="s1">Gwok pa Lubanga pi jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1" />Rwot dok oloko kweda. En waca ni, <verse eid="JER 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2" />“Cit ituc lok man bot jo Jerucalem, wek guwiny. Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">‘Pud apo pi gen ma ibedo kwede ikoma nia wa i ka tinoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">mar ma ibedo kwede ikoma macalo i nyako ger,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">kit ma ibedo kaluba kwede wa i dye tim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">i lobo mayam pe kicoyo iye kodi mo.<verse eid="JER 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3" />Icrael onongo yam obedo rok ma kikwero wek obed maleng pira kena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">macalo cam ma okwongo cek ma en okayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">Jo ducu ma gucamo cam meno guloke gudoko lubal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">dok gin maracu obino opoto ikomgi, man an Rwot ma awaco.’”<verse eid="JER 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bal pa kwari pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4" />Wuwiny lok pa Rwot, wun jo me ot pa Yakobo, ki wun jo me dogola ducu me ot pa Icrael. <verse eid="JER 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5" />Rwot dok owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">“Kit gin ango marac ma kwariwu gunongo ni atimo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">ma omiyo gua woko ki bota gucito woko kamabor kwedani?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">Gin gubedo kalubu gin ma konye peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">omiyo gin bene gudoko jo ma konygi pekeni.<verse eid="JER 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6" />Gin pe gupenyo ni, ‘Rwot ma okwanyowa woko ki i lobo Ejiptni mono tye kwene?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">En ngat ma yam otelo wiwa i dye tim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">i lobo tim aroo matye iye lwak bur mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">i lobo ma otwo dok tye ki mutu me colpiny ma ocido licuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">ki lobo mayam dano mo pe kato ki iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">kama dano mo bene pe bedo iye.<verse eid="JER 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7" />Ci akelowu i lobo ma ceko cam mabup adada</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">wek wuyom cwinywu kun wucamo cam ma ocek iye ki gin mabeco ducu matye iye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Ento ikare ma wubinoni wubalo lobona woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">wuloko gipiny ma mera odoko gin me kwer.<verse eid="JER 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8" />Ajwaki bene pe gupenyo ni, ‘Rwot mono tye kwene?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Jo ma gitye ludiro i cik bene onongo pe gingeya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">luloc gutimo roc ikoma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">lunebi bene gubedo katyeto lok i nying jok Baal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">gubedo kalubu kor cal jogi ma pe konyo.”<verse eid="JER 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kop ma Lubanga tye kwede ikom jone</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9" />Ci an Rwot awaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:9">“Pud dok abipenyo dogwu aye kun abidotowu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:9">Dok bene abidoto wa likwayowu.<verse eid="JER 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10" />Pimeno kong ingol nam ikat loka Caiprac wek inen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:10">nyo kong icwal dano ocit i Kedar wek ocit ongii maber adada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:10">wek onen kace gin ma kitmeno yam con obedo tye.<verse eid="JER 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11" />Tye rok mo ma oloko lubangane pi lubanga mo mukene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">kadi bed onongo gin jogi mamwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">Ento jona dong guloko deyogi woko pi gin ma pe konyogi kadi wa ki acel.<verse eid="JER 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12" />In polo, bed ki ur pi lok man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:12">bed ma inen ma lworo obwoyo komi woko adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:12">man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13" />Pien jona dong gutyeko timo bal aryo maracu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">gin dong gubwota woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">kun an aye abedo wang it me pii me kwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">ci dong gukwinyo bur ikom pata got me lagwok piigi pirgi ken gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">bur ma okak ma pe twero gwoko pii kadi matidi mo.<verse eid="JER 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adwogi bal pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14" />Icrael mono obedo opii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:14">Kece en latic ma kinywale anywala i paco?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:14">Ci pingo en dong odoko macalo ginayaka i cing lumeroke?<verse eid="JER 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15" />Gin ducu dong gukok woko ikome matek calo labwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">gubworo kun gikok ki dwon gi malongo adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">gin gubalo lobone woko odong nono;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">taune madito ducu dong gudoko wi obur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">labongo dano mo ma bedo i igi.<verse eid="JER 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16" />Medo ikom meno, jo Mempic ki jo Tapanec dong guketo ret i wiye woko.<verse eid="JER 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17" />Pe wun giwu aye ma wukelo can man ikomwu kekenwu pi bwoto Rwot Lubangawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:17">ikare mayam en obedo katelo yo botwuni?<verse eid="JER 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18" />Dong kit kony ango ma wunongo pi keto genwu ikom Ejipt pi ribe kwede?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Kony ango maber ma wunongo ma wucito kamato pii ma i kulu Nail.?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Nyo pi keto gicike ki Aciria?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Nyo wunongo kit kony ango ma wucito kamato pii ma i kulu Euprate?<verse eid="JER 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19" />Balwu aye bikelo pwod ikomwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">ki bwoto Lubangawu woko aye bikelo can ikomwu me jukuwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Wunge dok wunen ni man gin marac dok me cwercwiny</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">pi wun me bwoto Rwot Lubangawu woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">kit lworo mo ma wulwora kwede pe i iwu wa ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">man an Rwot Lubanga me mony aye ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gukwero woro Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20" />Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">“Yam con aturu okolwu woko dok acodo ogwil ma kitweyowu kwede i opii; ento wun owaco bota ni, ‘Pe wabibedo lutici.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">Ci omiyo pe wulubu cika dok wukwero wora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">iwi cere mamalo ducu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">kadi wa ite yadi ducu ma potgi olukgu wubedo ka woro lubanga mukenegu kun wuryebe piny i nyimgi me worogi.<verse eid="JER 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21" />Ento an aye yam apitowu kun wua ki ikom olok mamit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">akwanyowu ki ikom olok ma nyige ducu beco adada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">Wun dok wucako loke ningning me doko calo olok me tim ma otop ma konye dong pekeni?<verse eid="JER 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22" />Kadi bed wulwok komwu ki cabun ma bwoyone dwong mapol marom mene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:22">lwit bal aliiwu nongo nen pud odong tye inyima</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:22">Man an Rwot Lubanga aye awaco.<verse eid="JER 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23" />Dong wutwero waco ningning ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">‘Wan girwa pe wanyobe ki bal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">dok pe bene wabedo ka woro jogi Baal?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Kong wunen ojwe tyenwu ma wuwoto kwede ilung;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">dok myero wunge gin ma dong wutimo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Wubedo calo roya kinaga ma ngweco cabe atata kayenyo twon ikare me ito.<verse eid="JER 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24" />Wubedo calo kana me tim ma dong ongiyo woko ki bedo i tim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">ma ywayo yamo ki ume kun mito twon!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Anga matwero juke ki i gin ma cwinye pyete iye?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Twoni ducu ma gimite pe myero guol komgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">gibinonge i dwene kikome.<verse eid="JER 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25" />In Icrael, pe iwek tyeni oloc woko kun nongo war tyeni oket woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">ki dwoni bene pe iwek otwo woko ki orwo pii pi ringo ka woro lubanga pa lurok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Ento in iwaco ni, “Pe atwero wekone, nen dong amaro lubanga pa lurok, dok bene dong abiwot alubu korgi wek abimede ki worogi.”<verse eid="JER 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot biketo can ikom jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26" />An Rwot awaco ni, “Kit macalo lewic mako lakwo kace kimako ka kwalo gin mo, kitmeno jo Icrael lewic bene bimakogi: gin kikomgi, lukergi, rwodigi, ajwakigi, kadi wa lunebigi, <verse eid="JER 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27" />ma giwaco ki yat moni ni, ‘In i wora,’ dok giwaco ki got moni ni, ‘In aye ma inywala.’ Pien onongo guloko ngegi woko bota, pe nongo dong ginena ki wanggi, Ento ikare ma nongo gitye i can giwaco ni, ‘A malo ilarwa do!’ <verse eid="JER 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28" />Ento lwak lubangagu, ma wutiyo pirwu kenwuni dong gitye kwene? Wek dong gua malo kace gitwero larowu, ikare ma nongo wutye i can; pien lwak lubangawu gipol ma girom aroma ki wel taunwu, wun jo Juda. <verse eid="JER 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29" />Pingo wukelo nguruwu ikoma? Pe wun ducu dong onongo wujemo woko ikoma? <verse eid="JER 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30" />Yam apwodowu kwe, ento pe kitwu oyube kadi ki acel; dok pala lucwanwu kekenwu aye ma oneko lunebiwu otyekogi woko, calo labwor ma owor ma tyeko dano woko. <verse eid="JER 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31" />Dong wun jo Icrael me kare man, wuwiny lok pa Rwot. Wun mono wutamoni an abedo macalo tim bo ki botwu, nyo macalo lobo me mutu? Pingo kono wun wuwaco ni, wubitiyo kit macalo wumito, pe dong wubidok bota matwal? <verse eid="JER 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32" />Wutamo ni nyako mo wiye twero wil ikom ginaruka me deyone, nyo nyako ger wiye twero wil ikom bongo me nyome? Ento jona dong wigi owil woko ikoma pi lwak nino ma wele pe kwane. <verse eid="JER 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33" />Kit ma dok ingeyo yo maber me mar ikit me tarwang! Kadi wa mon ma kitgi racu in aye ma ipwonyogi ki tim me tarwang. <verse eid="JER 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34" />Dok bene ikom bongo ma i pyeri kityeko nongo iye remo pa lucan ma pe gitye ki bal alii mo; kadi yam bene obed ni pe inongogi ka turu ot pi kwalo kwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 2:34">Ento dong ikom lok magi ducu, <verse eid="JER 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35" />pud dok iwaco ni, ‘An gira apeke ki bal mo; adada kiniga pa Rwot dong otyeko a woko ki ikoma.’ Nen, abipwodo in, pi waco ni, ‘Pe onongo abalo.’ <verse eid="JER 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36" />Pingo ibedo kawire ki wot kun iloko yoni atata! Jo Ejipt gibimiyo lewic maki kit macalo yam jo Aciria bene guketo lewic ikomini. <verse eid="JER 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37" />Ibia ki kunu idwogo woko cen ki lewic , pien Rwot dong otyeko kwero jo ma itye kagenogini woko, dok gin bene pe gibikonyi miyo pe ibedo maber wa ki acel.”<verse eid="JER 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael pe gin jo ma gene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1" />Rwot owaco ni, “Ka laco mo oryemo dakone woko, ce dakone oa ki bote ocito woko, ka dong odoko dako pa laco mukene, ci cware mukwongoni pud dok bidok bot dakonu aye? Ci meno pe bimiyo lobo nyobe woko ki bal tutwal? Ento in Icrael, ibedo katimo tim kwele ki jo mapol; ci dok pud itamo ni itwero dwogo cen bota adada? <verse eid="JER 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2" />Lok wangi inen malo wek inen cere mutinge malo. Wi cere mene ma odong ma pe co obutu kwedi iye? Inget yoo ducu ibedo ka kuru co ducu ma gimarini calo Laarab ma bedo i dye tim ka kuru dano ma owec bote. Dong ibalo lobo woko ki tim kwelekwele me malayani. <verse eid="JER 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3" />Ma omiyo kadi kot bene dong ojuke woko, ki kot ma onongo myero ocwer ikare me potokot bene dong peke; ento tarwang pud omoro wangi i tim me kwele, ikwero lewic woko ni pe omaki. <verse eid="JER 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4" />Pud pe ilwonga kombedi ni, ‘Wora, in ibedo larema nia wa ka tinona’? <verse eid="JER 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5" />Kun itamo ni, ‘En pe bibedo ki kiniga ikoma nakanaka, pe bibedo ki akeca nio wa i agiki.’ Nen, in dong iloko, ento kono dong ityeko timo kit bal ducu macalo itwero.”<verse eid="JER 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Icrael gin ki Juda myero gungut pi balgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 22:1-23:30">2 Luk 22:1—23:30</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:1-35:27">2 Tek 34:1—35:27</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare pa rwot Yocia, Rwot owaco bota ni, “Dong ineno gin ma Icrael ma pe geneni otiyo? En obedo kacito iwi godi maboco ki ite yadi ma oluk kunu pi timo iye tim kwelekwelene. <verse eid="JER 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7" />An abedo ka tamone ni ka dong en otyeko timo time ducu ci en bidwogo bota; ento en pe omedo ki dwogo cen, kadi lamine Juda ma jone lugobani bene oneno. <verse eid="JER 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8" />Kadi bed Juda oneno ni lamine Icrael obedo katimo abor tutwal inyima, ma en aye gin ma omiyo yam aryeme woko kun amiyo bote waraga ma nyutuni dong apoke woko kwede, ento Juda lacarcari pe obedo iye ki lworo mo wa ki acel. En bene ocito obedo katimo tim me kwelekwele. <verse eid="JER 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9" />Pien onongo tim me kwele obedo gin mayot ki tung bote, omiyo obalo lobo woko ki bedo ka woro got wa ki yadigu. <verse eid="JER 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10" />Ento pi lok man ducu Juda ma lamine ma lacarcari bene pe oloke odwogo bota ki cwinye ducu, ento odwogo inyima ki kome keken, man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11" />Ci dok Rwot owaco bota ni, “Icrael ma pe geneni bale nen nok i wanga kato pa Juda ma jone lugobani. <verse eid="JER 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12" />En owaco bota ni acit atuc lok magi ibut piny tung kumalo, kun awaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">‘Dwog cen, in Icrael ma pe geneni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">Pe abineni ki kiniga, pien an lakica mada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">Kiniga pe bimaka nakanaka.<verse eid="JER 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13" />Ye bali keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">ni ityeko jemo woko ikom Rwot Lubangani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">ci imiyo mari woko ki lubanga pa lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">kun ibedo kaworogi ite yadi ducu ma olukgu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">dok bene pe ibedo kawinyo loka”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">Man an Rwot kikome ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14" />Wudwog cen, wun lutino ma pe gene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:14">pien an laditwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:14">abikwanyowu, kun akwanyo dano acel ki i gang acel acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:14">ki jo aryo ki i kaka acel acel, ci abikelowu i Cion.<verse eid="JER 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15" />Abimiyo botwu bene lukwat ma bilubu loka, wek gukwawu, ma gipitowu kun gitye ki ngec wa ki niang maber. <verse eid="JER 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16" />Kace dong wunya i lobo ma welwu omede ikare meno, ci pe dok gibibedo kalwongo nying canduk me gicike pa Rwot. Pe dok wubitamo pire, pe wubipo pire, dok bene pe gibiyubu mukene. <verse eid="JER 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17" />Ikare meno dong kibilwongo Jerucalem ni “Komker pa Rwot”, ci rok ducu gibicoke iye inyim Rwot, kun pe dok gilubu kit tam maracu ma i cwinygi matwal, ki bene pe dong gibibedo lujemo. <verse eid="JER 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18" />Ikare meno jo me ot pa Juda gibiribe woko kacel ki jo me ot pa Icrael, ci gibia kacel ki i lobo matye yo tung kumalo gibino i lobo mayam amiyo bot kwarigi me bedo gipinygi en aye ngom ma meggi matwal.<verse eid="JER 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo pa Lubanga gubedo ka woro jogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Icrael, abedo ka tamo kit macalo abiketowu kwede ikin lutinona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">kun amiyowu bene lobo ma yomo cwinywu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">gipiny maber makato lobo pa rok mukene ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">Dok abedo ka tamoni gwok wubilwonga ni an a Wonwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">dok ni pe wubiloke wuweko luba.<verse eid="JER 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20" />Adada, kit macalo dako ma pe lagen weko kwede cware,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:20">wun bene wubedo kitmeno labongo gen mo ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:20">wun jo me ot pa Icrael.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:20">Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21" />Dwon dano ma kok tye ka winye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">ki iwi cere ma obedo barbar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">kun pido kwed lutino ma i Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">pien dong gungak woko ki i yogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">ki wigi bene dong otyeko wil woko ikom Rwot Lubangagi.<verse eid="JER 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22" />Wudwog cen bota, wun lutino ma wupe ki gen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:22">an aye ma abicango cwinywu ma pe ki geni woko.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 3:22" />
  <para style="p" vid="JER 3:22">Wun wuwaco ni, “Nen, wabino boti; pien in aye i Rwot Lubangawa. <verse eid="JER 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23" />Adada kony mo pe ma wanongo ki ikom woro jogi ma iwi got kama wo pa lwak dano winye a ki iyeni. Adada lare pa Icrael tye bot Rwot Lubangawa.<verse eid="JER 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24" />Ento cake wa ka tinowa woro jok Baal, ma en jok me lewic, otyeko camo gin ducu mayam kwariwa gulimo ma gin aye; dyegi, romi, dyangi, awobe wa ki anyira. <verse eid="JER 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25" />Weku dong wabutu piny ingom ki lewicwani, wek tim maracu me lewic ma watimo aye oum komwa woko dong; pien watyeko timo bal ikom Rwot Lubangawa, wan kacel ki kwariwa, cake wa ka tinowa o kwede wa onyo. Dok bene pe wabedo kalubu lok dog Rwot Lubangawa.”<verse eid="JER 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4" />
  <para style="s1">Lwongo dano wek gunguti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1" />Rwot owaco ni, “Wun jo Icrael, kace wumito dwogo cen bota, ci myero wudwog giwu, kace wukwanyo gin me kwerwu woko ducu ki inyima, ma pe dong wubingak woko aye, <verse eid="JER 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2" />dok bene kace wukwongo kwong ki nyinga kun wuwaco ni, ‘Kit macalo Rwot tye kwoni,’ myero wukwong i ada, kun wulubu yo me kwo ma atir, ci lurok ducu bene gibilego Rwot wek oony gum mere ikomgi, dok gibibedo kamiye deyo.”<verse eid="JER 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 10:12">Koc 10:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman bot jo Juda ki bot jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem ni, “Wucer potiwu woko maber, pe wuco kit kodi mo ikin okutu. <verse eid="JER 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4" />Wun dong myero wulire woko pira an Rwot, wulire icwinywu, wun jo Juda kacel ki wun jo ma wubedo i Jerucalem; wek akemona pe okati woko ma lyel calo mac, ma biwango piny woko ma ngat mo pe romo nekone, pi gin marac ma wutimo.”<verse eid="JER 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kibimonyo Juda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5" />“Wutit lok man i Juda, kun wutucu pire bene i Jerucalem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">Ma wuwaco botgi ni kikut tum wek kokone orom i lobo woko ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">wudange matek kun wuwaco botgi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">guring gucit wa i taun madito ma kicelogi ki cel gogo matek!<verse eid="JER 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6" />Wuting benderawu malo wukem Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">wuring woko wular komwu, pe wubed mot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">pien atye kakelo gin marac ki tung kumalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">topiny madit mada ma neko dano tyeko woko.<verse eid="JER 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7" />Lanek rok ducu dong otyeko kati woko macalo labwor kati woko ki i bunga ma ocule liking.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">En dong oa woko ki i kabedone</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">me bino kabalo lobowu woko wek odong obur;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">ci taunwu madito ducu me Juda bidoko wi obur labongo dano mo ma bedo i igi.<verse eid="JER 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8" />Pi man dong wutwe bongo cola i pyerwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:8">wukok kun wukum bene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:8">pien kiniga mager pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:8">peya oloke oa woko ki ikom Juda.”<verse eid="JER 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9" />Rwot owaco ni, “Inino meno tek cwiny pa luker ki pa rwodi bitum woko; ajwaki komgi bito woko lirut, ki lunebi bene gibiuru matek.” <verse eid="JER 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10" />Cutcut agamo loke kun awace ni, “Aya, Rwot Lubanga, adada in dong ibwolo lwak man ki jo me Jerucalem marac mada, kun iwaco ni, ‘Wubibedo maber ki kuc’; ento i ada mere imiyo pala lucwan dong kiteno wa i ngutgi.”<verse eid="JER 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11" />Ikare meno gibiwaco bot lwak man ki bot jo Jerucalem ni, “Yamo malyet oa ki iwi cere ma yadi pe iye matye wa i tim aroo, kun kodo dok kwede yo tung bot lwaka, pe pi pyetogi macalo kal wek gubed maleng; <verse eid="JER 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12" />yamo ma acwaloni tye ma ger mada, ma pe dong romo pyetogi apyeta keken wek gubed maleng! An aye dong kombedi atye kaloko lok pi ngolo kop ikom jona.”<verse eid="JER 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwor pa Juda gurume woko dyere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13" />Nen, lamerok tye kabino calo pol, gadigadi lwenye ducu gibedo calo yamo lapiru; aguragurane gidwir giloyo ocur woko. Can i wiwa, dong watye i peko madit kuman! <verse eid="JER 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14" />Wun jo Jerucalem, myero wulwok cwinywu woko ki i timo tim maracu, wek wulare. En tamwu maracugu bibedo mono i cwinywu pi kare marom mene ka? <verse eid="JER 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15" />Dwon winye kun a ki i Dan ma tito ki iwi got Epraim pi gin marac ma bitime. <verse eid="JER 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16" />Dwon meno tito lok man bot rok ducu, ki Jerucalem bene ni lukworgi tye kabino. Mony mogo ma birumu gang woko, gibibino kun gia ki i lobo matye kamabor; ma gibidange ki wo mapol ikom taun madito me Juda. <verse eid="JER 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17" />Gin birumu Jerucalem woko dyere calo lukur poto ma gurumu poto woko litit, pien onongo Juda ojemo woko ikom Rwot. <verse eid="JER 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18" />Kitwu ki gin ducu ma wutimo aye okelo can man ikomwu. Man aye kipwolawu, can makec atika; can man ton wa i cwinywu kikome.<verse eid="JER 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cwiny Jeremia cwer pi jone</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19" />Arem dong omaka woko, omaka woko do!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Areme dong wango koma adada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Oii, mil wa i pal cwinya kikome!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Adununa tye ka gone matek lirimrim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">pe atwero ling wa ki acel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">pien abedo kawinyo koko tum ma kikutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">pi oduru me lweny.<verse eid="JER 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20" />Can madit poto dode ikom can madit wadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">lobo ducu dong kibalo woko, piny odong obur.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">Kijwero kemana woko oyotoyot mada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">dok kimuku kicikana woko bene pi dakika manok keken.<verse eid="JER 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21" />Abibedo ma aneno bendera me lweny pi kare marom mene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:21">kun abedo bene kawinyo koko tum?<verse eid="JER 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22" />Rwot dok owaco kuman ni, “Jonagu gin luming, pe gingeya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">gin lutino ma wigi oding,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">pe gitye ki kit niang mo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Giryek meggi i tiyo gin marac keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">ento pe gingeyo tiyo gin maber.”<verse eid="JER 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta pa Jeremia pi topiny matye kabino</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23" />Ka aneno lobo, ci nen obale woko odoko obur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:23">labongo gin mo ma odong iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:23">ki malo i polo kuca,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:23">lakalatwe ki dwe bene pe giryeny.<verse eid="JER 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24" />Aneno wi godi, ci aneno gitye ka yenge ayenga ni yegeyege,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:24">ceregu nongo tye kawire liwir ma gigwenye agwenya.<verse eid="JER 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25" />Aneno ci pe anongo dano mo kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:25">winyo me polo ducu gutuk gucito woko.<verse eid="JER 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26" />Aneno piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:26">ci anongo ni lobo mayam ceko cam tutwali dong odoko tim aroo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:26">taun madito ma i iye ducu dong kibalogi woko gudoko obur</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:26">pi kiniga magwar ma onongo omako Rwot.<verse eid="JER 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27" />(Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Lobo man ducu bidoko obur; ento en pe ebityekone woko liweng.)<verse eid="JER 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28" />Lobo bikumu pi lok man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">ki polo bene bicido woko macol licuc.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">Pien dong atyeko tito kamaleng gin ma onongo ayube me timone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">kica pe bimaka wa ki acel, dok bene pe abiloko tama.”<verse eid="JER 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29" />Jo ma i gang ducu gibiringo woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">pi wo pa wegi aguragura ki wegi atero;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">gibidonyo woko i bunga macol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">gibicito wa ikin gotgu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">gangi ducu dong kibibwoto woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">dano mo pe ma bibedo i igi.<verse eid="JER 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30" />In Jerucalem, in ma dong idoko wi oburri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">pingo iruku bongo makwar?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Pingo kono ideyo komi ki gin me deyo ma obedo jabujabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">kun i wiro wangi woko ki rangi wek onen maber makato?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Iyele nono me deyo komi ni onen maber.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Pacogigu ducu gicayi acaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">dok giyenyo yo me neki woko.<verse eid="JER 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31" />Awinyo koko mo ma cal ki koko pa dako matye ka rem ki nywal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">matye ki arem madwong calo dako ma pud nywalo latin kayone anywala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">Cion tye kakoko kun kwite pi nongo yweyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">kun ryeyo cinge woko ma waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">“Can iwiya gira! Dong gitye kabino kaneka woko.”<verse eid="JER 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5" />
  <para style="s1">Bal pa jo Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1" />Rwot dok owaca kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">“Wun jo me Jerucalem, wuring kun wugwenye agwenya i dye yoowu me Jerucalem;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">wek wunen ci myero wuniang iye maber!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Wungi gang catwu maber!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Wuyeny piny i dyekale ducu wek wunen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">ka wutwero nongo dano mo iye matye ki kit ma atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">dok bene ma tiyo ki ada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">ka wek dong atim kica ki Jerucalem.<verse eid="JER 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2" />Kadi bed gikwongo kwong i nying Rwot kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:2">‘Kit macalo Rwot tye makwoni,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:2">ento nongo pud dok gikwongo kwong me gobagoba.<verse eid="JER 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3" />Ai Rwot, in giri iyenyo jo ma gitye ki ada ma gigene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">In ipwodo joni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">ento gin pe guwinyo kit arem mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">ci pe gurwoo, dok pe guniang gin mo gukwero winyo pwonyi woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Tokgi odoko tek makato got;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">kun gukwero ngut woko.<verse eid="JER 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4" />Ci awaco ni, ‘Magigu lucan keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">pe gitye ki kit ngec mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">pien pe gingeyo yo pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">ma en aye cik pa Lubangagi.’<verse eid="JER 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5" />Abicito bot jo madito ma gin wegi twero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">ci abiloko kwedgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">pien gingeyo yo pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">ma en aye cik pa Lubangagi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Ento gin bene onongo dong gukwero okol pa Rwot woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">dok bene onongo gucodo ogwile woko omiyo pe gulubu cike.<verse eid="JER 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6" />Pimeno, labwor mo bia ki i bunga ci binekogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">ki orudi ma bedo i tim aroo bibino bityekogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">ki kwac aye ma dong tye kakurugi ikin taun gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">ma ka ngat mo ki ikin gi ka oa okato woko ci kibingidone woko matinotino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">pien balgi dong odoko dwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">dok tim me bwoto Lubanga bene dong omede woko matek ikin gi adada.”<verse eid="JER 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7" />Rwot openyo ni, “Atwero timowu kica pi balwu ningning wun jo Jerucalem?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Lutinowu dong gubwota woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">kun gubedo ka kwongo kwong ki nying lubanga mogo ma pe obedo Lubanga kikome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Ikare ma amiyo gucamo cam guyeng adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">ci gutimo abor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">dok guwoto kacel gucito ka woro lubanga mukenegu calo ngat ma bedo ki malaya.<verse eid="JER 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8" />Onongo gubedo macalo twoni aguragura ma kipitogi maber ma guyeng ma gimito tigo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:8">kun cwiny ngat acel acel pyete kok pi dako pa lawote.<verse eid="JER 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9" />Ci pe abiketo can ikomgi ningning pi lok magi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:9">Man an Rwot ma apenyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:9">dok bene pe abiculu kwor</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:9">ikom rok macalo man pingo?<verse eid="JER 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10" />Wek acwal lumeroke gucit i potone kun giwoto ki ikin olok ci ilwer jone woko calo ilwero olok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">ento pe gilwer gityekgi woko liweng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Abiwaco botgi wek gujwer jange woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">pien gin pe gubedo pa Rwot.<verse eid="JER 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11" />Pien jo me ot pa Icrael ki jo me ot pa Juda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:11">pe gubedo ki gen mo wa ki acel ikoma, man an Rwot aye ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot okwero Icrael woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12" />Gubedo kaloko lok gobagoba ikom Rwot, kun giwaco ni, “En pe bitimo gin mo; dok gin marac mo bene pe bipoto ikomwa; pe bene kibilweny ikomwa ki pala lucwan, kadi kec bene pe bipoto i lobowa. <verse eid="JER 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13" />Gin giwaco ni lok pa lunebi bedo calo yamo; ni gin pe gitye ki lok mo ma oa ki bot Lubanga. Meno gin ma bitime ikomgi.”<verse eid="JER 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14" />Pimeno an Rwot Lubanga me mony awaco kuman ni, “Pien dong guloko lok man, nen, atye ka loko loka matye i dogini wek odok mac, ki lwak man dong aloko gidoko yen, ci mac biwangogi woko.”<verse eid="JER 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15" />Wun jo me ot pa Icrael, Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Nen, abikelo rok mo ma bia ki kamabor ikomwu. Roke rok matek, dok roke rok macon, rok ma wun pe wungeyo loko lebgi, dok bene pe wuromo niang gin ma giwaco. <verse eid="JER 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16" />Aterogi ducu neko dano woko, gin ducu cogi oteka keken. <verse eid="JER 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17" />Gibicamo cam ducu ma wukayo woko liweng; dok gibineko awobewu ki anyirawu woko; gibicamo dyegiwu ki romiwu kadi wa dyangiwu woko; gibicamo olokwu ki oduruwu. Taunwu madito ducu ma kirumugi ki cel gogo ma wugenoni kibijwero woko ki pala lucwan.”<verse eid="JER 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18" />Rwot owaco ni “Ento kadi wa ikare meno pe abityekowu woko liweng. <verse eid="JER 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19" />Kace lutuwu gibipenyo ni, ‘Pingo Rwot Lubangawa otimo gin magi ikomwa?’ In ibiwaco botgi ni, kit macalo wubwoto an wokoni kun wubedo katiyo bot lubanga pa lurok i lobowu, kitmeno wubitiyo bene bot lurok i lobo ma pe mewu.”<verse eid="JER 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ociko jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Tuc lok man i ot pa Yakobo, tit pire i lobo Juda ni: <verse eid="JER 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Ica 6:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Eje 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:18">Mar 8:18</ref></char></note>wuwiny lok man, wun luming ki jo ma wiwu oding, ma wangwu tye, ento pe wuneno, ma itwu tye, ento pe wuwinyo. <verse eid="JER 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:8-11">Yub 38:8-11</ref></char></note> An a Rwot; pingo pe wulwora? Pingo komwu pe myel inyima? Aketo kweyo obedo wang apoki nam, apoki ma rii nakanaka ma en pe twero katone; kadi bed biamwonyi me nam twage, ento pe bibalo woko, kadi piine mor, pe biromo kato ki i wiye. <verse eid="JER 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23" />Ento wun lwak man wun jo ma ngutwu tek dok wun lujemo ki i cwinywu; wun wuloke dok wungak, wucito giwu, ci wuweka woko. <verse eid="JER 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24" />Pe bene wuparo ki i cwinywu, ni omyero wulwor Rwot Lubangawu, ma en aye ngat miyowu kot i karene, kot ikare me coyo kodi ki kot ikare me kac, dok miyo wubedo ki gen ka kare me kac oromo. <verse eid="JER 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25" />Balwu ma wutimo dong oryemo jami magi woko ki botwu, balwu ogengowu nongo jami magi mabeconi woko.<verse eid="JER 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26" />Pien jo maracu gitye ikin jona; gibedo ka kiyo piny calo ludwar winyo. Giciko owicgi; ci gimako dano. <verse eid="JER 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27" />Odigi opong ki jami ma kinongo i yo me buma, calo aduku ma opong ki winyo; pimeno dong gudoko jo madito dok bene gulony, <verse eid="JER 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28" />gucwe dok komgi nen liyu mada, gitimo bal lataya ma ka gike pe; pe gingolokop atir, pe gikonyo lutino kic wek gubed maber, dok bene pe gipido lok pa jo ma piny obwoyogi kakare. <verse eid="JER 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29" />Ci an pe abiketo can ikomgi pi lok magi ningning? Dok bene pe abiculu kwor ikom rok macalo man pingo? <verse eid="JER 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30" />Ginaura mamiyo lworo dong otime woko i lobo kuman: <verse eid="JER 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31" />lunebi gitito lok gobagoba, ki ajwaki bene gitye katiyo gin ma igi mito; jona gimaro kit tim macalo meno. Ento gibitime ningning ka agikine dong oo?”<verse eid="JER 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6" />
  <para style="s1">Lumerok gurumu Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1" />Wun jo pa Benjamin, wuring woko wular komwu! Wua woko ki i Jerucalem! Wukut tum okok i Tekoa, ci wuting bendera malo i Betakerem, pien gin marac tye kabino ma a ki yo tung kumalo, ma bityeko lobo woko liweng. <verse eid="JER 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2" />In taun me Cion, in ibedo macalo olet maber pi ka cam pa dyangi, ento kibibalo ne woko. <verse eid="JER 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3" />Dong rwodi kacel ki dul monygi bibino ka lweny ikomi; ci gibiguru kemagi gibirumi kwede woko dyere; gibikwayo limgi makwo kenyo, kun dano acel acel kwanyo kabedo ma en oyero. <verse eid="JER 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4" />Gin gibiwaco ni, “Yub lweny dong ikome! Wuyube dong wacito walweny ikome i dyeceng amac!” Ento dok gibiwaco ni, “Cawa dong otum woko, pien ceng dong olenge woko cok poto, nen tipu ma umu piny otyenoni dong olyane woko mabor! <verse eid="JER 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5" />Wuyube, wek wacitu walwenyu ikome idyewor, wek wabalu kabedone woko!”<verse eid="JER 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6" />Pien Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, “Wutong yadinegu woko ducu piny; wutor cel lobo wurum ki Jerucalem woko. Man en aye taun madit ma myero kiket can ikome; pien jo ma iye gibedo ka unu dano. <verse eid="JER 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7" />Kit macalo wang it gwoko piine bedo malengi, Jerucalem bene tye ka gwoko tim maracu kit meno. Awinyo pi tim bwami ki nek matye i dye taun madit man; aneno two ki wang bur keken iye. <verse eid="JER 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8" />Wun jo Jerucalem, wuwek lok man obed calo lok ma acikowu kwede, ka pe aa awekwu woko; weko aloko lobowu doko obur, kama dano mo pe bedo iye.” <verse eid="JER 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9" />Rwot me mony owaco ni, “Kibikwanyo jo Icrael woko liweng calo kipwono nyig olok ki i jange, ngat mo pe bidong. Pimeno myero ilar jo ma itwero larogi, calo lapur ma beko nyig oloke.” <verse eid="JER 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10" />Ci an agamo ni, “Abiloko bot anga wek acikgi, wek guwiny loka? Nen, gudingo itgi woko, pe gitwero winyo lok mo. Nen, gukwero winyo pwonyi woko, dok gicayo loki ma ilokogu acaya, ai Rwot, kun pe giketo cwinygi iye. <verse eid="JER 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11" />Pimeno akemo pa Rwot omaka woko; ma pe bene dong atwero juke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 6:11">Ci Rwot ogamo loka kun waca ni, “To akemoni ikom lutino ma gitye i dye yoo, ki ikom awobe ma gucoke kacel bene. Co kacel ki mon kibikwanyogi ci kibiterogi woko, wa jo muteggi bene pe gibibwot. <verse eid="JER 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:10-12">Jer 8:10-12</ref></char></note> Kibimiyo odigi woko bot jo mukene, potigi kacel ki mon gi bene; pien abiketo can ikom jo ma gibedo i loboni.” <verse eid="JER 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13" />Cake ikom jo matino o kwede wa ikom jo madito dano acel acel owor woko pi lim ki nongo magoba i yo ma pe atir; cake ikom lunebi o kwede wa ikom ajwaki, gin ducu gitiyo ki goba keken ma pe gigene. <verse eid="JER 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 13:10">Eje 13:10</ref></char></note>Gibedo katuku ki wang bur pa jona atuka macalo delkom ma pwac apwaca. Gimote ki mot me kuc kun giwaco ni, “Kuc, kuc,” kun kuc mo peke. <verse eid="JER 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15" />Tika yam lewic omakogi ikare ma gutiyo gin me kwer? Pe gire, lewic mo pe omakogi wa ki acel. Pimeno kibityekogi woko calo jo mukene ma kibityekogi ikare ma abiketo can ikomgi gibitum woko ducu man an Rwot aye ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gukwero lubu yo pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16" />Rwot owaco bot jone kuman ni, “Wucung kama yoo ongole iye wek wunen, dok wupeny bene pi yoo me kare macon, kama yoo maber tye iye, wek wun bene wucak wot kun wulubu, wek bene wunong yweyo ki kuc i kwowu.” Ento gin giwaco ni, “Wan pe wabilubu yonu kadi ki acel.” <verse eid="JER 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17" />Ci Rwot oketo lukurpiny me kuruwu kun waci, “Wuwiny koko tum!” Ento wun wuwaco ni, “Pe wabiwinyone kadi matidi mo.”<verse eid="JER 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18" />Pimeno Rwot owaco ni, “Dong wuwiny wun lwak me rok ducu, dok wunge gin ma bipoto ikomgi, wun lurok ma wucoke kany. <verse eid="JER 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19" />Winy, in lobo, nen, atye kakelo gin marac wek opot ikom lwak man, adwogi me gin maracu mayam gubedo katimone pien gin ducu pe gubedo kawinyo loka, dok bene gukwero lubu cika woko. <verse eid="JER 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20" />Pingo gikelo odok luban bota ki i lobo Ceba, nyo lum malim ma ngwece kur ki i lobo matye kamabor? Gitum awangagi ducu pe abigamo kadi wa gityergigu ducu pe yomo cwinya. <verse eid="JER 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21" />Pimeno an Rwot abicibo gin ma yoko dano i wangayo pa lwak man, ma ka gibiwot ci gibiyoke kwede matek; lunyodo kacel ki lutino, luwotgi kacel ki luremgi ducu gibito.”<verse eid="JER 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mony ma bia ki tung kumalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Nen, lwak me rok moni tye kabino kun gibia ki i lobo ma yo tung kumalo, rok matek matye kamabor mada tye kayube pi lweny. <verse eid="JER 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23" />Dong gumako, atumgi ki tonggi woko liking, giger adada, pe gitye ki kica mo wa ki acel; woogi winye calo nam matye ka mor. Giringo ki aguragura, ma gurye woko, calo jo ma dong kuru lweny akura ikomwu wun jo Cion!”<verse eid="JER 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24" />Dong watyeko winyo lok ma kikelo botwa pire, “Jo me Jerucalem giwaco ni, cingwa ducu okwe woko ma dong pe timo gin mo; remcwiny madwong oketo komwa woko ducu calo arem pa dako matye ka rem ki nywal. <verse eid="JER 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25" />Pe watwero kato woko me cito i dye bar, pe bene watwero wot i yoo; pien lukworwa gitye ki pala lucwan, ikabedo ducu inongo tye gin ma kelo lworo ikom dano.”<verse eid="JER 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Wun jona, wutwe bongo cola i pyerwu, dok bene wubed ka ngene i buru. Wukok kit macalo onongo wutwero kok kwede pi latin acel keken ka oto, wukok ki kec cwiny kun pig wangwu cwer adada; pien ngat ma bino katyekowuni bibino oyotoyot poto woko ikomwu. <verse eid="JER 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27" />In Jeremia, nen dong atyeko keto in ikin jona me bedo ngat ma ngiyogi dok ma temogi; temgi wek inge, dok inong kit ma gibedo kwede. <verse eid="JER 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28" />Gin ducu jo ma lujemo ma ngutgi nwang, ma giwoto ki lok me kwot keken i kabedo ducu; gubedo jo ma lujemo ma ngutgi tek calo mola ki nyonyo, gin ducu lutim bal keken. <verse eid="JER 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29" />Lutet gubuku mac olyeti okur adada ma mwoc matek, mac dong olenyo cet nyonyo woko, ento dong ngat matye kaliyone yele nono, pieno jo maracu pe kikwanyogi kiterogi woko cen. <verse eid="JER 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30" />Kibilwongogi ni cet ryal ma kikwero, pien an Rwot dong atyeko kwerogi woko.”<verse eid="JER 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia otucu lok i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1" />Rwot oloko kweda kun waca ni, <verse eid="JER 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2" />“Cit icung i dogola me Ot pa Rwot, ci itit lok man ni: wun jo Juda ducu ma wudonyo ki i dogola man kun wucito ka woro Rwot wuwiny lok man. <verse eid="JER 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3" />Rwot me mony, ma Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco kuman ni, wuyub kitwu kacel ki tim mewu ducu, ci abiweko wubedo i kabedo man. <verse eid="JER 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4" />Pe wubed kageno lwak lok magi me bwolagu ni, ‘Man Ot pa Rwot, man Ot pa Rwot, man Ot pa Rwot.’<verse eid="JER 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5" />Pien kace wuyubu kitwu ki timwu ducu adada, kace wutiyo gin ma atir ikinwu kekenwu, <verse eid="JER 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6" />kace pe wuunu labedo mo, lutino kic nyo mon to, dok bene pe wuneko dano ma pe ki bal i kabedo man, ma pe wuworo lubanga mukenegu mamiyo wupoto i can, <verse eid="JER 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7" />ci abimiyo wubedo i kabedo man, i lobo mayam amiyo bot kwariwu ikare macon me bedo meggi matwal.<verse eid="JER 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8" />Nen, wuketo genwu i lok me bwola ma pe konyogu. <verse eid="JER 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9" />Pud wukwalo kwo, pud wuneko dano, wutimo abor, wukwongo kwong gobagoba, pud wuwango odok eceta bot Baal, dok bene wuworo lubanga mogo mayam pe onongo kong wungeyo con. <verse eid="JER 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10" />Wubedo katimo gin ma iya dagi, dok bene wubino wucung kwede inyima i Ot man, ma kilwongo ki nyinga, kun wuwaco ni, ‘Dong kilarowa woko!’ Ento pud dok wumede ki timo gin magi me kwer ikoma! <verse eid="JER 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mat 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:17">Mar 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:46">Luk 19:46</ref></char></note>Wutamo ni oda ma kilwongo ki nyingani odoko boro pa luyak ki botwu? Nen, an kikoma aye dong atyeko neno gin ducu ma wutye katiyone. <verse eid="JER 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:1">18:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:6">Jer 26:6</ref></char></note>Kombedi dong wucit i Cilo i kabedona macon ca, kama yam aketo oda obedo iye mukwongo, wek wunen gin ma atiyo i iye pi gin maracu ma jona jo Icrael gutimo. <verse eid="JER 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13" />Wun dong wutimo gin magi ducu ma akwanogini, kadi bed abedo kawaco lok man botwu teretere, ento wun wukwero winyone woko, dok bene ikare ma alwongwu, wun pe wugamo doga, man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14" />Pimeno abitimo gin ma atimo i Cilo ikom oda ma kilwongo ki nyinga ma wuketo iye genwuni. Abitiyo gin marom kitmeno i kabedo man mayam amiyo botwu ki bot kwariwu, kit macalo nene atiyo i Cilo. <verse eid="JER 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15" />Abiryemowu woko ducu ki inyima, kit macalo aryemo kwede lutuwu ma likwayo pa Epraim.”<verse eid="JER 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano gumede ki jemo ikom Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16" />Rwot dok owaca ni, “Dong in Jeremia, pe myero ileg pi lwak man, pe iting dwoni nyo ikok ka lega pirgi; pe ibak dogi bota pirgi bene, pien pe abiwinyo loki kadi ki acel. <verse eid="JER 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17" />In pe ineno gin ma gitye katiyone i taun madito me Juda ducu ki i dye yoo me Jerucalem ce? <verse eid="JER 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:7-19">Jer 44:7-19</ref></char></note>Lutino gicoko yen, wegigi gimoko mac, ki mon ginywango moko me tedo mugati pi Daker me Polo; dok bene gionyo gityer amatagu bot lwak lubanga, pi ngeto cwinya wek kiniga omaka. <verse eid="JER 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19" />Gin mono gitamoni an aye ma gitye ka ngeto cwinyeni? Pe gire, gin gitye ka kelo can ikomgi ken gi, dok bene gitye kakelo lewic ikomgi ken gi. <verse eid="JER 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20" />Ma omiyo an Rwot Lubanga awaco kuman ni, nen, abitoyo kinigana ki akemona woko ikom kabedo man, ikom dano ki ikom lee, ikom yadi ma i timgu ki ikom ginapita ducu ma ocek i poto; akemona biwang adada calo mac ma pe kitwero nekone.<verse eid="JER 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21" />Jona, gitum ma wukelo bota me gityer mogo ki ikin gi nongo myero kiwango woko ducu bota, ci mukene mudonge wuromo camone ki inyima. Ento an Rwot me mony ma an Lubanga me Icrael awaco dong botwu kuman ni, wurib gitum awangawu ikom gitum mukenegu wek wucam woko ducu! <verse eid="JER 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22" />Ikare mayam akwanyo kwariwu woko ki i lobo Ejipt, pe onongo acikogi pi lok ikom gitum awanga ki gitum mukenegu. <verse eid="JER 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23" />Ento acikogi ni myero guwiny loka, wek abed Lubangagi, dok wek gin gubed jona. Dok acikogi kit ma myero gukwo kwede wek gubed ma jami ducu woto maber botgi. <verse eid="JER 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24" />Ento gin pe gulubu cika, dok bene pe guciko itgi kawinyo loka, ento gubedo kalubu tamgi ken gi ki jemo me cwinygi ma opong ki gin marac, ci gumede gudoko lutim marac ma ka doko jo maber. <verse eid="JER 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25" />Cake ikare ma kwariwu gua kwede woko ki i lobo Ejipt o kwede wa onyo, abedo kacwalo botwu lutica ma gin lunebi teretere, nino ki nino; <verse eid="JER 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26" />ento wun pe wuwinyo loka, dok pe wuciko itwu bene me winyone, ento wujingo ngutwu odoko tek. Wudoko ludingo ki lujemo adada ma okato kwariwu woko.<verse eid="JER 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27" />Kitmeno, Jeremia, ibiloko lok magi ducu botgi, ento gin pe gibiwinyo loki. Ibilwongogi bene, ento pe gibigamo dogi. <verse eid="JER 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28" />Ci ibiwaco botgi ni, ‘Man aye rok ma nene jone pe gulubu lok pa Rwot Lubangagi, dok pe bene guye lok me pwony; lok ada dong otyeko rwenyo woko liweng, dok pe bene giloko pire matwal.’”<verse eid="JER 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tim me bal i nota me Kinom</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29" />An Rwot awaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 7:29">“Wun jo Jerucalem, wulyel yer wiwu ci wubol woko cen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 7:29">wucak wo ki koko i kabedo ma odong nono ma iwi godi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 7:29">pien an Rwot dong atyeko kwero dok abwoto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 7:29">jo me yalwak man ma akemo omake ikomgini.<verse eid="JER 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30" />Pien jo Juda dong gutimo gin marac inyima. Guketo cal jogigi ma en gin me kwer ki tung botani i ot ma kilwongo ki nyingani, me balone woko. Man an Rwot aye ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:10">2 Luk 23:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:35">Jer 32:35</ref></char></note> Guyubu wang jok i nota me Kinom ma kilwongo ni Topet, kama gin twero wango iye awobegi ki anyiragi ki mac. Yam acikogi ni pe gutim kitmeno, dok bene pe gubedo katamo lok macalo meno wa ki acel. <verse eid="JER 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32" />Pimeno, nen, kare tye kabino ma pe dok kibilwongo ni Topet, nyo nota me Kinom. Ento kibilwongo ni nota me Nek, pien kibiyiko dano i Topet, pien kabedo me yiko dano mukene dong nongo bibedo peke kadi ki acel. <verse eid="JER 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33" />Ci dong kom jo magi ma gutoni bidoko cam pa winyo ki pa lee me tim; ma ngat mo pe ma biryemogi woko. <verse eid="JER 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:9">Jer 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:10">25:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:23">Niy 18:23</ref></char></note>Lobo bidoko tim aroo, dong i gangi me Juda ki i dye gudu me Jerucalem abijuku wo me yomcwiny ma dano gitye kwedeni woko, kadi wa wo me dwon lanyom ki dwon nyako ger bene.”<verse eid="JER 7:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1" />An Rwot awaco kuman ni, “Ikare meno kibikwanyo cogo pa luker me Juda, ki pa rwodine, ki pa ajwaki, ki pa lunebi, kacel ki pa jo ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem ci kibiwotogi woko kamaleng ki i lyelgi. <verse eid="JER 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2" />Ci kibimoyogi woko inyim ceng ki dwe ki inyim lakalatwe me polo, mayam gumarogi kun gitiyo botgini, mayam gubedo kalubu korgi, kun giyenyo tam ki botgi dok guworoni. Pe kibicokogi kacel kadi ki yikogi, gibibedo calo cet dyang ma guket ata i ngom. <verse eid="JER 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3" />Jo ducu me rok man marac ma gubwot, ma gibedo i kabedo kama yam aryemogi gucito iye, gibimitoni twara kono gito woko loyo ma gibedo kwo.” Man lok ma an Rwot me mony aye awaco.<verse eid="JER 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bal ki pwode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4" />Rwot owaca ni atit bot dano ni, “Ka dano gupoto piny, ci pe dok gia malo? Kace ngat mo ongak woko ki i yoo ma en pe tye kawoto cito iye, ci en pe loke dwogo cen? <verse eid="JER 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5" />Pingo jona kono ka gungak woko pi woro cal jogi ci gikwero dwogo cen bota nongo gimede ameda ki weko yona? Gumoko woko liking ilok me bwola, kun gikwero loke woko me dwogo cen bota. <verse eid="JER 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6" />Abedo katero ita kawinyo lokgi, ento gin pe guloko lok ma atir; dok dano ma ngut pi gin maracu ma en otimo pe, giloko kun giwaco ni, ‘An abalo onongo atimo gin ango marac.’ Ngat acel acel gire woto i yone kit ma iye mito, calo aguragura matye kangwec laro lweny. <verse eid="JER 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7" />Kadi winyo acebe bene ngeyo karene me dwogo cen; ki akuri, lakalagwec ki ogoro gigwoko karegi me binogi; ento jona gikwiya cik ducu ma yam amiyo. <verse eid="JER 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8" />Wutwero waco ningning ni, ‘Wan waryek, cik pa Rwot bene tye botwa’? Nen dong Lupwonycik ma pe gigene gutyeko loko cik woko ki cocgi, guloko odoko lok goba. <verse eid="JER 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9" />Lewic bimako luryeko, cwinygi bibale ci kimakogi woko. Nen, gutyeko kwero lok pa Rwot; ci kit ryeko ango ma dok gitye kwede? <verse eid="JER 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:12-15">Jer 6:12-15</ref></char></note>Pimeno abimiyo mon gi woko bot co mukene, ki potigi bot jo ma otayogi ki lweny, pien cake ki ikom jo matino o kwede wa ikom jo madito dano acel acel owor woko pi nongo lim me magoba i yo ma pe atir; cake ki ikom lunebi o kwede wa ikom ajwaki gin ducu gitiyo ki goba keken ma pe bene gigene. <verse eid="JER 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:10">13:10</ref></char></note> Gibedo katuku ki wang bur pa jona atuka macalo delkom ma opwac apwaca ma pe gucang woko liweng. Gin gimote ki mot me kuc ma kun giwaco ni, ‘Kuc, kuc,’ ma nongo kun kuc mo peke. <verse eid="JER 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12" />Tika yam lewic omako gin jona ikare ma gutiyo gin me kwer? Pe gire, lewic mo pe omakogi wa ki acel; dok pe gumiyo wanggi omyeno wa ki acel pi lewic. Pimeno gin bene kibipoto calo jo mukene ma gupoto; ikare ma abiketo can ikomgi pi pwodogi, ci gibitum woko ducu. Man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13" />Onongo amito guru jona, macalo lapur guru cam ma okayo ki i potone; ento jona gubedo calo olok ma nyige peke, ki nyig oduru bene peke iwi yat oduru; potegu bene ducu otwo woko, pimeno an dong amiyo gipinygi woko odoko gire lobo ma lurok aye bileyo.”<verse eid="JER 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14" />Jo pa Lubanga gupenyo ni, “Pingo pud dok wabedo mot? Wugure kacel wek wacitu i taun madito ma kirumu ki cel gogo wek wacitoyu wunu ki kunu pien Rwot Lubangawa dong oketo can ikomwa ni wato, en omiyowa bene pii matye iye kwir marac wamato, pien onongo dong wabalo ikome. <verse eid="JER 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15" />Wabedo kayenyo kuc, ento gin mo maber ma wanongo peke, ikare ma onongo myero wacang iye, wanongo gin makelo lworo keken. <verse eid="JER 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16" />Yweyo me kiniga pa aguragura pa lukworwa winye wa i Dan; ka twoni aguraguragi pa lukworwa okok ci lobo ducu yenge. Lukworwa gubino ka balo lobowa woko kacel ki jami ducu matye iye, pi jwero taunwa madito woko kacel ki jo ma gibedo iye.”<verse eid="JER 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17" />An Rwot awaco kuman ni, “Nen atye kacwalo twol, twol uyu ma kwire rac ma pe kitwero bangone ki yat, ci gibikayowu malit.”<verse eid="JER 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cwercwiny pa Jeremia pi lutugi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18" />Can ma atye kwede dong dit ma pe romo cang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:18">atye ki two madit me cwercwiny mada i cwinya.<verse eid="JER 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19" />Kong iwiny, koko pa jona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">oromo i lobo woko ducu, kun gikok ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“Rwot mono pe i Cion?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">Itamoni Rwot me taunwa me Cion mono dong pe iye?”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 8:19" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">Rwot ma lalocgi ogamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“Pingo kono wungeto cwinya ki cal jogiwu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">Pingo wun wumiyo kiniga omaka pi wun me woro lubanga pa lurok mogo ma pe gikonyogu?”<verse eid="JER 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20" />Dano gikok ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:20">“Kare me kac dong okato woko, ki kare me oro bene dong ogik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:20">ento pud pe kilarowa.”<verse eid="JER 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21" />Cwinya rem calo bur odet iye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:21">pien jona dong kiketo bur woko ikomgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:21">akumu pi can, ma cwercwiny dong obwoyo koma woko.<verse eid="JER 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22" />Yat me cango dano dong pe tye i Gilead bo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Daktar kono pe kunu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Pingo kono pe gicango jona?<verse eid="JER 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1" />Ka twere onongo myero wiya obed wang it me pii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">ki wanga nongo myero obed</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">wang it ma gunye ki pig wang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">wek omiya abed ka kok dyeceng ki dyewor benebene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">pi jona ma dong kinekogi wokoni.<verse eid="JER 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2" />Onongo amito ni kono nene kabedo mo obed tye ma abedo iye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">macalo ka gony pa luwot i tim aroo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">kono aweko jona ci acito woko kamabor kwedegi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">Gin ducu pe lugen ikom Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">gin ducu lutim tim me gobagoba.<verse eid="JER 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3" />Gin kare ducu gitye ma guyube woko me loko lok goba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">bedo labongo gen aye dong oloyo lobo woko ma kaka tim me ada.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 9:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">An Rwot awaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">“Jona gitimo gin marac teretere, dok bene pe gingeya macalo Lubangagi.”<verse eid="JER 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4" />Dano acel acel myero ogwoke ikom lawote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">ki bene pe myero ogen omine!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">Pien omego acel acel dong obedo labwola calo Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">dok dano acel acel bene kwoto lawote.<verse eid="JER 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5" />Ngat acel acel bwolo lawote, dok dano mo ma loko lok ada pe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">dong gutyeko pwonyo lebgi woko me loko lok goba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">gimede ameda kitimo bal dok bene pe giromo ngut pi timo bal.<verse eid="JER 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6" />Timgi me unu dano tye kamede ameda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:6">ki timgi me loko lok goba bene mede ameda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:6">dok bene gikwera woko ni pe gingeya, ni an Lubanga.<verse eid="JER 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7" />Ma omiyo an Rwot me mony awaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">“Nen, abitemogi macalo nyonyo ma kiliyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">Jona dong gutimo gin marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">gin ango kono dong ma dok atwero tiyo kwedgi?<verse eid="JER 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8" />Lebgi obedo calo atero ma lake ki kwir marac;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">gin giloko lok me bwola keken.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Dano acel acel loko lok mamit bot lawote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">ento ki i cwinye nongo tye ki yub ma okano wek eneke woko.<verse eid="JER 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9" />Itamoni pe abiketo can ikomgi pi tim magi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:9">Pe abiculu kwor ikom rok macalo man?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:9">Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10" />An Jeremia dok awaco ni, “Wek dong akok pi godi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">dok abikok kun cwinya cwer pi oletgu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">pien dong gutwo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">ngat mo ma woto kun ngolo ki iye dong peke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Koko pa dyangi bene pe dong winye kunu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">winyo ki lee tim ducu dong guringo gurwenyo woko, dong gipeke matwal.”<verse eid="JER 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11" />Ci Rwot dok owaci, “Abiloko Jerucalem doko wi obur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">kabedo ma too aye bedo iye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">taun madito me Juda ducu dong bidoko tim aroo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">kama ngat mo pe bedo iye.”<verse eid="JER 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12" />Ci apenye ni, “Rwot gin ango ma omiyo lobo bibale woko dong obur ma ngat mo pe twero wok ki iye? Dong dano mene maryek ma iwaco ni etwero niang lok man? Rwot in mono oloko lok magi bot anga wek otit loke bot jo mukene?”<verse eid="JER 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13" />Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Man ducu otime pien jona gubwoto cika ma nene amiyo botgini, dok bene pe guwinyo loka, dok bene pe gubedo kun gilubu cika. <verse eid="JER 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14" />Ma ka timo meno, gin gumiyo ngutgi obedo nwang, ci gubedo ka woro jogi Baal mapatpat, kit macalo kwarigi opwonyogi kwede. <verse eid="JER 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15" />Pimeno an Rwot me mony, ma an Lubanga pa Icrael, awaco kuman ni, ‘Nen, abimiyo jo magi gibicamo pot dek makec macalo yat roka, dok bene gimato pii ma iye ki kwir. <verse eid="JER 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16" />Abikeyogi woko ikin lurok ma gin kikomgi pe gingeyo, kadi wa kwarigi bene yam pe gungeyo; ci abicwalo dul mony lubu korgi ki pala lucwan nio wang ma atyekogi woko liweng.’”<verse eid="JER 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Jerucalem gukok pi kony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17" />An Rwot me mony awaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">“Kong wutam loki, ci wulwong mon ma gingeyo wer kokogu wek gubin;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">wucwal loke wek wulwong mon makwiri gubin.”<verse eid="JER 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18" />Ci dano gugamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">“Wek gurune gubin oyotoyot ci guwoo ki koko ikomwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">wek pig wangwa omol piny ma cito lipya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">ma del wangwa bene odyak woko ki pig wang.”<verse eid="JER 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19" />Kong wuwiny dwon me koko ma a ki i Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">“Dong watum woko do!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Lewic dong omakowa woko marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">pien dong wa a woko ki i lobowa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">gangiwa bene dong kijwero woko liweng do!”<verse eid="JER 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20" />Ci an Jeremia awaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">“Wun mon, dong wuwiny lok ma Rwot aye owaco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">wucik itwu wek wuwiny lok ma oa ki idoge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Wupwony anyirawu ki koko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">dok ngat acel acel opwony lawote ki wer lyel.<verse eid="JER 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21" />To dong obino woko ikomwa ki iwang dirica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">ci odonyo woko i gang kerwa ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">oneko lutino woko ducu ki i dye yoo ki awobegu ki i dye bar.”<verse eid="JER 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22" />Ci Rwot owaca ni atit kit man ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">“Kom jo ma oto kibikeyo woko ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">kibikeyogi woko calo odur cet dyang ma guket ata i olet,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">calo wit ngano ma lukac gukayo guweko odong i poto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">ma ngat mo dong pe ma bicoko tero paco.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">Man en aye gin ma Rwot owaca ni atitiwu.”<verse eid="JER 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23" />An Rwot awaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">“Dano maryek myero pe onyate ki ryekone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">kadi ki dano matek bene pe myero onyate ki tekone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">dano ma olony bene pe myero onyate ki lonyone.<verse eid="JER 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:31">1 Kor 1:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 10:17">2 Kor 10:17</ref></char>
    </note>Ento ka ngat ma mito nyate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">myero onyate ni eniang dok engeyo an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">ni an a Rwot ma atye katiyo gin ma nyutu mar ma pe loke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">anyutu bene ngolo kop atir ki bedo ki kit ma atir i lobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">Magi gin aye jami ma cwinya mito.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25" />An Rwot awaco ni, “Nen nino tye kabino, en aye kare ma abiketo iye can ikom jo ma kilirogi ki i del komgi ki woko ento pe ki i cwinygi. <verse eid="JER 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26" />Abiketo can ikom jo Ejipt, jo Juda, jo Edom, jo Ammon, jo Moab ki jo ducu ma gibedo i tim aroo ma gilyelo yer wigi woko dong macego; Jo magi ducu gin gulire ikomgi ento pe gigwoko gicike ma lanyute obedo lire me komgi kitmeno; rok magi ducu pe gulire ki i cwinygi, kadi ki jo me ot pa Icrael bene pe gulire ki i cwinygi.”<verse eid="JER 9:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10" />
  <para style="s1">Wor cal jogi ki woro Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1" />Wun jo Icrael wuwiny lok ma an Lubanga atye ka lokone botwu. <verse eid="JER 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2" />An Rwot awaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">“Pe wulub kit me woro lubanga pa lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">dok cwinywu bene pe myero obale ka wuneno lanyut mo tye i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">kadi bed rok mukenegu cwinygi obale woko pire.<verse eid="JER 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3" />Pien kit ma lurok woro ki lubangagi obedo gin me bwolo keken ma pe ada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:3">Gitongo yat gireto woko piny ki i bunga, ci lapac payo woko maber ki koyone nyo ki jami mukene me pac.<verse eid="JER 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4" />Ci ludiro gideyo kome woko ki ryal nyo jabu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:4">gikwanyo nyonyo giguru ki cumari wek ocung matek liking ma pe poto woko piny.<verse eid="JER 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5" />Cal lubangaginu obedo calo wir yat ma kicibo ocung i poto okwer pi ryemo winyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">pe bene gitwero lok; kitingogi mege atinga, pien pe gitwero wot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Pe ilworgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">pe gitwero timo gin mo marac ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">dok bene pe gitye ki twero mo me timo gin mo maber.”<verse eid="JER 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6" />Pe tye lubanga mo macalo in, ai Rwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:6">in idit, dok nyingi bene dit dok tek mada.<verse eid="JER 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 15:4">Niy 15:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Anga mono ma pe myero olwori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">in i Rwot maloyo rok ducu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">In imyero me alwora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Pe tye ngat mo macalo in</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">ikin luryeko ducu me rok mapatpat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">kadi ki ite kergi ducu.<verse eid="JER 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8" />Danogi ducu ma gitamo ni luryeko gubedo calo jo ma luming dok wigi bene oding.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:8">En bao ma giyubu pi cal lubangani tika pwonyogi ki gin mo?<verse eid="JER 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9" />Cal lubangagi kidero kome woko ki ryal ma kidino woko ma gikelo ki i Tarcic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">ki jabu ma gikelo ki i Upaj.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Gin ducu gubedo tic pa lupac</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">ki dok bene tic ma latet jabu otiyo ki cinge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">ginarukagi obedo makwar ki dok lamarlamar;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">gin ducu gubedo tic ma jo ma ludiro tic aye gutiyo.<verse eid="JER 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10" />Ento in, Rwot, aye Lubanga ma ada, in Lubanga makwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">dok bene in aye rwot mabedo nakanaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Ka ce akemo omaki, ci lobo ducu yenge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">rok ducu pe twero ciro kinigani.<verse eid="JER 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11" />(Wun jo Icrael wubiwaco botgi ni lubanga mogogu ma pe ocweyo polo ki loboni kibijwerogi woko. Pe dong gibibedo tye i kabedo mo iwi lobo ki ite polo.)<verse eid="JER 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wer me pako Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12" />Rwot oketo lobo ki twerone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:12">dok ocibo lobo ocung matek pi ryekone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:12">ki pi niang matut ma en tye kwede omiyo oyaro polo woko.<verse eid="JER 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13" />Ikare ma dwone omor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">pii otwage matek ki i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">omiyo lupuu duny kun a ki i agiki lobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">En miyo lutkot wil ka kot cwer,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">dok bene miyo yamo kodo kun a ki iot kano jamine.<verse eid="JER 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14" />Ka dano guneno magi ducu ci gidoko luming dok bene wigi oding cut;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">lewic omako lutet jabu pi cal jogigi ma gutiyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">pien cal joginegu ducu pe gubedo lubanga ma ada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">dok bene pe gitye ki kit kwo mo i igi.<verse eid="JER 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15" />Konygi peke, kitiyogi mere me acaya keken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:15">ikare ma Rwot bibino kaketo can ikomgi kibibalogi ci gitum woko.<verse eid="JER 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16" />Ento Lubanga pa Yakobo pe obedo calo cal jogi magi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">pien en aye ma oketo jami ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">dok bene en oyero jo Icrael wek gubed jone kikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">nyinge kilwongo ni Rwot me mony.<verse eid="JER 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kibitero dano i opii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17" />Wun jo Jerucalem, ma mony dong orumuwu wokoni, wuting yecwu woko ki i ngom. <verse eid="JER 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18" />An Rwot awaco kuman ni, “Nen, kombedi dong abibayowu woko ki i lobo man calo lalingling; dok abimiyo kibinginyowu woko ma bene obibedo ki lwak arem madwong wang ma wuwinyo lite.”<verse eid="JER 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19" />Jo me Jerucalem gikok ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">“Kiketo ret woko ikomwa marac kuman!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Wang burwa tye marac mada ma pe bicang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Yam watamoni man en aye gin ma onongo watwero ciro, kara pe!<verse eid="JER 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20" />Kemawa dong kibalo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">ki tol ducu ma onongo kitweyo kwede dong kicodo woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">lutinowa dong guwekowa woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">gin ducu dong gipe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Ngat mo pe ma odong ma myero ogur kemawa odoco kakare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">pe tye ngat mo ma myero otwe bongo kicikawa malo.”<verse eid="JER 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21" />Ci an Jeremia agamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">“Lutela dong gudoko luming woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">pe gipenyo Rwot wek otelgi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">Meno aye gin ma omiyo yam pe gubedo maber;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">lwakgi ducu dong guket woko ata.<verse eid="JER 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22" />Wuwiny! Wo mo tye kabino!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">Twon gin ma mor tye ka kati bino ki i lobo ma yo tung kumalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">dul monye bino me jwero taun madito me Juda woko wek odong obur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">kama too aye bedo iye.”<verse eid="JER 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23" />Ai Rwot, angeyoni pe tye dano mo maloyo kwone kene nio i agikine;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:23">pe tye ngat mo matye ki twero me loyo kwone.<verse eid="JER 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24" />Ai Rwot, pwony lwaki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:24">ento pe iwek pwonye obed magwar tutwal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:24">Pe ipwonywa ki kinigani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:24">miyo wato watum woko ducu.<verse eid="JER 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25" />Myero kiniga omaki ikom rok ma pe gingeyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">ki ikom lurok ma pe giworo in.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Dong gin gutyeko likwayo pa Yakobo woko liweng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">dok bene gubalo lobowa woko odong obur.<verse eid="JER 10:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia ki gicike pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1" />Rwot oloko ki Jeremia kun waco ni, <verse eid="JER 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2" />“Winy lok ma mako gicike man. Tit bot jo Juda ki jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem ni <verse eid="JER 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3" />an a Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, dong atyeko ceno dano ma pe winyo dok ma pe lubu lok ma mako gicike man. <verse eid="JER 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4" />En gicike mayam aketo ki kwariwu ikare ma akwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt, en lobo ma obedo calo rukmac ikomgi. Ikare meno awaco botgi ni guwiny loka dok gutii gin ducu mayam acikogi ni gutii. Atito botgi ni ka gulubu ci gibibedo jona ki an bene abibedo Lubangagi. <verse eid="JER 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5" />Kun an bene abicobo kwong ma akwongo inyim kwarigi ni abimiyo botgi lobo man maber ma ceko cam mabup, kit macalo gitye iye wa onyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 11:5">Ci an Jeremia agamo ni, “Wek obed kumeno, Rwot.”<verse eid="JER 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6" />Rwot dok owaco bota ni, “Tit lok magi ducu i taun madito me Juda, ki i dye yoo me Jerucalem. Tit loka kunu, kun iwaco bot lwak ni guwiny lok ma mako gicike man dok bene gulub kun gitiyo. <verse eid="JER 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7" />Ikare ma akwanyo kwariwu woko ki i lobo Ejipt, acikogi matek, kun bene abedo ka cikogi teretere, nio wa onyo, kun awaco botgi ni gulub loka. <verse eid="JER 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8" />Ento gin pe gulubu dok pe guciko itgi me winyo loka. Ma ka timo meno, gin ducu gumede ameda ki bedo jo ma tokgi tek marac. Ma omiyo acobo lok me gicike man woko ducu ikomgi, mayam acikogi ni gutii, ento pe gutiyoni.”<verse eid="JER 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9" />Rwot dok owaco bota ni, “Jo Juda kacel ki jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem gitye kajemo woko ikoma. <verse eid="JER 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10" />Guloke gudok cen katimo bal pa kwarigi ma gukwero winyo loka wokoni; gubedo kalubu lubanga mukene kun giworogi bene. Jo me ot pa Icrael ki jo me ot pa Juda dong guturu gicikena woko mayam acike kwede ki kwarigini. <verse eid="JER 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11" />Pimeno an Rwot awaco kuman ni atye kakelo gin marac wek aket ikomgi ma pe gitwero loyo ki iye wa ki acel. Ka gibikok bota pi kony, an pe abiwinyo kokogi. <verse eid="JER 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12" />Ci jo Juda kacel ki jo ma bedo i Jerucalem gibicito gibikok bot lubanga mayam gubedo ka wango gitum botgini, ento lubanga magi pe bitwero larogi ikare me can. <verse eid="JER 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13" />Pien lubangagi dong gudoko pol ma guporo wel taun gi madito, gin jo Juda; ki jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem bene dong guyubu lwak keno tyer mapol ata kama giwango iye gitum me lewic bot jok Baal, marom ki wel yoo matye i dye taun gi me Jerucalem.<verse eid="JER 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14" />Pimeno Jeremia, pe ibed ka lega, pe bene ipid kweda pi lwak man. Ka inen ce gitye i can ka gukok bota pi kony, an pe abiwinyo kokogi. <verse eid="JER 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15" />Jona ma amaroni gitye katimo tim kipyeda. Dong gitye ki kit twero ango ma weko gibedo i oda? Gitamoni tyero lee me gitum ki kwongo kwong mogo ma gicike kwede atata twero gengo can woko me poto ikomgi? Gitamo ni gitwero bwot i yo ma kit man? <verse eid="JER 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16" />Yam alwongogi ni yat jeituni ma pote oluk madwong, ma nyige bene nen mwonya adada; ento abiwango pote woko ki mac ma yamone mor mager, dok abituru jange woko ducu.<verse eid="JER 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17" />An Rwot me mony mayam apito jo Icrael ki jo Juda, macalo yat jeitunini, kombedi dong awaco ni abiketo gin marac ikomgi. Gin gukelo gigi can man ikomgi pirgi ken gi pien gutimo gin marac. Gungeto cwinya omiyo kiniga omaka ikomgi pi wango gitum bot jok Baal.”<verse eid="JER 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kipiro lok pi neko Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18" />Rwot omiyo angeyo dok aniang lok ma lukwora gupiro, ki gin marac ma onongo gimito timo ikoma. <verse eid="JER 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19" />Ento an onongo abedo calo latin romo mamwol ma kitero woko kanekone, onongo pe angeyoni gupiro lok me timo gin marac ikoma. Gubedo kawaco ni, “Watong wunu yat man waret woko piny wa ki nyige ducu; waneke woko wek ngat mo pe dong opo ikome matwal i loboni.” <verse eid="JER 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20" />Lacen an Jeremia alego ni, “Ai Rwot me mony, in langolkop ma ngolo kop atir, dok itemo tam pa dano ki gin ma giparo ki i cwinygi. Wek anen ka iculu kwor ikom lwak man, pien an dong atyeko keto loka woko ducu i cingi.”<verse eid="JER 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21" />Pimeno Rwot owaco kuman, ikom jo Anatot, ma onongo gimito neko an woko kun giwaca ni kace amede ki tito lok inying Rwot ci gibineka woko. <verse eid="JER 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22" />Rwot me mony owaco lok ikomgi ni, “Nen, abiketo can ikomgi. Awobegi ducu kibinekogi woko i lweny ki pala lucwan; lutinogi ducu bito woko ki kec. <verse eid="JER 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23" />Ngat mo ma bidong bibedo peke ka kare oromo, en kare ma dong amoko me keto iye can ikom jo Anatot.”<verse eid="JER 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lapeny ma Jeremia openyo ki Rwot</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1" />Ai Rwot, ka apido kwedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">ci anongoni in giri loki tye atir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Ento myero olo twal apenyi ikom lok ma mako ngolo kop atir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Pingo jo maracu gibedo maber dok gilony?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Pingo lutim aranyi kono gicobo tiyo gin ma cwinygi mito?<verse eid="JER 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2" />In iye gin gibedo maber</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">macalo yat ma kipitogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">ci giroyo lwitgi donyo i ngom gidongo dok ginyako nyiggi bene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Kare ducu gin giloko lok maber ikomi ki dogi keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">ento ki i cwinygi nongo gitye kamabor ma pe giparo piri.<verse eid="JER 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3" />Ento in Rwot, ingeya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">dok in ineno gin ma atiyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">dok itemo tama pi neno kit ma amari kwede.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Ywa jo maracuni woko ki tek</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">macalo romi me aneka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Kogi woko iketgi pat nio ka nino me nekogi oromo.<verse eid="JER 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4" />Rwot, lobowa mono bibedo ma otwo pi kare marom mene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">dok lum ducu ma i tim bibedo ma oner pi kare marom mene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Lee ki winyo gitye ka to woko bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">pi tim maracu pa jo ma gibedo i lobo man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Magi ducu tye katime pien dano gitye ka waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">“Rwot pe neno kit ma watye kabedo kwede.”<verse eid="JER 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5" />Ci Rwot owaca ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">“Jeremia, kace iol woko ki ngwec ma kun ipyem ki dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">ci ibingwec i pyem ki aguragura ningning?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">Kace iyoke i poto piny ki kamaleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">ci dong ibikwo ningning ka itye i tim ikin yadi mukade i dog kulu Jordan?<verse eid="JER 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6" />Kadi wa omegini, ma gin jo me ot pa woru kikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">gin bene gutimo tim aranyi ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">gin guribe ka lweny ikomi bene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Pe igen gi, kadi bed giloko lok maber me larem boti.”<verse eid="JER 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cwiny Rwot ocwe pi jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7" />Rwot waca ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">“An dong aweko jona woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">dong akwero rok mayam ayerogini woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">dong atyeko miyo jona ma amaroni woko i cing lukworgi.<verse eid="JER 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8" />Jona ma ayerogini dong guloko an adoko lakworgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">gumor ikoma ki koko matek calo labwor matye i bunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">pimeno omiyo dong adaggi.<verse eid="JER 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9" />Jona ma ayerogini dong gudoko calo winyo ma okwateng orumugi woko me aneka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Wulwong lee tim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">wek gubin guribe kacam kacel.<verse eid="JER 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10" />Luker pa lurok dong gutyeko balo poto oloka woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">gunyono dul lobo ma kipoka woko piny ki tyen gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">guloko dul lobona ma yomo cwinyani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">odoko tim ma iye odong nono.<verse eid="JER 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11" />Gumiyo dong odoko tim ma konye peke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">odoko tim ma iye odong nono inyima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">Lobone ducu dong kibalo woko odong nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">ento ngat mo ma paro pire peke.<verse eid="JER 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12" />Jo ma luyak madong gubino ka yakowa gupongo wi cere ducu matye i tim aroo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">Dong an Rwot atyeko cwalo lweny me tyeko lobowu woko ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">ngat mo pe ma bitwero bedo ki kuc.<verse eid="JER 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13" />Jona yam gucoyo ngano, ento gukayo okutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">gubedo katiyo tic matek guolo komgi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">ento pe gulimo iye gin mo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Lewic bimakogi pien gin ma gucoyo ducu pe ocek</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">pi kinigana magwar.”<verse eid="JER 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cike pa Rwot pi jo ma gibedo kanget jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Atye ki lok mo ma myero awac bot jo ma gibedo kanget jo Icrael ma dong gubalo lobo ma amiyo bot jona jo Icrael woko. Nen, abikwanyo rok man woko ki i lobogi, dok bene abilaro jo Juda akwanyogi ki ikin gi. <verse eid="JER 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15" />Ento ka dong akwanyogi woko, ci kica bimaka ikomgi. Abikelo rok acel acel adwoko cen i lobone dok i kabedone kikome. <verse eid="JER 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16" />Dok ka kare biromo ma rok magi gibipwonyo kit niye me dini pa jona ki cwinygi ducu, dok kun gibikwongo ki nyinga ni, ‘Macalo Rwot tye makwoni,’ kit macalo yam gupwonyo jona me kwong ki nying jok Baal, ci miyo gin ducu dong gibirube gibidoko dano acel ki jona ci gibibedo maber. <verse eid="JER 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17" />Ento kace tye rok mo pe biwinyo loka, ci abiputugi woko ki lwite ducu ci abalo woko licwic, man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13" />
  <para style="s1">Carolok ikom latebongo ma kiruku i pyer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1" />Rwot owaca kuman ni, “Cit iwil bongo camanini me aruka i pyer, ci itwe i pyeri, ento pe ilut i pii.” <verse eid="JER 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2" />Ci acito awilo bongo me pyer kun alubu lok ma Rwot otitani, ci aruku i pyera. <verse eid="JER 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3" />Rwot dok owaco bota tyen me aryone ni, <verse eid="JER 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4" />“Kwany bongo me pyer ma nene iwilo ci iruku i pyerini, ci ia icit i dog kulu Euprate, ci icit ikan woko kunu ikin got ma obar.” <verse eid="JER 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5" />Ci aa acito akano woko inget kulu Euprate kit macalo Rwot ocika kwede. <verse eid="JER 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6" />Inge nino mapol Rwot dok owaco bota ni, “A malo icit i kulu Euprate ci ikwany bongo ca me aruka mayam aciki ni icit ikan kununi.” <verse eid="JER 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7" />Cutcut aa acito i kulu Euprate ci akwinyo ngom, ci akwanyo bongo aruka me pyer ki i kabedo kama yam onongo akano iyeni. Ci nen, anongo ni bongo ca dong obale woko, pe dok ber pi gin mo.<verse eid="JER 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8" />Ka lacen Rwot dok pud oloko bota aye kun waca ni, <verse eid="JER 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9" />“Man aye kit ma abityeko kwede wake pa Juda ki wake madit ma Jerucalem tye kwede. <verse eid="JER 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10" />Lwak magi marac ma gukwero winyo loka wokoni, ma gumiyo ngutgi obedo nwang kun gilubu gigi gin ma cwinygi mito, ma gubedo ki lubanga mukene kun giworogi, gibibedo calo bongo pyer man ma pe dong ber me aruka. <verse eid="JER 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11" />Kit macalo bongo me atweya i pyer moko kwede ikom dano, kitmeno bene aketo jo me ot pa Icrael ki jo me ot pa Juda aridogi woko ikoma matek liking, wek gubed lwak ma gibikelo nying maber bota, ma bene gibimiyo dano gipaka dok gimiya deyo, ento gin onongo pe gitwero winyo loka wa ki acel. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agulu kongo bwino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12" />Rwot owaco bota kuman ni, “Jeremia, in itit lok man bot jo Icrael ni agulu acel acel bipong woko ki kongo bwino. Ci gin bigamo ni, ‘Itamoni wan pe wangeyo ni agulu acel acel myero kipong iye woko ki kongo bwino.’ <verse eid="JER 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13" />Ci lacen in ibiwaco botgi ni Rwot bimiyo jo ducu ma gibedo i lobo man gibimato kongo bwino ci gidoko lumero: luker ma gibedo iwi komker pa Daudi, ajwaki, lunebi kacel ki jo ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem. <verse eid="JER 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14" />Abicanyo ngat man ki lawote, wego ki lutinogi kacel, man an Rwot ma awaco. Pe abiparo pirgi, pe abiweko gibedo kwo, kadi wa kica bene pe bimaka ikomgi, wek atyekogi woko.”<verse eid="JER 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremia ociko jo Juda pi wake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15" />Wun jo Icrael, wuter itwu wuwiny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:15">pe myero wubed ki wake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:15">pien Rwot dong otyeko lok.<verse eid="JER 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16" />Wumii deyo bot Rwot Lubangawu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">ma pud peya okelo colpiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">dok ma peya wucako cato iwi godi ikare ma piny ribiribi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">ma pud peya nongo oloke odoko mutu macol licuc.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">En lengpiny ma nongo wutye ka genoneni.<verse eid="JER 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17" />Kace pe wubiwinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">ci abikok lalingling i mung pi wakewu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">abikok matek nongo pig wanga mol cito piny lipya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">pien jo pa Rwot dong kiterogi woko macalo opii.<verse eid="JER 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18" />Rwot owaco bot Jeremia ni, “Tit bot rwot gin ki mine ni gua woko ki i komkergi gubin i kabedo mapiny, pien lalukanagi maber tutwali dong opoto woko piny ki iwigi. <verse eid="JER 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19" />Taun gi me Negeb ducu dong kimonyo kirumugi woko dyere, pe tye ngat mo matwero kato ki kunu. Jo Juda ducu dong kiterogi woko i lobo ma pe meggi, gin ducu dong kiterogi woko i opii.”<verse eid="JER 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20" />“Wun jo Jerucalem wunen! Lukworwu tye kabino kun gia ki i lobo ma yo tung kumalo! Ka man bitime, ci gin ango ma bitime ikom jowu ma gibeco calo lwak romi ki dyegi ma onongo kimiyogi i cingwu ni wugwokgini? <verse eid="JER 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21" />Ibiwaco gin ango ka jo mayam in kikomi aye ipwonyogi ni wek gubed luremi, aye kiketogi me loyi? Arem matek pe biketo komi woko, calo arem pa dako matye ka nywal? <verse eid="JER 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22" />Dong kace ipenye ni, ‘Pingo gin ma kit man obino ikoma, ma omiyo bongo ma i pyera bene kiyeco woko, ka dok ginywara kwedegu?’” Man otime pien onongo bali dong rac ma okato kare. <verse eid="JER 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23" />Laetiopia mo tika twero loko rangi me del kome, nyo kwac bene twero loko rangi ma ikomeni ma okwicokwiconi woko? Ka onongo tye kitmeno, kono onongo wun jo ma wungiyo ki timo gin marac kekeni dong wupwonye me tiyo gin matye atir. <verse eid="JER 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24" />Rwot bikeyowu woko calo cuci ma yamo kolo ki i tim aroo ci bayo woko cen. <verse eid="JER 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25" />Man aye gin ma kibipoko ki wun, dul ma dong kityeko pimone woko pirwu, man aye gin ma Rwot dong otyeko yubu, pien wiwu dong otyeko wil woko ikome kun wubedo ka woro lubanga mukene ki geno lok goba keken. <verse eid="JER 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26" />Rwot kikome aye ma biwalo bongiwu woko ki i pyerwu ci umu ki wangwu, miyo munerowu nen woko kamaleng. <verse eid="JER 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27" />En dong otyeko neno gin me kwer ma wutimo, tim me abor ki tim me woro lubanga mukenegu, ma wubedo katimone iwi cere i dye tim. Can iwiwu, wun jo Jerucalem! Wubilonye wudoko leng awene ka?<verse eid="JER 13:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14" />
  <para style="s1">Two pa pii ki i lobo pi kare malac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1" />Rwot owaco bot Jeremia pi two pa pii ni,<verse eid="JER 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2" />“Jo Juda gitye ka kumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">taune madito ducu bene tye kabale woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">Jo ducu ma iye gubutu piny i ngom ki twon cwercwiny mo ma pe wace;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">jo ma i Jerucalem gitye ka kok matek adada kun gikwayo kony.<verse eid="JER 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3" />Luditogi me awora gicwalo luticgi ka twomo pii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">gicito iwang piigi, ento pe ginongo, pien wang pii ducu gutwo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">gidwogo ki gin latwom piigi ma nongo iye nono.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Lewic makogi dok bene alee twodogi matek</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">omiyo giumu wigi woko auma.<verse eid="JER 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4" />Pien lobo dong obale woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">kit macalo kot dong pe obedo ka cwer i loboni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">lewic omako lupur mada ma nongo cwinygi cwer ma giumu wigi auma.<verse eid="JER 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5" />Kadi wa megi til matye i tim bene gibwoto lutinogi ma gunywalo woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:5">pien lum mo ma myero gucam peke.<verse eid="JER 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6" />Kana me timgu gicung iwi cere ma otwo ligwek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">kun gingamo doggi malac me yweyo calo too;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">wanggi olwal woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">pien lum mo ma omyero gucam bene peke.<verse eid="JER 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7" />Jona gikok bota ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">‘Kadi bed balwa dotowa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">ai Rwot konywa kit macalo yam iciko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Wabedo ka loke wabwoti woko tyen mapol;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">watyeko bene timo balgu ikomi.<verse eid="JER 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8" />In keken aye ngat ma jo Icrael gigeno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">in aye ma ilarowa ikare ma nongo watye i can.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">Pingo ibedo macalo larok i lobowa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">dok macalo lawot ma yenyo kabutu?<verse eid="JER 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9" />Pingo ibedo macalo dano ma wiye onyobe woko ma pe ngeyo gin ma myero etim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">calo ngat mo ma en oteka ma pe twero laro dano ki i mony?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Ento adada in Rwot itye kwedwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">dok wan bene kilwongowa ki nyingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">pimeno pe ibwotwa woko.’”<verse eid="JER 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10" />Rwot owaco kuman ikom jone ni, “Yam wun wumaro wot atata kitmeno, ma pe wujuku tyenwu ma wutenya woko kun wulak wucito ka woro cal mogo ata gu; pimeno omiyo pe dong abijolowu. Kombedi dong abipo ikom balwu ci abiketo can ikomwu pi balwu.”<verse eid="JER 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11" />Rwot owaco bota ni, “Pe myero ilega ni an akony lwak man. <verse eid="JER 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12" />Kadi bed girii kec, pe abiwinyo koko ma gikok kwede bota pi kony, dok kadi bed gutyer gitum awanga ki gityer me moko kwon, pe abigamogi; ento abinekogi atyekogi woko liweng ki pala lucwan, ki kec malit ma poto i lobo, wa ki two gemogu.”<verse eid="JER 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13" />Ci awaco ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga, nen lunebi onongo dong gutyeko tito bot lwak man woko ni, ‘Pe kibinekowu ki pala lucwan, dok bene kec mo pe bipoto i lobowu, ento Rwot bimiyo botwu kuc me ada mabedo nakanaka i kabedo man.’”<verse eid="JER 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14" />Ento Rwot odoka iye kun waca ni, “Lunebi gitye katito lok goba keken ki nyinga; an pe acwalogi, pe acikogi, dok bene pe aloko kwedgi. Gitye katito botwu ginanyuta me goba ki tyeto tyet ma konye peke, kun gibwolo dano abwola ki tam ma gutamo pirgi ken gi. <verse eid="JER 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15" />Pimeno an Rwot awaco lok ikom lunebi ma gitito lok inyinga kadi bed an aye pe acwalogi, ma giwaco ni, ‘Mony mo peke ki kec madit bene pe bibino ikom lobo man wa ki acel.’ Ento an awaco ni lunebi magi kibinekogi woko ki pala lucwan kacel ki kec bene. <verse eid="JER 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16" />Jo ma gin gubedo katito lok botgi bene kibibologi woko i dye yoo me Jerucalem, ma nongo kinekogi ki pala lucwan kacel ki kec, pien ngat mo pe ma biyikogi. Man bitime ikomgi ducu, ikom mon gi, lutino awobegi, ki anyiragi, pien abimiyo gineno can pi timgi maracuni.”<verse eid="JER 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17" />Ci Rwot ocika ni atit cwercwiny ma mera bot dano kun awaco botgi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">“Wek pig wanga omol oony i kora dyeceng ki dyewor benebene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">wek pig wanga pe ocok woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">pien jona kityeko goyogi woko ki twon bur madit adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">ma kiketo ret woko ikomgi marac atika.<verse eid="JER 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18" />Ka acito woko i tim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">ci anongo jo ma kinekogi ki pala lucwan dwong ata!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Dok ka adonyo i taun madit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">ci aneno lwak dano mapatpat ma kec obwoyogi matek!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Pien lunebi kacel ki ajwaki giwoto kun gitiyo ticgi i lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">kun pe gitye ki ngec mo.”<verse eid="JER 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwak gubako doggi bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19" />Rwot, in dong mono i kwero Juda woko matwal ce?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Cwinyi bene dong ocido woko ikom Cion bo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Pingo dong i pwodowa kuman ma pe dong waromo cang?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Wabedo kayenyo kuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">ento gin mo maber ma wanongo peke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">ikare ma myero wacang iye wanongo gin makelo lworo keken.<verse eid="JER 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20" />Ai Rwot, wan dong wangeyo gin maracu ma wabedo katimone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:20">kadi wa bal pa kwariwa ducu bene wangeyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:20">pien ada, wan wabalo ikomi.<verse eid="JER 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21" />Pi dit me nyingi, ai Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">pe iwek cwinyi ocid woko ikomwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">dok bene pe ikel lewic ikom Jerucalem ma en aye taun madit ma komkeri me deyoni tye iye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">Po pirwa, pe i tur gicikeni woko kwedwa.<verse eid="JER 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22" />Tika tye kit lubanga mo ikin lubanga me gobagoba me rok ducu matwero miyo kot cwer?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Nyo polo kono twero miyo kot mo ngido i lobo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Pe in aye ma itiyo magi ducu, ai Rwot Lubangawa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Wan ducu wageno in,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">pien in aye ma itiyo jami magi ducu.<verse eid="JER 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15" />
  <para style="s1">Can ma Rwot biketo ikom Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:11-14">Nia 32:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:13-19">Wel 14:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:5-9">1 Cam 7:5-9</ref></char>
    </note>Lacen Rwot owaca ni, “Kadi bed Moses ki Camuel onongo kono kong gucung inyima kun gibako doggi ka gilega, kono onongo kica mo pe omaka ikom lwak man wa ki acel. Wek jo Juda gua woko ki inyima gucit cen! <verse eid="JER 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:10">Niy 13:10</ref></char></note>Kace inen gupenyo ka kwene ma myero gucit iye, ci wuwac botgi ni an Rwot awaco botgi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">‘Jo ma omyero guto ki two gemo gibito ki two gemo, meno en aye ka ma gibicito iye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">jo ma omyero guto i dog lweny gibito i dog lweny kun kinekogi woko ki pala lucwan, meno en aye ka ma gibicito iye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">jo ma omyero kec aye onekgi kec en aye binekogi! meno en aye ka ma gibicito iye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">Ki jo ma kibimakogi kibiterogi woko macalo opii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">meno en aye kama gibicito iye!’<verse eid="JER 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3" />An Rwot, dong atyeko moko kit jami angwen maracu ma bityekogi: kibinekogi woko liweng ki pala lucwan, gwogi biywayo komgi mutoni bedo me acamagi, winyo bene gibicamo komgi; ki lee mager me tim dong gibimwodogi gityekogi woko liweng. <verse eid="JER 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:1-16">2 Luk 21:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:1-9">2 Tek 33:1-9</ref></char></note>Dok abimiyo gibedo gin ma miyo ker me lobo ducu gibedo ki lworo, pi gin ma Manace wod pa Kejekia rwot me Juda yam otimo i Jerucalem.”<verse eid="JER 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5" />Rwot waco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:5">“Anga ma kica bimako ikomwu, wun jo Jerucalem?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:5">Nyo anga kono ma bikumu pirwu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:5">Anga ma kong biloke cung pi kare malac me penyo kit macalo wun wutye kwede?<verse eid="JER 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6" />Wun dong wutyeko kwera woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">wumede wubedo kaloko ngewu ikoma kare ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">Pimeno aye ma omiyo aryeyo cinga me pwod ikomwu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">ci anekowu atyekowu woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">dong aol woko ki timo kica botwu.<verse eid="JER 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7" />I gangi ducu ma i lobowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">abedo ka ketowu woko ata macalo dano kworo kal i laro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Anekowu atyekowu woko, wun jona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">pien pe wumedo ki loke me weko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">timo timwu maracuni.<verse eid="JER 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8" />Anyayo wel mon togi dong odoko dwong</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">makato kweyo me dog nam woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Aneko awobewu woko ma komgi pud tek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">dok amiyo megigi gubedo ki can ki arem malit adada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Amiyo bene remcwiny ki lworo madwong</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">opoto ikomgi oyotoyot labongo gale.<verse eid="JER 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9" />Dako ma onongo onywalo lutinone abiro kulu cwinye odem woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">otemo yweyo ci pe romo ywe kadi matidi mo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Dyeceng ma en tye iye oloke odoko colpiny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">obedo ki lewic ma nongo cwinye opong woko ki can.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Dong jo mukene ma gudong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">abimiyo lukworgi nekogi woko ki pala lucwan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremia obedo kanguru bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10" />Can iwiya! Pingo maa onywala? Oweko ada dok apyemo ki jo ducu ma i lobo. An ceng pe amiyo lim den bot ngat mo kun amito iye magoba mo nyo aburu kwone ni abitime marac kace pe ocula, dok bene pe adeno lim ki bot ngat mo ci akwero culune woko; ento inongo ni dano acel acel tye kaloko lok me cena woko acena. <verse eid="JER 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11" />Ai Rwot, mii lok ma giloko kun gicena kwedeni obed kumeno kace nene pe atiyo gin matye atir inyimi, dok kace nene pe abako doga boti, pi kwo pa lukwora ikare ma onongo gitye i can dok ki cwercwiny mukato kare. <verse eid="JER 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12" />(Pe tye dano mo matwero turu nyonyo, tutwale nyonyo ma kiribo ki mola ma a ki yo tung kumalo.)<verse eid="JER 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13" />Rwot owaca ni, “Lonyowu kacel ki limwu mayam wukano abimiyo lukworwu yako woko. Man bibedo pwod botwu pi balwu ducu ma dong wutyeko timo ma oromo i lobowuni woko liweng. <verse eid="JER 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14" />Abimiyo wubedo opii pa lumerokwu kun wutiyo tic botgi i lobo ma pe wungeyo, pien kinigana dong bilyel calo mac ma wang nakanaka.”<verse eid="JER 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15" />Ci awaco ni, “Ai Rwot, in i niang dok ingeyo gin matye katime ikoma. Po pira dok ikonya, dok bene myero icul kwor ikom jo ma mito neka wokoni. Pe myero idii cwinyi ikom jo ma gimito neka woko; myero inge bene ni piri omiyo atye ka ciro lok me cac matek. <verse eid="JER 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16" />Ka yam i loko kweda, ci ajolo ki cwinya ducu, loki oloke odoko gin me yomcwiny bota, dok obedo gin ma yomo cwinya adada; pien an dong kilwonga ki nyingi, ai Rwot Lubanga me mony. <verse eid="JER 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17" />Yam pe abedo kacel ki jo ma gin nyero ata pi nongo yomcwiny me loboni, an kikoma gira cwinya pe obedo yom wa ki acel. Abedo gira kena, pien an atye i te tweroni, pien kinigani onongo oketo koma woko. <verse eid="JER 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18" />Pingo mono arema pe gik? Pingo bura bene dong odoko gin ma pe cang? In imito iloke i bed bota calo kulu ma bwolo dano abwola, calo pii ma two wokoni?”<verse eid="JER 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19" />Pimeno Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Ka i loke i dwogo bota, ci abigami doki, ci ibibedo latica pi kare ducu. Kace ibedo kaloko lok maber ma konye tye, ma pe i loko gin mo ma konye pe, ci abiloko in dong ibedo ma ka doga. Dano gibiloke gidwogo boti, ento in pe i biloke i dok botgi. <verse eid="JER 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20" />Dong abiketo in ibedo bot lwak man macalo cel gogo me mola ma kirumu maber; gin jonu gibilweny ikomi, ento pe gibiloyo in ki lweny, pien an atye kwedi abigwoki dok abilari, man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21" />Abilari woko ki i cing jo maracu, dok abigwoki woko ki i cing jo ma pe tye ki kica.”<verse eid="JER 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16" />
  <para style="s1">Miti pa Rwot pi kwo pa Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1" />Rwot dok oloko bota kun waco kuman ni, <verse eid="JER 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2" />“In pe ibinyomo dako mo, dok pe bene ibinywalo lutino awobe nyo anyira i kabedo man. <verse eid="JER 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3" />Pien an Rwot awaco kuman ikom awobe ki anyira ma kinywalogi i kabedo man, ki ikom mege ki wege ma i kabedo man. <verse eid="JER 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4" />Two maracu atika binekogi woko, dok pe kibikok pirgi, dok bene pe kibiyikogi, ento gibibedo macalo cet dyang ma guket ata i ngom. Kibinekogi woko ki pala lucwan, ki kec bene binekogi woko, dong komgi mutoni bidoko cam pa winyo ki lee me tim.”<verse eid="JER 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5" />Rwot dok owaco kuman ni, “Pe myero idony i ot kama dano tye iye ka kumu, pe myero icit ka koko nyo ka kumu pirgi; pien dong atyeko kwanyo kuca woko ki bot lwak man, kadi wa mar mera ma pe loke ki kicana bene man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6" />Jo mulony kacel ki lucan gibito i lobo man, ento ngat mo pe ma biyikogi nyo ma bikok pirgi. Ngat mo bene pe bigwero kome kekene kun lyelo yer wiye woko pi nyutu can matye i cwinye. <verse eid="JER 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7" />Pe tye ngat mo ma binywako cam kacel ki dano matye ki kumu, wek okwe cwinye pi dano ma oto ca. Dano mo bene pe bimiyo ginamata mo ma nyutu cwiny me kica bot ngat ma wone nyo mine oto. <verse eid="JER 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8" />Pe myero i dony i ot kama dano tye kacamo iye karama. Pe ibedo kwedgi kunu kacam ki kamat. <verse eid="JER 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Jer 7:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:10">25:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:23">Niy 18:23</ref></char></note>An Rwot me mony ma an Lubanga me Icrael awaco kuman ni: i kabedo man en aye abijuku iye wo me yomcwiny woko matwal ki i wangwu ma wun bene wuneno, ki ikarewu, dwon me oree ki me yomcwiny, dwon lanyom kacel ki dwon nyako ger.<verse eid="JER 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10" />Ka dong itito lok magi ki lwak man, ce gupenyi ni, ‘Pingo Rwot kono otimo gin marac macalo man ikomwa? Wabalo ango? Kit bal ango ma wan watimo ikom Rwot Lubangawa?’ <verse eid="JER 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11" />Ci in i bitito botgi ni, ‘Kwariwu yam gubwota woko, man lok ma Rwot owaco, dok gubedo kalubu lubanga mogo mukene, gutiyo botgi, gubedo kaworogi bene. Gubwota woko dok bene pe gugwoko cika. <verse eid="JER 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12" />Ento wun aye dong wutiyo gin marac atika makato gin mayam kwariwu gutimo. Wun ducu wubedo jo ma ngutwu nwang ki ma kitwu rac, wukwero winyo loka woko. <verse eid="JER 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13" />Pimeno abikwanyowu woko ki i lobo man ci abibolowu woko i lobo mukene mayam wun nyo kadi kwariwu pe gungeyo. Dong ka wutye kunu en aye wubibedo ka woro lubanga mukenegu dyeceng ki dyewor benebene, pe dong abinyutu botwu kicana wa ki acel.’”<verse eid="JER 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwogo cen ki i opii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Wunen, kare tye kabino, ma pe dok ngat mo bimoko loke kun kwonge ni, ‘Macalo Rwot ma en aye okwanyo wan jo Icrael woko ki i lobo Ejipt tye makwoni.’ <verse eid="JER 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15" />Ento wubikwonge kun wuwaco ni, ‘Macalo Rwot tye kwoni, ma okelo jo Icrael woko ki i lobo ma yo tung kumaloni, dok ki i lobo ducu kama yam en oryemogi ci gucito iyeni.’ Pien abikwanyogi adwokogi cen i lobogi kikome mayam amiyo bot kwarigi.”<verse eid="JER 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwod matye kabino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Nen, atye kacwalo dano mapol, ma gibimakogi macalo gimako rec; lacen dok abicwalo jo ma gin ludwar mapol, ma gibidwarogi ki iwi godigu ducu kadi ki iwi ceregu, kadi wa ki ikin got ma obar. <verse eid="JER 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17" />Pien aciko wanga atye kaneno kitgi ducu; gin pe gukane ki bota wa ki acel, dok balgi mo bene matye macalo mung ma kikano woko ki tung bota pe tye. <verse eid="JER 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18" />Abimiyo giculu wang balgi ma gutimoni tyen kiryo, pien gupyedo lobona woko ki cal jogigi marom ki kom jo ma otogu, dong gupongo gipinya ki timo gin me kwer keken.”<verse eid="JER 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremia olego Rwot ki gen</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19" />Ai Rwot, in aye i tek mera dok in aye cel gogo magwoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">kama aringo alaro iye ikare me can.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">Rok ducu gibia gibino boti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">kun gia ki i kabedo ducu ma iwi lobo, ci gibiwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">“Kwariwa yam gubedo ka woro gin ma tere peke, lubanga me goba keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">gubedo ka woro jogi ma konygi peke ma pe twero larogi.<verse eid="JER 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20" />Dano twero tiyo lwak lubangane pire kene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:20">Pe, pien gin ma dano gutiyo ki cinggi pe twero bedo lubanga wa ki acel.”<verse eid="JER 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Pimeno, abimiyo rok ducu gingeyo twerona ki tekona kicel keken, ci dong gibingeyo ni an nyinga Rwot.”<verse eid="JER 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17" />
  <para style="s1">Bal pa jo Juda ki pwod ma kiketo ikomgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1" />Rwot owaco ni, “Wun jo Juda, balwu dong omoto woko ikomwu calo kicoyogi woko i cwinywu ki kidi dayaman ma lake bit, ki dok bene kicoyo kigoro ki kalam nyonyo ikom ten keno angwen matye ikom keno tyerwu. <verse eid="JER 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2" />En ma omiyo jowu po ikom keno tyerwu ki ikom cal Acera ma jok ma dako ma wucibo inget yadi ducu ma potgi oluk, ki iwi cere mabocogu, <verse eid="JER 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3" />ki iwi godi ducu matye i dye tim. Lonyowu kacel ki limwu mayam wukano abimiyo kiyako woko, pi balwu ducu ma dong wutyeko timo ma oromo i lobowuni woko liweng. <verse eid="JER 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4" />Lobo maber mayam amiyowu dong kibimayo woko ki botwu, abimiyo wubedo opii pa lumerokwu kun wutiyo tic botgi i lobo ma pe wungeyo, pien kinigana dong olyel woko calo mac, ma dong bibedo ka wang nakanaka.”<verse eid="JER 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok mogo mapatpat</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5" />Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">“Abiceno ngat ma keto gene ikom dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">ngat ma loko cwinye woko ki ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">ma keto gene ikom keru pa dano.<verse eid="JER 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6" />En bedo calo yat ma i dye tim aroo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">ma pe bineno gin mo maber kabino.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">En bibedo mere i kabedo ma otwo ma obedo kadokado</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">ma gin mo pe dongo iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">i kabedo kama dano pe bedo iye.<verse eid="JER 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7" />Ento dano ma keto gene ikoma tye ki gum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:7">ma gene ducu ocung ikoma.<verse eid="JER 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 1:3">Jab 1:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>En bedo calo yat ma kipito inget kulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">ma cwalo lwite donyo woko piny wa i laora kulu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Ka ikare me lyeto ma piny otwo en pe lworo gin mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">pien pote bedo madyak kumeno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">dok bene i mwaka ma ceng ryeny teretere ma pii pe en pe paro gin mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">dok pe giko nyako nyige.<verse eid="JER 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9" />Cwiny dano en aye gin ma bwolo dano makato gin mukenegu ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:9">opong ki gin marac adada; anga matwero niang iye?<verse eid="JER 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Jab 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:23">Niy 2:23</ref></char>
    </note>An Rwot angiyo tam pa dano dok bene atemo cwiny dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">atiyo ki dano acel acel ma lubu kit kwone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:10">dok ma lubu kit gin ma en otiyo.”<verse eid="JER 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11" />Macalo ayweri ma coko lutino ite</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">bwome ma en kikome pe otoko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">ngat ma nongo lonyo i yo ma pe atir bene tye kitmeno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">ka dong otegi inongo ni lonyone rwenyo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">i agikine en gire doko laming.<verse eid="JER 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12" />Kabedowa maleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:12">me woro Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:12">obedo komker me deyo adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:12">ma ocung malo iwi got nia i acakine.<verse eid="JER 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13" />Ai Rwot, gen pa jo Icrael ducu tye ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">jo ducu ma gibwoto in woko lewic bimakogi matek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">jo ma giloke giweki woko kibirwenyogi woko calo nying ma kicoyo i apwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">pien gin dong gutyeko bwoto Rwot woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">ma en aye wang it me pii me kwo.<verse eid="JER 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremia okok bot Rwot pi kony</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14" />Canga, ai Rwot, ci abicang woko maber;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:14">lara, ci bene abilare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:14">pien an apako in kare ducu.<verse eid="JER 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15" />Nen, kitiko waco bota ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:15">“Lok pa Rwot ma iwaconi bipoto ikomwani tye kwene ka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:15">Wek loke obin!”<verse eid="JER 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16" />Ai Rwot, in iketo an me bedo lakwat pa joni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">dok pe abwoto tic ma in imiya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">An pe adiyo in ni myero icwal gin marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">dok bene pe amito nino me can amita, meno in ingeyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">gin ma oa ki idoga ducu ma aloko, aloko atyer ka wangi.<verse eid="JER 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17" />Pe ibed gin makelo lworo bota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:17">in i kalarena ikare ma nongo piny rac.<verse eid="JER 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18" />Wek lewic omak jo ma giketo ayela ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">ento pe iwek lewic omaka; wek cwinygi aye obale woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">ento in pe iwek mere cwinya obale;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">mii kare ma gin marac myero opot kwede ikomgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">tyekgi woko liweng!<verse eid="JER 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwero nino me Cabit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19" />Rwot owaco bota kuman ni, “Cit icung i dogcel pa Benjamin, en aye kama luker me Juda gidonyo kwede i taun madit dok bene yoo ma gikato kwede woko; cit bene i dogcel ducu me Jerucalem. <verse eid="JER 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20" />Ci iwac botgi ni, ‘Wuwiny lok pa Rwot, wun luker me Juda, ki wun jo Juda ducu ma bedo i Jerucalem, ma wudonyo ki i dogcel magi. <verse eid="JER 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:15-22">Nek 13:15-22</ref></char></note>Wac botgi ni, ka gimaro kwo myero pe guting ter i ceng Cabit; dok pe myero guting ter mo kun giwok ki i dogcel ducu me Jerucalem. <verse eid="JER 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-10">Nia 20:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-14">Nwo 5:12-14</ref></char></note>Dok bene pe myero guting ter ki i odigi i ceng Cabit, dok pe gutii tic mo, ento myero gukwer nino me Cabit obed maleng kit macalo yam aciko ki kwarigi. <verse eid="JER 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23" />Ento kwarigi yam pe guwinyo, gumiyo tokgi odoko tek, pe guciko itgi kawinyo loka, wek pe guwiny dok gugam pwony ma mera.<verse eid="JER 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24" />Ento ka guwinyo loka, ma pe gukelo ter mo ki i dogcel ducu me taun madit man i ceng Cabit, ento kun gukwero ceng Cabit bedo nino maleng ma pe gutiyo tic mo inino meno, <verse eid="JER 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25" />ci lukergi ki rwodigi bidonyo ki i dogcel me Jerucalem ma gibedo iwi komker pa Daudi. Gin ki rwodigi ducu kacel ki jo Juda ki jo Jerucalem, gibiringo ki gadigadi ki aguragura, dong meno bimiyo taun madit me Jerucalem bipong ki lwak dano mapol matwal. <verse eid="JER 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26" />Dano gibia gibibino ki i taun ducu me Juda ki i gangi ducu ma orumu Jerucalem; gibibino ki i lobo pa Benjamin, ki i lobo me Cepela, ki i lobo ma obedo godigodi, dok bene gibia gibino ki i Negeb, kun gikelo gityer me gitum awanga, gityer me moko kwon, ki odok luban, dok gibikelo gityer me pwoc bene i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="JER 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27" />Ento ka gin pe guwinyo loka me kwero ceng Cabit wek obed maleng, dok ka gutingo ter mo gudonyo kwede ki i dogcel me Jerucalem i ceng Cabit, ci abimiyo mac lyel i dog cele ducu ci biwango odi madongo me Jerucalem woko ducu ma mace pe dong kibiromo nekone matwal.”<verse eid="JER 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia obedo i ot pa lacwe agulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1" />Rwot owaca ni, <verse eid="JER 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2" />“A malo i cit i ot pa lacwe agulu, ci abimiyo iwinyo loka ki kunu.” <verse eid="JER 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3" />Ci aa acito i ot pa lacwe agulu, ci anongo en tye ka cweyo agulune ikom lawala. <verse eid="JER 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4" />Ci kare ducu kace lobo agulu ma nongo lacwe agulu tye ka cweyoneni obale woko ki i cinge, ci en loko woko tiyo kwede ki gin mukene mapat kit macalo en lacwe agulu neno ni ber bote me atima.<verse eid="JER 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5" />Ka Rwot dok owaca ni, <verse eid="JER 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6" />“Wun jo me ot pa Icrael, pe wutamoni atye ki twero me tiyo ikomwu gin ma lacwe agulu otiyoni? Nen, wun jo Icrael bene wutye i cinga macalo lobo matye i cing lacwe agulu. <verse eid="JER 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7" />Kace ikare mo awaco pi rok mo ni abiputu dok abiturugi woko ci abityeko woko, <verse eid="JER 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8" />kace dong rok meno ma aloko pireni oloke oweko timo gin marac, ci abiloko tama woko pi gin marac ma onongo awaco ni abitimo ikome ca. <verse eid="JER 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9" />Dok bene kace onongo awaco ni abipito nyo agero rok nyo ker moni, <verse eid="JER 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10" />ce rok meno okwero winyo doga ci oloke katimo gin marac, ci abiloko tama ikom gin maber ma onongo awaco ni abitimo botgini. <verse eid="JER 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11" />Kombedi dong itit bot jo Juda ki jo ma bedo i Jerucalem ni, ‘Rwot owaco kuman ni, Nen, atye ki yub marac pirwu dok ayube me keto can ikomwu. Wuloke wudwog cen bota, ngat acel acel owek kit marac woko, dok oyub kite kun tiyo gin matye atir.’ <verse eid="JER 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12" />Ento gin gibigamo ni, ‘Loke pe konyo! Wabilubu yub ma wan ki komwa aye wayubu, ki ngat acel acel bene bitiyo gin ducu ma oporo rac cwinye ki tame.’”<verse eid="JER 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gukwero Rwot woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13" />Rwot waco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">“Kong i peny ikin lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">anga mayam owinyo lok mo ma cal ki man?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">Jo Icrael ma amaro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">dong gutimo gin marac adada.<verse eid="JER 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14" />Itamoni pee me Lebanon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">twero bedo peke iwi got me Cirion?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">Itamoni kulune ma piine ngic ma mol a ki iwi godini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">twero two woko liweng?<verse eid="JER 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15" />Ento jona dong wigi otyeko wil woko ikoma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">gibedo ka wango odok eceta bot cal lubangagu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">omiyo gubedo ka yoke atata ikit me wotgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">pe gulubu yo mayam gingeyo con,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">ento dong guwoto ki i yo mogo ma pe terogi kamo.<verse eid="JER 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16" />Guloko lobogi odoko gin mamiyo lworo bot dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">ma bibedo gin ma kijwat pire kun kicayo nakanaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">Jo ducu ma gibikato ki i ka ngete gibibedo ki ur madit tutwal kun giyengo wigi.<verse eid="JER 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17" />Abikeyo jona woko inyim lukworgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">calo apwa ma yamo ma a ki tung kunyango bayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">Abiloko ngeya woko botgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">pe abikonyogi ka can opoto komgi.”<verse eid="JER 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kipiro lok ikom Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18" />Lacen lwak guwaco ni, “Wubin wapiru lok ikom Jeremia! Kare ducu wabibedo ki ajwaki ma giromo pwonyowa, ki luryeko bene ma gibibedo kamiyo botwa tam, dok wabibedo ki lunebi ma gimede anyim ki tito lok pa Lubanga. Wubin, wek wakelu lok me pido ikome, dong bene wagiku keto cwinywa i lok ducu ma en wacogu.”<verse eid="JER 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19" />Pimeno alego Lubanga, kun awaco ni, “Rwot, winy lok ma atye ka waconeni, ki dok bene iwiny lok ma lukwora gitye ka lokone ikoma. <verse eid="JER 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20" />Itamoni gin marac mono aye kiculu ki ngat ma timo gin maber? Ento gin dong gutyeko kwinyo bur woko ni myero apot iye. Kong ipo kit macalo abino kwede inyimi kun apido pirgi ma aloko lok maber, wek i kwany akemoni woko ki ikomgi. <verse eid="JER 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21" />Pimeno dong i mi kec onek lutinogi otyekgi woko; dok bene wek kinekgi woko i lweny ki pala lucwan. Wek mon gi gudong labongo lutino dok bene gudok mon to. Wek two gemo aye onek coggi otyekgi woko, ki awobegi bene myero kinekgi woko i mony ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JER 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22" />Cwal dul mony atura me yako gangigi woko, wek guwoo ki koko makelo lworo. Dong gutyeko kwinyo bur woko wek a pot iye, dok guciko owic woko wek amok iye. <verse eid="JER 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23" />Ento in, ai Rwot, ingeyo kit macalo gipiro kwede lok ikoma wek gineka woko. Pe itimgi kica pi gin marac ma gitimo, pe bene i jwa balgi woko matwal ki inyimi. Wek kibed ka loyogi kumeno inyimi; pwodgi ikare me kinigani.”<verse eid="JER 18:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19" />
  <para style="s1">Agulu ma oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1" />Rwot owaca ni, “Cit i wil abino ma lacwe agulu ocweyo, kwany ludongo pa lwak ki ajwaki ma gutegi ma dong gurii i dog tic icit kwedgi, <verse eid="JER 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:10">2 Luk 23:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:30-32">Jer 7:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:34-35">32:34-35</ref></char></note>ci wucit wukat woko wa i Nota me Kinom, kun wudonyo ki i Dogcel me Labalatek, ci i cit itit lok ma an awaco botini ducu ki kunu. <verse eid="JER 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3" />I biwaco botgi ni, ‘Wuwiny lok pa Rwot, wun luker me Juda ki jo ma bedo i Jerucalem. Rwot me mony ma en Lubanga pa Icrael owaca ni: nen atye ka kelo gin marac tutwal ikom kabedo man, mamiyo dano ducu ma gibiwinyo pire itgi bibedo ka wo awoya liwang wang. <verse eid="JER 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4" />Abitimo gin ma kit man pien dano gutyeko bwota woko, dok bene gubalo kabedo man woko, kun giwango iye odok eceta bot lwak lubanga mukene ma gin ki komgi nyo kwarigi kadi wa luker me Juda onongo yam pe gungeyo. Gupongo kabedo man woko ki remo pa jo ma gipeke ki bal, <verse eid="JER 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref></char></note>dok bene gugero wang jogi pi jok Baal kama giwango iye awobegi ki mac macalo gitum awanga bot jok Baal. Meno gin mayam pe awaco ni gutim, pe acikogi pire, dok bene pe atamo pire wa ki acel ni gutim. <verse eid="JER 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6" />Pimeno, nen kare tye kabino, ma an Rwot dong awaco gire, ma kabedo man dong pe kibilwongo ni Topet nyo Nota me Kinom, ento dong kibilwongo ni nota me Nek. <verse eid="JER 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7" />I kabedo man en aye abibalo iye yub pa jo Juda ki jo Jerucalem woko. Abimiyo lukworgi biloyogi woko, ci ginekogi woko ki pala lucwan i lweny. Abimiyo komgi ma oto bedo cam pa winyo ki pa lee me tim. <verse eid="JER 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8" />Abibalo taun man woko marac tutwal wek dano ducu ma gikato ki ka ngete gubed ki jwat ki ur madit pi gin marac ma dong otyeko timeni. <verse eid="JER 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9" />Abimiyo jo ma gibedo kunu gibicamo kom lutino awobegi ki lutino anyiragi, ma ngat acel acel bicamo ringo kom lawote, ikare ma nongo mony dong orumugi woko, ma dong gitye ka mading pi can ma jo ma mito nekogi woko gukelo ikomgi.’<verse eid="JER 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10" />Ci Rwot owaca ni anek agulu woko ki inyim jo meno ma guwoto kwedani, <verse eid="JER 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11" />ci awac botgi ni Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, ‘Abituru jo magi woko kitmeno wa ki taun madit man, calo ngat ma neko agulu, miyo pe dok kitwero yubune wek odwog kakare. Kibiyiko dano i Topet ci bipong woko miyo kabedo mo mukene me yik dong bibedo peke. <verse eid="JER 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12" />Meno aye gin ma abitiyo i kabedo man, man Rwot ma owaco, man bene gin ma abitimo ikom jo ma bedo iye, dok abimiyo taun madit man loke nen calo Topet. <verse eid="JER 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13" />Lwak odi ducu ma i Jerucalem ki odi pa luker me Juda, ma gin odi mayam gibedo ka wango odok eceta i wigi bot mony me polo, ki onyo gityer amatagu bot lubanga mukene, kibimiyo bale woko macalo kabedo me Topet.’”<verse eid="JER 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14" />Lacen aa ki i Topet kama onongo Rwot ocwala iye katito loke, abino ci acung i dyekal me Ot pa Rwot, ci awaco bot lwak ducu ma gitye kenyo ni <verse eid="JER 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15" />Rwot me mony, ma en Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco kuman ni, “Nen, atye kakelo gin marac mayam aloko pire ikom taun madit man, ci abiketo ikome ki ikom taun ducu ma gurumu ka ngete, pien gumiyo ngutgi odoko nwang, kun bene gikwero kwede winyo loka woko.”<verse eid="JER 19:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mone ikin Packur gin ki Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1" />Ikare meno ajwaka Packur wod pa Imer, ma onongo en aye ladit maloyo Ot pa Rwot, owinyo ka atito lok magi. <verse eid="JER 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2" />Cutcut Packur ociko lok ni kigoya, ci dok omiyo lok ni kitweya woko ki okol i ot buc ma matye i dogcel mamalo pa Benjamin matye i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="JER 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3" />Orwone Packur ogonya ki i okol, ci awace ni, “Rwot pe ocako nyingi ni Packur, ento dong omiyi nying manyen ni ‘Lworo tye i Kabedo ducu.’ <verse eid="JER 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4" />Pien Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Nen, abimiyo ibedo gin makelo lworo ikomi kekeni ki ikom luremi ducu. Lukworgi binekogi woko ki pala lucwan kama in bene i nenogi. Abimiyo jo Juda woko ducu i cing rwot me Babilon; en biterogi woko i opii i Babilon, ci en binekogi woko ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JER 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5" />Dok bene abimiyo lonyo ducu me taun madit man kacel ki magobane, ki jami ducu ma pirgi tego botgi ducu, ki kit lonyo mapatpat pa rwot me Juda i cing lukworgi ma biyako jamigi, kun gimakogi, ci giterogi woko i Babilon. <verse eid="JER 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6" />Dong in Packur, kacel ki jo ma gibedo i odi, kibiterowu woko i opii i Babilon; ci dong wubito ki kunu; ci kibiyikowu bene kunu, in kacel ki luremi mayam ibedo katito lok gobagoba botgini.’”<verse eid="JER 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremia onguru bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7" />Ai Rwot, in dong i bwola, oweko bene kibwola.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">In i tek i kata woko, dong ityeko loya woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Dong adoko ginanyera pa dano dyeceng jwi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">dano ducu gingala angala.<verse eid="JER 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8" />Ka atye kaloko lok mo ci aloko ki dwon malongo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">kun adange matek ni, “Tim bwami ki bale me lobo!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Dano gicaya dok ginywara kare ducu pien ni atito lok pa Rwot.<verse eid="JER 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9" />Kace awaco ni, “Pe dong abilwongo nying Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">nyo ni pe dong abiloko lok mo ki nyinge matwal,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">ci i cwinya kuca nongo tye iye gin mo ma wang calo mac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">matye okane woko i cogona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">dong aol woko ki juku doga wek pe aloki, pe dong atwero.<verse eid="JER 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10" />Awinyo lwak tye kalok lawewe ni, “Lworo tye i kabedo ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Pimeno wubin wek wadote woko!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Man lurema ma angiyo kwedgi aye giwaco;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">gitye kaneno kace abipoto i bal mo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Dok giwaco ni, “Gwok nyo kibibwole abwola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">ci wabimake woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">wek wacul wang kworwa ikome.”<verse eid="JER 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11" />Ento in, Rwot, i tye kweda, in oteka lweny ma kilworo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">pimeno jo ma giketo ayelayela</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">ikoma gibiyoke atata;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">pe gibiloya kadi matidi mo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Lewic bimakogi matek mada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">pien pe dong gitwero loyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Lewic ma bimakogini bibedo matwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">wi dano pe biromo wil ikome wa ki acel.<verse eid="JER 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12" />Ai Rwot me mony, in itemo dano me neno ka kitgi tye atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">ingeyo gin matye i cwinygi ki gin ma gitamo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">Pimeno wek anen ka i culu kwor ikom lukwora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">pien an dong anyutu loka woko ducu boti.<verse eid="JER 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13" />Wuwer wer bot Rwot! Wupak Rwot!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">Pien otyeko laro kwo pa jo ma piny obwoyogi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">ki i cing lutim maracu.<verse eid="JER 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:1-19">Yub 3:1-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Kicen nino ma ceng kinywala iyeni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:14">En nino mayam maa onywala iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:14">wek gum obed peke ikom nino meno!<verse eid="JER 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15" />Kicen dano ma okelo lok maber bot wora ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:15">“Kinywali latin laco,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:15">omiyo en obedo ki yomcwiny madwong.<verse eid="JER 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16" />Wek danonu obed calo taun madito</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">ma Rwot ojwero woko labongo kica;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">wek owiny koko i odiko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">ki tum laot mony ma kikutu i dyeceng amac,<verse eid="JER 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17" />pien en pe oneka ki i i maa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:17">kono ot nyodo pa maa dong oloke odoko macalo lyela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:17">kono ot nyodo pa maa obedo pek matwal.<verse eid="JER 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18" />Pingo akati kono ki i ic</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:18">ka nongo tic matek ki cwercwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:18">dok ka nongo atyeko ninona ducu ki lewic keken?<verse eid="JER 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21" />
  <para style="s1">Kitito kit ma kibibalo kwede Jerucalem woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1" />Man aye lok ma Rwot oloko bota ikare ma rwot Jedekia ooro Packur wod pa Malkia ki ajwaka Jepania wod pa Maceya kun waca ni, <verse eid="JER 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-11">2 Luk 25:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17-21">2 Tek 36:17-21</ref></char></note>“Lok bot Rwot pirwa, pien Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon tye ka ero lweny ikomwa. Gwok nyo Rwot bitiyo jami tangone mogo pirwa, ci bimiyo Nebukadnejar jer dok cen ki ngeye.”<verse eid="JER 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3" />Ci atito ki jo ma onongo kicwalo botani, <verse eid="JER 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4" />ni gucit gutit bot Jedekia ni Rwot, ma en Lubanga pa Icrael, dong otyeko waco ni, “Abicito ka ryemo acikari ma Jedekia tye katic kwedgi me lweny ikom rwot me Babilon ki dul monye, ma dong gitye karumu cel me taun madit woko ducu ni adwokogi cen. Abicoko jami lwenygi aduru woko i dye taun madit. <verse eid="JER 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5" />An ki koma aye dong abilwenyo ikomwu ki teka ducu, ki kiniga, ki akeca madit. <verse eid="JER 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6" />Abineko jo ducu ma gibedo i taun madit man, dano kacel ki lee, gin ducu two gemo marac adada bityekogi woko. <verse eid="JER 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7" />Lacen abimiyo Jedekia rwot me Juda, ki lutice, ki jo ma gitye i taun madit man ma gubwot ma two gemo pe onekogi, ki jo ma pe kinekogi i lweny ki pala lucwan, ki ma kec madit pe onekogi, abimiyogi woko i cing Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon, i cing lukworwu ma mito nekowuni woko. Nebukadnejar binekowu woko ducu ki pala lucwan; kadi wa kica bene pe bimako en ikomwu, kun bene pe abiparo pirwu, dok pe abiwekowu bedo kwo. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8" />Lacen Rwot dok ocika me tito ki lwak ni, “Wuwiny, an Rwot amiyo botwu twero me yero yo ma tero dano i kwo nyo yo ma tero dano i to. <verse eid="JER 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9" />Ngat ma pud bedo i taun madit man kibineko woko ki pala lucwan i lweny, nyo kec aye bineko, nyo two gemo aye bibino neko woko. Ento ngat mo ma bia cito woko kun miine bot jo Babilon ma dong kombedi gurumu taun madit wokoni, en aye bibedo kwo. <verse eid="JER 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10" />Dong amoko tama woko pe me bwoto taun madit man, ento dong ayube me balone woko. Kibimiyo i cing rwot me Babilon, ci en biwango woko ki mac nginyinginyi. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikom ot ker me Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11" />Rwot dok owaca ni awac bot jo me ot pa rwot me Juda ma gin likwayo pa Daudi ni, <verse eid="JER 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12" />“Wungol kop atir rupiny ki rupiny, dok myero wular dano ki i cing ngat ma unugi kadi ki ngat ma dong kityeko yako jamine woko, wek pe akemona okati woko macalo mac ma lyel, ma wango piny ma ngat mo pe romo nekone, pi gin marac ma wubedo katimone. <verse eid="JER 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13" />Nen, atye ki lok ikomwu, wun jo Jerucalem ma wubedo lamal ka wi nota, iwi got ma tye i dye bar; wun ma wuwaco ni, ‘Anga kono ma bibino ka lweny ikomwa?’ Dok bene wuwaco ni, ‘Anga ma bidonyo i kabedo kama wabedo iye?’ <verse eid="JER 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14" />Abiketo can ikomwu kun lubu kit gin ma wutimo, man an Rwot ma awaco; abimoko mac i gang kerwu, ci abiwango gin ducu ma orumu ngete atyeko woko liweng.”<verse eid="JER 21:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Jeremia otito bot jo ot ker me Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1" />Rwot owaca ni acit bot jo me ot pa rwot me Juda <verse eid="JER 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2" />ci awac bot rwot me Juda, ma bedo iwi komker pa Daudi, kacel ki lutice, ki lwake ma gidonyo ki i dogcel ducu me gang man ni, <verse eid="JER 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3" />“wutim gin matye kakare dok ma atir, wular jo ma kiunugi ki i cing jo ma oyako jamigi. Pe wutim gin marac nyo tim aranyi ikom larok mo, ikom lutino kic ki mon to, dok bene pe wunek dano mo ma pe ki bal i kabedo man. <verse eid="JER 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4" />Kace wulubu gin ma an dong acikowu ni wulub, ci likwayo pa Daudi gibimede ki bedo luker. Gin kacel ki luditogi ki lwak, gibimede ki donyo i dogcel ducu me gangkal man kun giringo ki gadigadi kacel ki aguragura. <verse eid="JER 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:38">Mat 23:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:35">Luk 13:35</ref></char></note>Ento kace pe wulubu loka, ci an dong akwonge ki nyinga kena botwu ni gangkal man bidoko wi obur. Man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6" />Ki tung bota, ot ker me Juda nen ma munya calo lobo Gilead, calo wi got Lebanon mabiti, ento kadi bed kumeno abiloko kabedo man doko calo tim aroo, en kabedo kama dano pe bedo iye. <verse eid="JER 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7" />Abiyubu lulweny ma gibilweny ikomwu, ngat acel acel bimako latonge icinge ci gibitongo yadi cedarwu mabecogu gireto woko piny, ci gicoko gibolo woko i mac.<verse eid="JER 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8" />Lacen lurok mapol gibikato ki inget taun madit man, kun dano acel acel biwaco bot lawote ni, ‘Pingo Rwot otimo gin macalo man ikom taun man maditi?’ <verse eid="JER 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9" />Ci gibidok iye kun giwaco ni, ‘Pien onongo gubwoto gicike pa Rwot Lubangagi woko, dok gubedo ka woro lwak lubanga mukenegu kun gitiyo botgi bene.’”<verse eid="JER 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok pa Jeremia ma oloko ma okemo Yekoakaj</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10" />Wun jo me Juda, pe wukok pi rwot Yocia ma dong oto wokoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">dok bene cwinywu pe myero oton pire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">ento wukok matek pi wode Yekoakaj ma dong kitye ka tere ci cito woko matwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">pien en dong pe bidwogo cen wa ki acel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">me neno lobo mayam kinywale iye.<verse eid="JER 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:31-34">2 Luk 23:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:1-4">2 Tek 36:1-4</ref></char>
    </note>Pien Rwot owaco lok kuman mukemo Yekoakaj wod pa Yocia rwot me Juda, ma obedo kaloc ma ka wone Yocia, ma kombedi dong pe i kabedo man dok pe bene dong bidwogo cen kany matwal. <verse eid="JER 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12" />Ento en bito mere i kabedo kama kitere iye i opii, pe dok bineno lobo man tyen me aryo.<verse eid="JER 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok pa Jeremia ikom Yekoyakim</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13" />Can iwi dano ma gero ode ki kit tim ma pe atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">ma ogero kicika odine ma malogu ki kit tim ma pe atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">ma miyo luwote tiyo tic bote nono labongo cul mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">dok bene pe culu mucaragi.<verse eid="JER 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14" />Can iwi ngat ma waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">“Abigero oda madit pira kena</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">kun aweko kicikane ma malo bedo malac tutwal.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Ci en biketo wang dirica me ode,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">kun bipeto bao cedar i kicika me ote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">ka deyo kome woko ki rangi makwar.<verse eid="JER 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15" />Itamo ni ibidoko rwot ce,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">ka igero odi ki yadi cedar</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">kun bene ginen mabeco ma kato odi ma pa jo mukene wokogu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Woru aye yam ocamo kuc me loboni mada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">En kare ducu onongo obedo dano ma gene dok ma ngolo kop atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">omiyo gin ducu ma en obedo katiyone owoto maber.<verse eid="JER 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16" />En obedo kangolo pido pa lucan ki pa jo ma piny obwoyo maromrom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">ci omiyo en obedo ki kwo maber.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">Man aye tyen lok me ngeyo Rwot.<verse eid="JER 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17" />Ento ibedo kaneno mitini kekeni keken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">wek inong lonyo pi unu dano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">ineko jo ma gipe ki bal mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">dok bene itimo tim bwami me unu lwaki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">Man Rwot ma owaco.<verse eid="JER 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:6">2 Luk 23:36—24:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2 Tek 36:5-7</ref></char>
    </note>Pimeno Rwot owaco lok bot Yekoyakim wod pa Yocia rwot me Juda ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">“Ngat mo pe bikumu pi tone, kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">omera do, nyo ni, lamera do!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Ngat mo pe ma bikok, kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Rwoda do! Rwota do! Lok man rac kuman!<verse eid="JER 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19" />Kibiyiko ki kit yik ma kiyiko ki gwok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:19">kibipeyo kitero ci kibolo woko inge cel me Jerucalem.”<verse eid="JER 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok pa Jeremia pi can ma okemo Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20" />Wun jo Jerucalem, wucit iwi got Lebanon ci wudange kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">dok wucit i lobo Bacan ci wucikok kunu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">wulwong lwongo matek ki i Abarim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">pien jo ma nene wumarogini ducu dong kityekogi woko.<verse eid="JER 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21" />Rwot oloko kwedwu ikare ma onongo wutye ki lonyo madwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">ento wun giwu wukwero winyo loke woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">Man aye kit gin ma wubedo katimone cake wa ka tinowu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">pe wulubu gin ma Rwot obedo kawaco botwu wa ki acel.<verse eid="JER 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22" />Yamo bikodo ci tero lutelwu woko ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">jo ma wumarogini kibiterogi woko i opii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">lewic bimakowu dok alee bitwodowu pi gin maracu ducu ma dong wutyeko timone.<verse eid="JER 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23" />Kombedi, Rwotwu dong tye ki kuc labongo lworo mo i ot ker,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">ma kideyogi maber ki cedar me Lebanon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">ento ka arem me can bipoto ikome ci en bicur marac</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">calo dako matye ka rem ki nywal!<verse eid="JER 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikom Yekoyakin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:8-15">2 Luk 24:8-15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:9-10">2 Tek 36:9-10</ref></char>
    </note> An Rwot awaco ni, “Akwonge ni, kadi ka in Yekoyakin wod pa Yekoyakim rwot me Juda, onongo ibedo agit me diyo cing matye i cinga tung lacuc, onongo pud abicori woko aye, <verse eid="JER 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25" />ci onongo amiyi i cing jo ma gimito neki woko, i cing jo ma ibedo ki lworo ikomgini. Dok abimiyi bene i cing Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon kacel ki jo Kaldaya. <verse eid="JER 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26" />Abibolo in kacel ki meni ma onywali woko wa i lobo mukene, kama yam pe kinywali iye, ci wubito woko ki kunu, ento pe wubidwogo cen. <verse eid="JER 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27" />Ibimito ni, kono kong ineno loboni anena keken ki wangi ento i ada pe dong ibidwogo cen i iye matwal.”<verse eid="JER 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28" />Ci an Jeremia apenyo ni, “En Yekoyakin mono dong oloke odoko macalo agulu ma oto ma dong kikwanyo kibolo woko, ma ngat mo pe dong mito? Pingo kono kikwanyo en kacel ki lutinone ci kibologi woko wa i lobo ma gin pe gingeyo lok mo ikome?”<verse eid="JER 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29" />In lobo, in lobo we, in lobo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:29">Winy lok ma Rwot dong owaco ni:<verse eid="JER 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30" />“Kingolokop woko dong ikom laco man ni latine mo bibedo peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">en dano ma pe obedo ki gumkom ikare me kwone ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">likwayone mo pe ma bibedo ki gumkom me bedo iwi komker pa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">Man lok pa Rwot kikome.”<verse eid="JER 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23" />
  <para style="s1">Gen pi anyim pa jo Icrael ma gudong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1" />Can iwi lukwat ma gineko dok ma gikeyo romi ki i oleta! <verse eid="JER 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2" />Ma omiyo Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael tye kawaco lok bot lukwat ma gigwoko jone ni, “Wun dong wukeyo romina woko, ci wuryemogi gucito woko, ento pe wubedo kagwokogi wa ki acel. Pimeno abiketo cwinya me keto can ikomwu pi gin marac ma wutimo. <verse eid="JER 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3" />Lacen abicoko romina ma gudong woko liweng ki i lobo ducu kama yam aryemogi gucito iye, abidwokogi cen kany aketogi i dwolgi, ci gibinywal ginya matek. <verse eid="JER 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4" />Abiketo lukwat ma bigwokogi, man miyo dong pe gibibedo ki lworo mo, dok cwinygi bene pe bibale, ki mo ma birwenyo bene bibedo peke, man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 33:14-16">Jer 33:14-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nen, kare tye kabino ma abiketo iye lakwar Daudi kikome me bedo rwot. En bibedo jang yat ma bilot ki kit ma atir, ma biloyo loc ki ryeko, dok bitiyo gin matye atir dok kakare i lobo man. <verse eid="JER 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6" />Ikare ma nongo en tye rwot, jo Juda gibibedo mot labongo lworo mo, ki jo Icrael bene dong gibibedo ki kuc. Kibilwongo rwot meno ki nying ni, ‘Rwot aye ma miyowa kit ma atir.’<verse eid="JER 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7" />Pimeno wunen, kare tye kabino ma pe dok ngat mo bikwonge i nyinga kun giwaco ni, ‘I nying Rwot ma en aye okwanyo wan jo Icrael okelowa woko ki i lobo Ejipt.’ <verse eid="JER 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8" />Ento wubikwonge ni, ‘Macalo Rwot tye kwoni, ma okelo jo Icrael woko ki i lobo ma yo tung kumalo, dok ki i lobo ducu kama yam en oryemogi gucito iye.’ Pien abikwanyogi adwokogi cen i lobogi kikome mayam amiyo bot kwarigi.”<verse eid="JER 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Jeremia otito ikom lunebi ma lugoba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9" />Cwinya obale woko omiyo koma ducu tye ka myel amyela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Man otime pi Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">kun bene lubu lok mere maleng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">atye dong calo dano ma omer ki kongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">dano ma omato kongo bwino madwong.<verse eid="JER 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10" />Pien lobo dong opong ki jo ma giworo lubanga atagu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">gibedo ki kit kwo marac dok bene gitiyo ki tekogi i yo marac.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Lobo tye ka kumu pien Rwot dong oceno woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">ki oletgu bene dong gutwo woko.<verse eid="JER 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:11">“Lunebi kacel ki ajwaki pe giwora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:11">anongogi ma gitye katimo gin marac i Ot pa Lubanga kikome.<verse eid="JER 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12" />Pimeno yo ma gilubu, yone bibedo pwot dok col;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">abimiyo giyoke ci gipoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Abimiyo gin marac poto ikomgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">kare me keto can ikomgi tye kabino.<verse eid="JER 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13" />Dong atyeko neno bal pa lunebi me Camaria:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">gubedo katito lok i nying Baal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">ci gutelo jona jo Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">gumiyo gungak gubwota woko.<verse eid="JER 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:20">Aca 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:49">Eje 16:49</ref></char>
    </note>Ento aneno lunebi ma i Jerucalem dok gitimo gin makelo lworo mukato kare:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">gitimo abor dok giloko lok goba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">gikonyo lutim gin marac weko gimede ki timo gin marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">pi lok meno, miyo dano pe giloke me weko timo bal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Gin ducu gudoko calo Codom ki tung bota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">ma girac adada calo jo Gomora.”<verse eid="JER 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15" />Piman an Rwot me mony awaco lok ma kemo lunebi kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">“Nen, abimiyo gimato yat roka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">abimiyo bene gimato pii ma kiketo iye kwir;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">pien gunyayo kit me woro jogi gumiyo oromo i lobo woko ducu.”<verse eid="JER 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16" />Rwot me mony owaco kuman bot jo Jerucalem ni, “Pe wuwiny lok ma lunebi gitito, pien gitye ka piko gen mogo me gobagoba ma pe konyo i iwu. Gitito botwu ginanyuta mogo ma gin gutamo atama ki wigi ken gi, ento nongo pe gin ma an Rwot aloko. <verse eid="JER 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17" />Gin giwaco lok teretere bot jo ma gicayo lok pa Rwot ni, ‘Wubibedo maber labongo ayela mo’; gitito bene bot jo ma ngutgi nwang ma gitiyo gigi gin ma igi mito ni, ‘Can mo pe bipoto ikomwu wa ki acel.’”<verse eid="JER 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18" />Ci an awaco ni, “Anga ikin lunebi magi mono ma dong ocung i coke pa Rwot, ma gunene dok ma guwinyo loke? Anga ikin gi ma owinyo loke ci olubu? <verse eid="JER 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19" />Nen, akemo pa Rwot okati ocito woko calo yamo kot, calo yamo lapiru mager; ma bimwoc woko iwi lutim maracu. <verse eid="JER 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20" />Kiniga pa Rwot pe bigik nio wang ma Rwot otiyo dok ocobo gin ma en oketo i tame. Inino ma pud tye anyim wubiniang iye maber adada.”<verse eid="JER 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “An gira onongo pe aoro lunebi magi, ento gin guringo aringa oyotoyot ki kwenagi. Pe aloko botgi bene lok mo, ento gubedo katito lok i nyinga. <verse eid="JER 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22" />Ka nene gucung i cokena, kono nene gutito lok ma mera bot jona, kono guloko jona ki ikit kwo marac ma onongo gitye iyeni, kono jona guloke guweko timo gin marac.<verse eid="JER 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23" />An Lubanga ma atye i kabedo ducu, ento pe i kabedo ni keken <verse eid="JER 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24" />Petye dano mo matwero kane woko i kabedo mo matye i mung ma pe atwero nene. Pe an aye ma apongo polo ki lobo? <verse eid="JER 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25" />Dong atyeko winyo lok ma lunebi guwaco ma gitito lok goba ki nyinga, kun giwaco ni, ‘Aleko lek, aleko lek!’ <verse eid="JER 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26" />Lunebi magi gibikano goba i cwinygi ma gitito lok gobagoba me bwola ma giparo ki i cwinygi ken gi pi kare marom mene? <verse eid="JER 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27" />Gin gitamo ni lekgi ma gititoni bimiyo wi jona wil woko ikoma, kit macalo kwarigi yam wigi owil woko ikoma ci guloke gudok ka woro jok Baal. <verse eid="JER 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28" />Lanebi ma oleko lek myero otit leke, ento lanebi ma dong owinyo lok myero otit lok meno ki ada. Anga matwero poro reng ngano ki ngano kikome mono? <verse eid="JER 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29" />Loka obedo calo mac dok calo nyol ma tyero gweng woko matinotino. <verse eid="JER 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30" />Pimeno, nen, atye ki lok ikom lunebi ma gikwalo lok ki bot luwotgi ki ikin gi keken gi ka gitito kun giwaco ni gitito loka. <verse eid="JER 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31" />Dok bene atye ki lok ikom lunebi ma gitito gigi lokgi, kun giwaco ni, ‘Man Rwot ma owaco.’ <verse eid="JER 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32" />Dok atye ki lok ikom lunebi ma gitito lekgi ma opong ki goba kekeni, ma gitito lekgini ci gitelo jona miyo gingak gibwota woko pi gobagi ki kitgi me nyate, ma kun nongo pe acwalogi dok bene nongo pe acikogi ni guciti; pe gitye ki kit kony mo wa ki acel bot lwak man.”<verse eid="JER 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atwom pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33" />Ci Rwot owaca ni, “Jeremia, ka ngat mo ikin jona, nyo kadi lanebi nyo ajwaka, openyi ni, ‘Atwom pa Rwot mono en gin ango?’ Ci ibidok iye ni, ‘Wun aye atwom bot Rwot, pimeno en bikwanyowu bolowu woko matwal, man Rwot ma owaco.’ <verse eid="JER 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34" />Kace inen lanebi kadi ki ajwaka, nyo ngat mo acel ikom lwak man ma biwaco ni, ‘Atwom pa Rwot,’ an abiketo can ikom dano meno ki jo ma i ode ducu. <verse eid="JER 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35" />Ma ka waco lok meno, myero ngat man openy lawote nyo omine ni, ‘Rwot mono dong odok iye ningo, nyo ni, Rwot mono oloko gin ango?’ <verse eid="JER 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36" />Ento lok man ni ‘Atwom pa Rwot’ pe dong wubiloko matwal, pien atwom ma wuloko pireni en aye obedo lok pa dano acel acel ma en waco pire kene; pimeno wudwalo loka woko, an Lubanga makwo, ma an aye a Rwot me mony dok Lubangawu. <verse eid="JER 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37" />Dong in Jeremia, peny lunebini ni, ‘Gin ango dong ma Rwot odok iye ki wun?’ Nyo ni, ‘Rwot oloko gin ango?’ <verse eid="JER 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38" />Ento ka guwaco ni, ‘Atwom pa Rwot,’ ci itit botgi ni pien guwaco lok man, kun onongo acikogi woko matek ni pe gulok lok man, <verse eid="JER 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39" />pimeno, adada abikwanyogi atingogi malo ci abologi woko cen ki inyima, gin kacel ki taun madit mayam amiyo botgi ki bot kwarigi. <verse eid="JER 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40" />Dong abikelo lewic marac ki cac ma bedo nakanaka aketo ikomgi, ma wi dano pe biwil iye matwal.”<verse eid="JER 23:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24" />
  <para style="s1">Aduku ma opong ki nyig oduru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:12-16">2 Luk 24:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Tek 36:10</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot onyuta aduku aryo ma opong ki nyig oduru ma kiketo inyim Ot pa Lubanga. (Man otime lacen inge kare ma Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon otero kwede Yekonia wod pa Yekoyakim rwot me Juda me bedo opii, kun okwanyo ki i Jerucalem kacel ki lutela me Juda, ludito tic mapatpat kacel ki lutet ducu ci oterogi i Babilon.) <verse eid="JER 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2" />Aduku acel onongo opong ki nyig oduru mabeco, ma gukwongo ceke; ento aduku mukeneni onongo opong mere ki nyig oduru maracu keken, girac adada ma dano pe twero camone. <verse eid="JER 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3" />Cutcut Rwot owaca ni, “Jeremia, ineno ango?” Ci adok iye ni, “Aneno oduru, oduru mabeconeni gibeco adada, ki oduru maracuneni giracu adada ma pe kitwero camone.”<verse eid="JER 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4" />Rwot dok owaco bota ni, <verse eid="JER 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5" />“An Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, atamo ni jo ma acwalo woko i lobo pa jo Kaldaya ni gubedo calo nyig oduru mabeco adadani, an abitic kwedgi kun kica maka ikomgi. <verse eid="JER 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6" />Abibedo ka gwokogi maber ci akelogi adwokogi cen i lobo man. Abigerogi calo ot ci gibicung matek, ma pe abimukugi aretogi woko piny; abipitogi calo ginapita, ento pe abiputugi woko. <verse eid="JER 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7" />Abimiyo gibedo ki miti i cwinygi me ngeyo ni an aye a Rwot. Lacen dong gibibedo jona, ki an bene abibedo Lubangagi, pien dong gibiloke gidwogo bota woko ki cwinygi ducu.<verse eid="JER 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8" />Ento an Rwot awaco kuman ni, Jedekia rwot me Juda, kacel ki rwodine, ki jo Jerucalem ma gudong gubedo i lobo man, ki jo mukene ma gucito gubedo i lobo Ejipt, an Rwot abiterogi kit macalo atero kwede ki nyig oduru maracu tutwali ma pe kitwero camogini. <verse eid="JER 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9" />Abikelo can marac kitmeno aketo ikomgi ma bimiyo rok ducu gibedo ki lworo. Dano bicayogi, ci gibidoko lok aboka, kun dano giloko lok agec ikomgi dok gibitic ki nyinggi macalo lok lacen dano i kabedo ducu ma abiryemogi gicito iye. <verse eid="JER 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10" />Abimiyo kilwenyo ikomgi ki pala lucwan, abimiyo kec nekogi ki two gemo bene poto ikomgi, nio ka guto gutum woko ducu ki i lobo mayam amiyo botgi ki bot kwarigini.”<verse eid="JER 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25" />
  <para style="s1">Lumerok ma gibia ki i lobo ma tung kumalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:1">2 Luk 24:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2 Tek 36:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-2">Dan 1:1-2</ref></char>
    </note>I mwaka me angwen me loc pa Yekoyakim wod pa Yocia rwot me Juda, Rwot oloko kweda lok ma okemo jo Juda ducu. (Man aye obedo mwaka mukwongo me loc pa Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon.) <verse eid="JER 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2" />Ci awaco bot jo Juda ducu ki bot jo ducu ma bedo i Jerucalem ni, <verse eid="JER 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3" />“Kombedi dong odoko mwaka pyere aryo wiye adek kulu, cake i mwaka me apar wiye adek me loc pa Yocia wod pa Amon rwot me Juda nio kwede wa onyo. Rwot oloko kweda dok an bene abedo ka titiwu loke teretere ma pe aling; ento wun pe wuketo cwinywu kawinyo loke. <verse eid="JER 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4" />Wun pe wuwinyo dok pe wuciko itwu kawinyo loke, kadi bed Rwot obedo kacwalo lutice lunebi teretere botwu. <verse eid="JER 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5" />Gin gutito botwu ni myero wuloke wuwek kitwu me timo gin marac, man bimiyo wubedo i lobo mayam Rwot omiyo wacon botwu ki bot kwariwu me bedo mewu matwal. <verse eid="JER 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6" />Gin bene gutito botwu ni pe wuwor lubanga mukenegu dok pe wutii botgi bene. Dok bene pe myero wunget cwiny Rwot wek kiniga omake pi cal lubanga ma wutiyo ki cingwu. Ka onongo nene wulubu gin ma Rwot oloko, kono en nene pe oketo can ikomwu. <verse eid="JER 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7" />Ento Rwot kikome owaco ni wun wukwero winyo loke, ma ka meno, wungeto cwinye wumiyo kiniga omake pi cal lubanga ma wutiyo atiya ki cingwuni, ma omiyo wun aye ma wukelo can me pwod ma opoto i komwuni kenwu.<verse eid="JER 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8" />Pimeno, kit macalo wukwero winyo lokeni, omiyo Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, <verse eid="JER 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9" />‘Abicwalo rok ducu ma gibedo i lobo matye yo tung kumaloni ki latica Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon ikomwu. Abikelo lwak me rok ducu me lweny ikom rok man ki jone ducu, ki ikom rok ducu ma orumugi dyere. Ci abinekogi atyekogi woko liweng; abimiyo lworo mako dano kun gijwat pi gangi ma odong obur, man bibedo macalo lok me cac matwal. <verse eid="JER 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Jer 7:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:9">16:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:22-23">Niy 18:22-23</ref></char></note>Dok bene abijuku dwon me wo me yomcwiny madwong woko ki botgi, dwon nyako ger ki dwon lanyom, ki mor pa kidi rego, kun aneko mac taragi woko bene. <verse eid="JER 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:21">2 Tek 36:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:10">Jer 29:10</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:2">Dan 9:2</ref></char></note>Lobo man ducu bidoko obur ma iye bidong nono, dok bene rok ma orumugini gibibedo ite loc pa Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon pi mwaka pyere abiro kulu. <verse eid="JER 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12" />Lacen ka mwaka pyere abiro dong otum, abiketo can ikom rwot me Babilon ki ikom lobone pi balgi. Ci abibalo lobogi woko wek odong obur matwal. <verse eid="JER 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13" />Abiketo can ikom rok meno ki gin ducu ma dong atyeko wacone, ki gin ducu ma kicoyo i buk man, ki gin ducu ma Jeremia oloko mukemo rok magi ducu. <verse eid="JER 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14" />Rok mapol ki luker mapol gibiloko jo Babilon gidoko opii, ci dong abiculugi kun lubu gin ma gutimo.’”<verse eid="JER 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop pa Lubanga ikom rok ducu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15" />Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco bota ni, “Ene, gam kikopo kongo bwino ma opong ki akemona. Gam ci imii jo me rok ducu kama abicwali iye gumati. <verse eid="JER 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16" />Ka dong gumato, ci gibicato ki wot dok bene gibibedo maming i tamgi pi lweny ma abicwalo ikomgini.”<verse eid="JER 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17" />Kitmeno agamo kikopo ki i cing Rwot, ci amiyo jo me rok ducu kama Rwot ocwala iye gumato. <verse eid="JER 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18" />Jerucalem ki taun ducu me Juda, kacel ki lukergi ki rwodigi ducu gumato; pimeno lobogi dong bidoko tim aroo ma iye bidong nono, bimiyo dano gijwat kun giuru, miyo dano gibitic ki nyinggi macalo lok lacen dano kit macalo tye kwede wa onyoni. <verse eid="JER 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19" />Jo mukene bene ma gibimato akemo pa Rwot gin ene:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 25:19">Parao rwot me Ejipt ki lutice, rwodine, kacel ki lwake ducu; <verse eid="JER 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20" />ki jo me rok mukene ducu ma gibibedo ikin gi; luker ducu me lobo Uj ki luker ducu me lobo Piliciti (Acikelon ki Gaja, Ekron, ki jo Acidod ducu ma gudong); <verse eid="JER 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21" />ki jo ducu me Edom, Moab, ki jo Ammon. <verse eid="JER 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22" />Luker ducu me Turo, luker ducu me Cidon, ki luker me lobo matye i dog nam. <verse eid="JER 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23" />Jo ducu me taun me Dedan, Tema, ki Buj; jo ducu ma ginyaro yer wigi dong macego; <verse eid="JER 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24" />luker me Arabia ducu ki luker me kaka mapatpat ma gurube aruba ma gibedo i tim aroo; <verse eid="JER 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25" />luker ducu me Jimri, Elam, ki Media. <verse eid="JER 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26" />Luker ducu me lobo yo matye tung kumalo, jo ma bedo kamabor ki jo ma bedo kamacok, kun gin ducu gilube aluba kikore. Rok ducu matye iwi lobo bene myero gumati. Ka me agikine dong rwot me Babilon bimato.<verse eid="JER 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27" />Lacen Rwot owaca ni atit botgi ni Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, waco kuman ni, “Wumat akemona nio wang ma wumer dok wungok, nio ka wupoto piny ma pe dong wutwero a malo pi lweny ma abicwalo ikomwuni.”<verse eid="JER 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28" />En dok owaca ni, “Kace gukwero gamo kikopo ki i cingi wek pe gimat akemona, ci itit botgi ni, ‘Rwot me mony owaco ni myero wumati.’ <verse eid="JER 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29" />Pien nen, dong abicako timo gin marac ikom taun madit ma kilwongo ki nyingani. Gin ada gitamoni gibibwot ma pe aketo can ikomgi? Pe kumeno, ento abiketo can ikomgi, pien abicwalo lweny ikom jo ducu ma gibedo iwi lobo. Man an Rwot me mony kikoma aye ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30" />Piman in Jeremia, myero itit lok magi ducu ma an awacini. Myero i tit bot jo magi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">‘Rwot bimoro dwone ki i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">en bilok bene ki i kabedone maleng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">En bimoro dwone matek adada ikom jone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">en bidange calo dano matye kanyono olok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Pimeno jo ducu ma gibedo iwi lobo gibiwinyo loke.<verse eid="JER 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31" />Mor dwone biwinye wa i agiki piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">pien Rwot tye ki pido ikom rok ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">En bingolokop ikom jo ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">ci bimiyo kineko jo maracu woko ki pala lucwan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">Man an Rwot ma awaco.’”<verse eid="JER 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32" />Rwot me mony owaco ni can tye kabino ikom rok ducu ki acel acel kun lubugi kore kikore, ki yamo lapiru mager tye kakodo kun a ki i agiki piny. <verse eid="JER 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33" />Inino meno kom jo ma Rwot onekogi kibikeyo woko ata i but lobo ducu. Pe kibikumu pirgi, pe kibicokogi, pe bene kibiyikogi. Komgi birade i ngom lirat macalo cet dyang ma guket ata.<verse eid="JER 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34" />Wukok, kun wudange, wun lukwat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">wungene i buru wun lukwat ma wukwayo jone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">pien kare dong oromo me nekowu, en kare me ketowu woko ata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Kibingolo ngutwu calo kingolo ngut nyogi romi mucwe.<verse eid="JER 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35" />Kabedo mo ma lukwat giringo gilaro iye pe bidong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:35">kadi ki kabwot mo ma lutela pa jone gibibwot iye pe bidong.<verse eid="JER 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36" />Wuwiny koko pa lukwat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:36">wuwiny bene ka lutela pa jone gikok!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:36">Pien Rwot tye ka balo kakwat woko ki kiniga,<verse eid="JER 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37" />oweko dwol romine ma onongo tye ki kuci odong obur.<verse eid="JER 25:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38" />Rwot dong otenyo jone woko calo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">labwor ma oweko borone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">pien lobogi dong iye odong nono</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">pi pala lucwan pa jo ma giunu dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">ki pi kiniga mager pa Rwot.<verse eid="JER 25:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26" />
  <para style="s1">Kipido ki Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:6">2 Luk 23:36—24:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2 Tek 36:5-7</ref></char>
    </note>Cutcut inge kare ma Yekoyakim wod pa Yocia odoko rwot me Juda, Rwot owaco lok man bota ni, <verse eid="JER 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2" />“Cung i dyekal me Ot pa Rwot, dok iwac lok bot jo ducu me Juda ma gibino ka woro Lubanga i Ot pa Rwot. Tit botgi lok ducu ma dong aciki me lokone; pe ikan lok mo iwek odong. <verse eid="JER 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3" />Gwok nyo gibiwinyo lok man, ci miyo dano acel acel loke weko yone marac, wek an alok tama pi gin marac ma onongo ayubu ni abitimo ikomgi pi gin marac ma gin gubedo katimoneni.”<verse eid="JER 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4" />Ci Rwot dok owaca ni awac botgi kuman ni, “Kace pe wubiwinyo loka, kun wulubu cika ma amiyo botwu, <verse eid="JER 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5" />ki ka pe wubiwinyo lok pa lutica lunebi ma acwalogi me bino botwu pi oyotoyot, kadi bed pe wuketo cwinywu ka winya, <verse eid="JER 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:1">Yoc 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:60">Jab 78:60</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:12-14">Jer 7:12-14</ref></char></note>ci dong abibalo Ot man woko kit macalo yam atimo ikom Cilo, dok abimiyo rok ducu ma gibedo iwi lobo gitiyo ki nying taun madit man me ceno dano.”<verse eid="JER 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7" />Ajwaki ki lunebi ki lwak ducu guwinyo ka awaco lok magi i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="JER 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8" />Ka dong atyeko loko lok ma Rwot ocika me loko bot lwak ducu, ki bot ajwaki ki lunebi, ci lwak ducu gumaka woko liking, kun giwaca ni, “Myero ito woko! <verse eid="JER 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9" />Pingo kono itito lok ki nying Rwot, kun iwaco ni, ‘Ot man bidoko calo Cilo, ki taun madit man bene bidoko wi obur, bidong nono labongo dano mo ma bedo iye?’” Ci lwak ducu gucoke guruma woko dyere i Ot pa Rwot.<verse eid="JER 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10" />Ka rwodi me Juda guwinyo lok magi, ci gua ki i Ot pa rwot gucito gubedo i kabedogi inget Doggang Manyen ma gidonyo kwede i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="JER 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11" />Ci ajwaki ki lunebi guwaco bot rwodi kacel ki lwak ni, “Dano man myero kingol kop me to iwiye, pien oloko lok marac ikom taunwa madit, kit macalo wun bene wuwinyo ki itwuni.”<verse eid="JER 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12" />Ci dok anwoyo loko lok bot rwodi kacel ki lwak ducu kun awaco ni, “Rwot oora me tito lok ikom Ot man ki ikom taun madit man, lok ducu ma wun dong wuwinyo atito botwuni. <verse eid="JER 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13" />Pimeno kombedi myero wuyub kitwu ki gin ma wutimo, ci bene wulub lok ma Rwot Lubangawu owaco botwu, ci Rwot biloko tame ikom gin marac ma onongo en dong oyube me timone ikomwuni. <verse eid="JER 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14" />Dong an mera atye ite twerowu. Wutii ikoma giwu gin ma wuneno ni ber dok tye atir. <verse eid="JER 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15" />Lok acel keken ma amito wunge en aye ni, kace wuneka giwu, ci wubineko dano ma peke ki bal, dok bene alii me tona bibedo iwiwu ki ikom taun madit man ki jo ducu ma bedo iye, pien i adane Rwot oora botwu pi loko lok magi ducu wek wuwiny ki itwu.”<verse eid="JER 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16" />Lacen rwodi kacel ki lwak ducu guwaco bot ajwaki ki lunebi ni, “Dano man pe myero kingol kop me to iwiye, pien en otito lok botwa ki nying Rwot Lubangawa.”<verse eid="JER 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17" />Inge meno ludongo mogo ikin ludongo me lobo gua malo ci guwaco bot lwak ducu ma gucoke ni, <verse eid="JER 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 3:12">Mik 3:12</ref></char></note>“Mika ma en dano me Morecet yam otito lok ikare pa Kejekia rwot me Juda, ma owaco bot jo ducu ni Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">‘Kibipuru Cion woko macalo poto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">Jerucalem bidoko wi obur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">ki got ma kigero Ot pa Rwot iwiye bidoko bunga.’<verse eid="JER 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19" />Rwot Kejekia kacel ki jo Juda pe guneko Mika. Ento Kejekia olworo Rwot ci oteme me tiyo gin maber ma Rwot pwoyo. Ci meno omiyo Rwot oloko tame ikom gin marac ma onongo en oyube me timone ikomgi. Ento kombedi wan dong wacok kelo can madit ikomwa kekenwa giwa.”<verse eid="JER 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20" />(Tye dano mo mukene bene ma otito lok i nying Rwot, en aye Uria wod pa Cemaya me Kiriat-jearim. En otito lok ikom taun madit man ki rok man i lok marom ki pa Jeremiani. <verse eid="JER 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21" />Ikare ma rwot Yekoyakim ki twoni lwenye ki rwodi ducu guwinyo loke, ci rwot oteme me wek kineke woko; ento ikare ma Uria owinyo lok man, ci lworo omake omiyo en olwi oringo woko i Ejipt. <verse eid="JER 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22" />Ma omiyo rwot Yekoyakim ocwalo jo mogo kacel ki Elnatan wod pa Akbor ki jo mukene kacel kwede, oorogi me cito i Ejipt, <verse eid="JER 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23" />ci gin gumako Uria wa ki i Ejipt gukelo bot rwot Yekoyakim ma oneke woko ci obolo kome i kabedo me yik kama kiyiko iye dano atagu.)<verse eid="JER 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24" />Ento pien Akikam wod pa Capan ogwoka maber, omiyo pe kimiya icing lwak wek guneka woko.<verse eid="JER 26:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia otweyo okol i ngute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2 Luk 24:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:11-13">2 Tek 36:11-13</ref></char>
    </note>Cutcut inge kare ma dong Jedekia wod pa Yocia odoko rwot me Juda, en aye Rwot oloko kweda, <verse eid="JER 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2" />kun waca ni ayub del alir woko me tol kacel ki yat rii kweri dyang ci atwegi i nguta. <verse eid="JER 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3" />Ka Rwot dok otita me cwalo lok bot luker me Edom, Moab, Ammon, Turo ki Cidon, kun wok ki bot lukwenagi ma gubino i Jerucalem kalimo Jedekia rwot me Juda. <verse eid="JER 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4" />Rwot me mony, ma en Lubanga pa Icrael, otita ni acik lukwena magi me tito bot lukergi ni Rwot dong otyeko waco kuman ni, <verse eid="JER 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5" />“An aye ma acweyo lobo ki twerona dok ki tekona, wa dano ki lee ducu ma gitye iwi lobo; dong atwero miyogi bot ngat mo keken ma ayero. <verse eid="JER 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6" />Kombedi dong atyeko miyo lobo magi woko ducu i cing latica Nebukadnejar, rwot me Babilon, dok bene amiye wa lee tim ni gutii bote. <verse eid="JER 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7" />Rok ducu bitic bote, gibitiyo bot wode ki bot lakware, nio ka kare biromo ma labone dong kibiloyo woko. Ka lacen dong roke bibedo opii, gibitiyo bot rok matego mapol ki luker madito.<verse eid="JER 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8" />Kace inen rok mo nyo ker mo pe bitic bot Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon, ma pe gibimine ite loc pa rwot me Babilon calo dyang matye ki okol i ngute, ci abiketo can ikom rok meno kun aneko jone woko ki pala lucwan i lweny, dok abimiyo kec nekogi, ki two gemo bene bipoto ikomgi, nio wang ma amiyo gutum woko ite twero pa Nebukadnejar. Man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9" />Pimeno pe myero wuwiny lok pa lunebiwu, lutyet, lulek lek, lutyet ki ajaa ki lutalgu, ma gibedo ka waco botwu ni, ‘Pe wubidoko opii pa rwot me Babilon.’ <verse eid="JER 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10" />Gin gitye ka bwolowu abwola, ma adwogine en aye ni abimiyo kikwanyowu woko ki i lobowu giterowu woko kamabor. Abiryemowu woko, ci wubito wutum woko ducu. <verse eid="JER 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11" />Ento kace rok mo omiine kene ite loc pa rwot me Babilon kun tiyo bote, ci abiweko en dong bibedo i lobone, kun puru iye, dok bene bedo iye, man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12" />Ci awaco lakit lok acelu bot Jedekia rwot me Juda ni, “Wumiine kenwu ite loc pa rwot me Babilon. Wutii bote kacel ki bot lwake ci wubibedo kwo. <verse eid="JER 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13" />Pingo i mito ni in kacel ki lutuwu kinekwu woko i lweny, nyo kec onekwu woko, ki two gemo bene opot ikomwu? Man aye gin ma Rwot dong otyeko wacone ma bitime ikom rok ma pe bimiine kene ite loc pa rwot me Babilon. <verse eid="JER 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14" />Pe myero iwiny lok pa lunebi ma giwaco botwu ni pe wubitiyo bot rwot me Babilon. Gin gitye kabwolowu abwola. <verse eid="JER 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15" />Rwot kikome owaco ni en gire pe eorogi, gin gitye kaloko lok goba botwu ki nyinge. Dong adwogine en aye ni en biryemowu woko ci wubito wutum woko, wun kacel ki lunebi ma giloko lok goba magi botwuni.”<verse eid="JER 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16" />Ci awaco bot ajwaki kacel ki lwak ni Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Pe myero wuwiny lok pa lunebi ma gitito botwu ni jami ma gitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Rwot dong cok kibidwokogi cen ki i Babilon. Lok meno ma gitye katitone botwuni obedo ka lok goba. <verse eid="JER 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17" />Pe wuwiny lokgi; wutii mewu tic bot rwot me Babilon wek wubed kwo. Pingo omyero kibal taun madit man woko wek odok wi obur? <verse eid="JER 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18" />Kace inen ni gin lunebi adada, dok kalok ma gititoni obedo lok pa Rwot, ci wek guleg Rwot me mony, ni wek pe oye kikwany jami ma kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Rwot ma gudong i Jerucalem ki i ot pa rwot me Juda, wek pe kitergi woko i Babilon.”<verse eid="JER 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19" />Rwot me mony owaco lok kuman mukemo wirgu, nam, okar mac, ki mukemo jami mukene mayam kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga ma gudong i Jerucalem, <verse eid="JER 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20" />mayam Nebukadnejar pe okwanyogi oterogi woko, ikare ma en omako Yekonia wod pa Yekoyakim rwot me Juda kacel ki ludito ducu me awora me Juda ki Jerucalem oterogi woko i opii i Babilon. Ci en owaco botgi ni, <verse eid="JER 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21" />“Wuwiny gin ma an Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, atye kawacone mukemo jami ma kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Rwot ma kiwekogi i Ot pa Rwot ki i ot pa rwot me Juda ki i Jerucalem. <verse eid="JER 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22" />Kibikwanyogi kiterogi woko i Babilon nio wang ma an dok atamo pirgi. Ci abicokogi adwokogi cen aketogi kakargi i kabedo man.”<verse eid="JER 27:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia gin ki lanebi Anania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2 Luk 24:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:11-13">2 Tek 36:11-13</ref></char>
    </note>I mwaka acelu, i dwe me abic me mwaka me angwen me loc pa Jedekia rwot me Juda, Anania wod pa Ajur, ma en lanebi ma tugi Gibeon, oloko kweda i Ot pa Rwot. En oloko kweda inyim ajwaki kacel ki lwak <verse eid="JER 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2" />ni Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kuman ni, “Dong atyeko turu twero ki teko me loc pa rwot me Babilon woko. <verse eid="JER 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3" />Ma nongo mwaka aryo peya otum, abikelo jami ducu mayam kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Rwot mayam Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon okwanyo ki i Ot pa Lubanga otero woko i Babilon, ci adwokogi cen i kabedo man. <verse eid="JER 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4" />Dok bene abikwanyo Yekonia wod pa Yekoyakim rwot me Juda, kacel ki jo Juda mayam kiterogi i opii i Babilon, ci abidwokogi cen i kabedo man. Pien dong abituru twero ki tek me loc pa rwot me Babilon woko. Man Rwot ma owaco.”<verse eid="JER 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5" />Ka dok aloko ki lanebi Anania inyim ajwaki kacel ki inyim lwak ducu ma onongo gucung i Ot pa Rwot; <verse eid="JER 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6" />ci awaco ni, “Amen! Ka Rwot bitimo man ci ber. Rwot myero omii lok ma ibedo ka titoneni obed ada, wek okwany jami ma kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Rwot kacel ki jo ma kiterogi i opii i Babilon odwokgi cen i kabedo man. <verse eid="JER 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7" />Ento kombedi dong wuwiny lok ma awaco botwu ki bot lwak ducu. <verse eid="JER 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8" />Lunebi ma gukwongo nyimwu ki nyima ikare macon adada, onongo gunyutu ni ikare me anyim lweny bibedo tye, kec bibedo tye, ki two gemo bipoto ikom rok mapol ki ikom ker matego. <verse eid="JER 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9" />Ma omiyo lanebi mo ma bitito lok kom kuc, ka loke obedo ada, ci kibiniang adada ni Rwot kara aye ma ocwalo lanebi meno ada.”<verse eid="JER 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10" />Ci lanebi Anania ogonyo rii bao woko ki i nguta, oturugi woko, <verse eid="JER 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11" />ci oloko lok inyim lwak kun waco ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni meno aye bene kit ma ebituru kwede okol ma Nebukadnejar otweyo i ngut jo me rok ducu ma nongo mwaka aryo peya otum.” Ci aa gira acito woko.<verse eid="JER 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12" />Lacen inge kare ma lanebi Anania onongo dong oturu kwede ki rii bao woko ki i ngutani, Rwot owaco bota <verse eid="JER 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13" />ni acit awac bot Anania ni, “Rwot owaco ni meno itwero turu rii bao kit macalo i turuni, ento abileyo kakargi ki rii nyonyo. <verse eid="JER 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14" />Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco ni, ‘Dong atyeko keto rii nyonyo i ngut jo me rok ducu wek gutii bot Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon; gin bitic bote, pien dong bene atyeko miyo bote kadi wa lee me tim.’”<verse eid="JER 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15" />Ci awaco bot lanebi Anania ni, “Anania, winy, Rwot gire pe ocwali, ento in dong imiyo lwak gubedo kageno lok goba ma itito botgi. <verse eid="JER 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16" />Ma omiyo Rwot owaco ni, ‘Nen, abikwanyi woko ki i lobo. I mwaka man kikome ibito iye woko, pien ibedo katito bot dano ni gujem woko ikoma.’”<verse eid="JER 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17" />I mwaka meno cut i dwe me abiro, lanebi Anania oto woko.<verse eid="JER 28:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia ocoyo waraga bot Lujudaya ma gitye i opii i Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:12-16">2 Luk 24:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Tek 36:10</ref></char>
    </note>An Jeremia acoyo waraga bot lutela ducu ma gitye ikin opii, ki bot ajwaki ki lunebi, ki bot lwak ducu mayam Nebukadnejar omakogi ki i Jerucalem ci oterogi woko i opii i Babilon. <verse eid="JER 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2" />Acoyo waraga man lacen ikare ma onongo dong rwot Yekonia kacel ki mine, jo ma kikologi, rwodi me Juda ki Jerucalem, ludiro tic mapatpat onongo dong gua woko ki i Jerucalem kiterogi woko i opii. <verse eid="JER 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3" />Amiyo waraga man bot Elaca wod pa Capan gin ki Gemaria wod pa Ilkia, mayam Jedekia rwot me Juda oorogi gucito i Babilon bot Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon. Waragane onongo loke kwane kit man ni, <verse eid="JER 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4" />“Rwot me mony, ma en Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco kuman bot jo ducu ma en oweko Nebukadnejar omakogi ki i Jerucalem ci oterogi woko i Babilon ni, <verse eid="JER 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5" />‘Wuger odi ci wubed dong iye. Wupur poto ci wucam gin ma ocek iye. <verse eid="JER 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6" />Wunyom mon wek wunywal awobe ki anyira. Wuwek awobewu bene gunyom, wek gin bene gunywal lutino. Myero wunya, welwu omede ma pe odok cen. <verse eid="JER 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7" />Wutii tic maber pi berbedo me gang kama amiyo kiterowu iye me bedo opii. Wulega pi nying gang meno, pien ka kwo ma i taun madit meno tye maber miyo wun bene wubibedo maber. <verse eid="JER 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8" />An a Rwot me mony, ma an Lubanga pa Icrael, awaco kit man ni pe wuwek lunebiwu ki lutyet ma gitye ikinwu gubwolwu, dok bene pe wuwiny lok me lek mogo ma gin lekoni, <verse eid="JER 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9" />pien lok ma gitye katitone botwu ki nyingani meno lok goba; an pe acwalogi gira, man an Rwot ma awaco.’<verse eid="JER 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:21">2 Tek 36:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:11">Jer 25:11</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:2">Dan 9:2</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Ka mwaka pyere abiro ma kimiyo ki Babilon dong otum, ci an abilimowu, abicobo cikena pirwu ci abikwanyowu adwokowu cen i kabedo man. <verse eid="JER 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11" />An keken aye angeyo yub ma atye kwede pirwu, man an Rwot ma awaco, yub me berbedo ento pe yub pi gin marac, yub pi kelo botwu kare me anyim ma wutye ki gen pireni. <verse eid="JER 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12" />Ci wubibino bota wulega, an abiwinyo legawu. <verse eid="JER 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:29">Nwo 4:29</ref></char></note>Wubiyenya ci wubinonga bene, kace onongo wuyenya ki cwinywu ducu. <verse eid="JER 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14" />Eyo, awaco ni wubinonga ci abidwoko gumwu botwu kun acokowu woko ki i rok ducu ki i kabedo ducu kama yam aryemowu wucito iye, ci abikelowu adwokowu cen i kabedo kama yam akwanyowu ki iye ma kiterowu i opiini.’<verse eid="JER 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15" />Pien wun dong onongo wuwaco ni, Rwot dong omiyowu lunebi ki i Babilon, <verse eid="JER 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16" />kong wuwiny lok ma Rwot owaco ikom rwot matye kaloc kun obedo iwi komker pa Daudi, ki dok lok ma okemo jo me taun madit man, ki lutuwu mayam pe gucito kacel kwedwu i opiini. <verse eid="JER 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17" />Rwot me mony owaco kit man ni, ‘Abikelo lweny, kec ki two gemo, ci abimiyo gibedo calo nyig oduru ma otop ma dong rac adada ma pe kitwero camone. <verse eid="JER 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18" />Abilubu korgi ki lweny, kec ki two gemo, abimiyo gibedo ginacaya bot jo me rok me wi lobo ducu, gibitic ki nyinggi macalo lok lacen dano, gibibedo gin mamiyo lworo bot dano, makelo jwat matek, ki lok me cac ikin rok ducu kama onongo aryemogi gucito iye. <verse eid="JER 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19" />Man bitime ikomgi pien gin pe gubedo kaketo cwinygi me lubu lok ma onongo acwalo botgi teretere kun wok ki bot lutica lunebi; ento gukwero winyo loka woko. Man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20" />Wuwiny loka, wun jo ducu mayam kimakowu ki i Jerucalem ka kiterowu woko i opii i Babilon’<verse eid="JER 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21" />Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco lok ma okemo Akab wod pa Kolaya ki Jedekia wod pa Maceya ma gitito lok me goba botwu ki nyingani. En owaco ni ebimiyogi woko i cing Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon, ci en binekogi woko kamaleng inyimwu. <verse eid="JER 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22" />Ka inen jo mayam kikwanyogi ki i Jerucalem ci kiterogi i opii i Babilon gimito ceno ngat mo, ci gibiwaco ni, ‘Rwot myero otii kwedi kit macalo en otiyo kwede ki Jedekia gin ki Akab, ma rwot me Babilon obulugi woko makwo ki mac.’ <verse eid="JER 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23" />Man aye bibedo can ma bipoto ikomgi pien gubedo katimo tim mogo ma pe myero, gutimo abor ki mon pa luwotgi, dok bene gubedo kaloko lok goba ki nyinga ma kun an pe acikogi ni guloki. An aye ma angeyo loke, dok bene atye macalo caden ikomgi. Man Rwot ma owaco.”<verse eid="JER 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waraga pa Cemaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24" />Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael owaco bota me tito bot Cemaya me Nekelam ni, <verse eid="JER 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25" />“In i cwalo waraga i nyingi keni bot jo Jerucalem ducu, ki bot Jepania wod pa ajwaka Maceya, ki bot ajwaki mukenegu ducu kun iwaco ni <verse eid="JER 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26" />Rwot oketo in me bedo ajwaka ma ka ajwaka Yekoyada, wek i bed ladit maloyo Ot pa Rwot kun ineno lupoya ducu ma gitito lok, ci i makgi, i twegi woko ki okol, kun i royo dok i rwako ogul nyonyo i ngutgi. <verse eid="JER 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27" />Pingo pe i juku Jeremia ma en dano me Anatot matye katito lok botwuni? <verse eid="JER 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28" />Pien en onongo ocwalo lok botwa i Babilon ma waconi kare me bedowu i opii bibedo dwong; wuger odi ci wubed iye. Wupur poto ci wucam gin ma ocek iye.”<verse eid="JER 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29" />Ento ka ajwaka Jepania ogamo waraga man, ci okwano inyima, <verse eid="JER 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30" />ci Rwot dok owaco bota ni, <verse eid="JER 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31" />“Cwal lok ma okemo Cemaya wod pa Nekelam bot jo ducu ma kiterogi i opii i Babilon kun iwaco botgi ni, ‘Kit macalo Cemaya dong otito lok botwu ma onongo an pe acwalo en, dok bene omiyo dong wuketo genwu i lok me gobani, <verse eid="JER 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32" />pimeno abiketo can ikom Cemaya wod pa Nekelam kacel ki likwayone. En pe bidong ki ngat mo makwo ki ikom lwak man ma bineno gin maber ma abitimo bot jona, pien en oloko lok ma omiyo dano gujemo woko ikoma. Man an Rwot ma awaco.’”<verse eid="JER 29:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30" />
  <para style="s1">Cike pa Rwot bot jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1" />Man lok ma Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="JER 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2" />Rwot ma en Lubanga pa Icrael owaca ni, “Co lok ducu ma abedo kaloko botini i buk, <verse eid="JER 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3" />pien kare tye kabino ma abidwoko iye gum bot jona jo Icrael ki jo Juda. Abikwanyogi adwokogi cen i lobo mayam amiyo bot kwarigi, gibileyo dong bedo meggi. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4" />Magi gin aye lok ma Rwot oloko ma okemo Icrael ki Juda.<verse eid="JER 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5" />Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">“Awinyo koko ma bango dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">koko makelo lworo, ento pe makelo kuc.<verse eid="JER 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6" />Kong ipenye kekeni ci dok itam ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">laco mono twero nywalo latin?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Pingo kono aneno laco acel acel ma omako pyere ki cinge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">calo dako matye ka rem ki nywal?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Pingo wang dano ducu olwal woko?<verse eid="JER 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7" />Maa do! Nino marac tye kabino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">pe tye nino mo marom kwede;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">en aye nino me can bot likwayo pa Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">kadi bed kumeno kibilarogi ki i can meno.”<verse eid="JER 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8" />Rwot me mony owaco ni, “Ka nino meno oromo abituru rii bao woko ki i ngutgi dok bene abicodo nyor ma kitweyogi kwede woko; cake ikare meno pe dong gibibedo opii pa lurok matwal. <verse eid="JER 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9" />Ento gin gibitiyo bot an Rwot Lubangagi, ki bot lakwar Daudi, ma an aye abimiyo botgi me bedo rwotgi.<verse eid="JER 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:27-28">Jer 46:27-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pe wulwor, wun likwayo pa latica Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">wun jo Icrael, cwinywu bene pe myero obale woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Abilarowu ki i lobo maca matye kama bori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">abilaro likwayowu bene ki i lobo mayam kiterogi iye i opii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Likwayo pa Yakobo gibidwogo cen ci gibibedo mot ki kuc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">ngat mo pe ma bimiyo gibedo ki lworo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11" />Abibedo kwedwu pi larowu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Abijwero jo me rok ducu mayam akeyowu ikin gi ci atyekogi woko liweng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">ento wun pe abityekowu woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Abipwodowu maberber pe matye ki kiniga madwong tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">ento pe abiwekowu ma pe aketo can ikomwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12" />Rwot owaco bot jone ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">“Wang retwu dong pe twero cang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">ma wang bure odet marac.<verse eid="JER 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13" />Ngat mo pe matwero cung pirwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:13">yat mo bene peke me aketa iwang burwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:13">wang burwu pe dong cang.<verse eid="JER 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14" />Jo ma gimarowuni ducu wigi dong owil woko ikomwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">gin pe dong giparo pirwu wa ki acel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">Pien alwenyo ikomwu macalo wun lukwora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">dok bene aketo can magwar ikomwu labongo kica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">pien balwu dwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">ki gin marac ma wutimo bene pol.<verse eid="JER 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15" />Pingo pud wukok pi ret ma wulimo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Aremwu pe dong twero cang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Aketo can ikomwu kit man, pien balwu dwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">ki gin marac ma wutimo bene pol mada.<verse eid="JER 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16" />Pimeno jo ducu ma otyekowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">gin bene kibityekogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">lukworwu ducu bene kibimakogi kiterogi woko i opii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">Jo ducu ma unuwu gin bene kibiunugi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">ki jo ducu ma yako jamiwu gin bene kibiyako jamigi woko.<verse eid="JER 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17" />Pien abimiyo wubedo doki ma komwu yot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">ci abicango wang burwu woko bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">kadi bed lukworwu gin giwaci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">‘Cion dong odoko gin ma kibolo woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">ma ngat mo dong pe paro pire.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">“Nen, abidwoko likwayo pa Yakobo cen i lobogi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">dok kica bimaka ikom jo me dogola acel acel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">gibigero taun madito acel acel ducu odoco i kabedone macon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">ki ot acel acel bene gibigero kakare.<verse eid="JER 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19" />Jo ma kumu dong gibiwero wer me pwoc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">gibibedo kadange bene pi yomcwiny.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">Abimiyo ginya gidoko pol ma pe welgi jwik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">ci abikelo deyo botgi.<verse eid="JER 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20" />Lutinogi bibedo pol kit macalo yam gubedo kwede ikare macon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:20">ki lwakgi bene bicung inyima matek liking;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:20">ci abiketo can ikom jo ducu ma unugi.<verse eid="JER 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21" />Ngat ma bibedo laker ma loyogi bene bia ki ikin gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">ngat ma bibedo lalocgi bibedo dano me rokgi kikome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Ka alwonge, ci en binyiko cok bota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">pien ngat mo pe twero ete me bino cok bota ka pe alwonge.<verse eid="JER 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22" />Wun wubibedo jona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:22">ki an abibedo Lubangawu.”<verse eid="JER 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23" />Kong inen yamo kot pa Rwot! Akemone bedo calo yamo lapiru mager, ma bimwoc woko lituc ki ka wi jo maracu. <verse eid="JER 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24" />Akemone pe bigik nio wang ma en ocobo tiyo gin ma onongo dong otamo me timone. Ikare ma lacen, inino ma pud tye anyim, jone gibiniang iye maber adada.<verse eid="JER 30:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31" />
  <para style="s1">Dwogo pa jo Icrael paco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1" />Rwot owaco ni, “Kare tye kabino ma abibedo Lubanga pa jo me dogola ducu pa jo Icrael, ki gin bene gibibedo jona. <verse eid="JER 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2" />Ceng anyutu kicana bot jo ma gubwot ki i lak to i dye tim. Ikare ma jo Icrael guparo pi nongo yweyo, <verse eid="JER 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3" />an anyute botgi ki kamabor. Wun jo Icrael kare ducu abedo ka marowu, kitmeno dok pud amede ki nyutu botwu mar mera ma pe loke. <verse eid="JER 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4" />Abigerowu woko odoco wun jo Icrael, ci wubicung. Dok wubikwanyo ajaa agoyagu ci wubimyelo myel ki yomcwiny madwong. <verse eid="JER 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5" />Dok bene pud wubipito olok iwi cere me Camaria, dong jo ma pito olok meno gibicamo ma ocekke. <verse eid="JER 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6" />Ada, kare tye kabino ma lukurpiny gibidange gilwongo lwongo ki iwi cere me lobo Epraim ni, ‘Wubin kany! Wacitu malo i Cion, bot Rwot Lubangawa.’”<verse eid="JER 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7" />Rwot waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">“Wuwer wer ki dwon malongo ki yomcwiny pi jo pa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">wudange matek pien gin rok madit ikin rok ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Wuwer wer me pak kun wuwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">‘Rwot dong olaro jone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">olaro jo Icrael ducu mayam gudong.’<verse eid="JER 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8" />Nen, abikelogi woko ki i lobo matye tung kumalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">abicokogi bene ki kamabor ki i agiki piny.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Lutowang ki lungolo gibibino kacel kwedgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">mon ma guyac kacel ki mon ma dong gicok nywal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">gibidwogo cen gibedo rok matek.<verse eid="JER 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9" />Jona gibidwogo cen ki koko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">gibibedo ka lega kun nongo atelogi kwede me dok cen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">abimiyo giwoto ki inget laora kulu ma pii opong iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">gibilubu yoo atir ma pe gibiyoko tyen gi wa ki acel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">pien atye macalo wego bot jo Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Epraim aye obedo latin kayo ma akwongo nywalone.”<verse eid="JER 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10" />Rwot waco kuman, “Wuwiny loka, wun rok ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">ci wutit loka kama boco i lobo matye i dog namgu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">An ma akeyo jo Icrael wokoni aye dok abicokogi adwokogi cen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">abigwokogi woko maber kit macalo lakwat gwoko kwede romine.<verse eid="JER 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11" />Dong atyeko koko jo pa Yakobo woko ki i opii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:11">alarogi bene ki i cing rok matek ma katogi.<verse eid="JER 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12" />Gibibino ma giwero wer matek pi yomcwiny iwi got Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">mot ma an Rwot amiyogini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">biyomo cwinygi mada, en mot me ngano, kongo bwino, ki moo nyig jeituni, romi ki dyangigu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Gibibedo calo poto ma kionyo iye pii ma oromo kare ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">pe gibingeyo cwercwiny dong matwal.<verse eid="JER 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13" />Anyira bimyelo myel ci cwinygi bedo yom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">awobe ki jo muteggi ducu gibibedo ki yomcwiny madwong.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Abikweyo cwinygi ci aloko kumugi doko yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">ci cwercwiny ma gitye kwede bene biloke doko yomcwiny.<verse eid="JER 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14" />Abimiyo ajwaki gicamo cam mabeco ma bup ma giyeng adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:14">dok abityeko miti pa jona woko liweng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:14">man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kica omako Rwot ikom jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 35:16-19">Aca 35:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:18">Mat 2:18</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaca ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">“Koko tye ka winye i Rama, koko ki kumu madwong.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Lakeri tye ka kok pi lutinone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">en okwero woko ni pe dong kikwe cwinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">pien lutinone dong gutum woko.<verse eid="JER 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16" />Wek koko obedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">duny pig wangi bene woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">Tici ducu ma itiyo bot lutinoni Lubanga bimiyi pwoc pire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">gibidwogo cen ki i lobo pa lukworwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17" />Gen tye pirwu ikare me anyim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:17">lutinowu gibia gidwogo cen i lobogi kikome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:17">Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18" />Awinyo ka jo Epraim tye kakoko ki cwercwiny kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">‘Rwot, wan wabedo calo dyang ma lapele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">ento dong ipwodowa adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">ci ipwonyowa me lubu gin ma i mito.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Kwanywa i dwokwa cen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">ci wan bene wabidok cen boti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">pien in i Rwot Lubangawa.<verse eid="JER 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19" />Onongo waloke wabwoti woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">ento ingeye cutcut wangut wabedo ki cwiny me dwogo cen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Ikare ma dong ityeko keto can ikomwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">wakulu wiwa woko ki cwercwiny me can.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Lewic omakowa mada dok alee otwodowa woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">pien watimo bal ikare ma onongo pud wan lutino.’<verse eid="JER 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20" />Epraim, in latina ma amaro adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">latin ma amaro makato ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Pien kare ducu ka alwongo nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">atamo piri ki mar madit.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Cwinya kute akuta ikomi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">dok abibedo ki kica ikomi bene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21" />Wuket lanyut ma nyutu botwu wanga yoo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">wugur yat mogo inget yoo ma binyutuwu yoo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">wutam pi yoo gudu ma en yoo ma wulubu ikare ma wubinoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Wudwog cen, wun jo Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">wudwog cen i gang ma nene wuwekoni.<verse eid="JER 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22" />Wubibedo ki akalakala pi kare marom mene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">wun jo ma pe gene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">Pien an Rwot dong aketo jami manyen dok pat i lobo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">pat macalo dako aye ma gwoko laco.”<verse eid="JER 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lonyo ma bibino pi lwak pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23" />Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco kuman ni, “Ka dong adwoko lwak man i lobogi, gin dok gibiwaco ki i lobo Juda ki i taun gi ducu ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:23">‘Rwot myero omii gum ikom got maleng me Jerucalem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:23">kabedo maleng kama en bedo iye.’<verse eid="JER 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24" />Ci dano gibibedo i Juda ki i taun gi ducu, lupur, lukwat kacel ki romigi bene gibibedo kunu. <verse eid="JER 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25" />Abimiyo jo ma guol gilimo teko, dok abimiyo jo ducu ma kec dong onyongo komgi woko giyeng ki cam. <verse eid="JER 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26" />Man bimiyo dano gibiwaco ni, ‘Anino woko ci odiko aco anongo atye maber ma koma yot.’<verse eid="JER 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27" />An Rwot, dong awaco ni, kare tye kabino ma abipongo lobo Icrael ki Juda woko ki dano kacel ki lee. <verse eid="JER 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28" />Kit mayam amiyo kare ki lumerogi me putugi, kare me mukugi, kare me turugi, ki kare me tyekogi, ki kare me keto can ikomgi, kitmeno bene abinenoni agwokgi ikare ma apitogi, ki dok ka agerogi wek gudong malo. Man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 18:2">Eje 18:2</ref></char></note>Ka kare meno oromo, dano pe dok gibimede ka waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">‘Kwariwa gucamo nyig olok mawac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">ento man odingo lak lutino woko.’<verse eid="JER 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30" />Ento dano acel acel ma bicamo nyig olok mawac lake biding woko; kitmeno dano acel acel bito pi bale en kikome.”<verse eid="JER 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:28">Mat 26:28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:24">Mar 14:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:20">Luk 22:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:25">1 Kor 11:25</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:6">2 Kor 3:6</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 8:8-12">Ibru 8:8-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot owaco ni, “Nen, kare tye kabino ma abiketo iye gicike manyen ki jo Icrael ki jo Juda bene. <verse eid="JER 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32" />Gicike man pe bibedo calo gicike mayam aketo ikin an ki kwarigi ikare ca ma onongo akwanyogi woko ki i Ejipt ki tek me cinga akelogi woko ca kun atelo wigi. Gin guturu gicike ma aketo kwedgi, kadi bed onongo an abedo cwargi. <verse eid="JER 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:16">Ibru 10:16</ref></char></note>Ka kare meno oromo, man aye gicike ma abiketo ki jo Icrael; Abimiyo gibedo ki cika i tamgi, abicoyo bene bedo i cwinygi. An abibedo Lubangagi, ki gin gibibedo jona. <verse eid="JER 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:17">Ibru 10:17</ref></char></note>Ngat mo pe dong bipwonyo lawote, dok ngat mo bene pe biwaco bot omine nyo lutugi ni, ‘Nge Rwot.’ Gin ducu gibingeya, cake ikom jo matino o kwede wa ikom jo madito ma ikin gi. Abiweko balgi, pe dok abibedo ka po ikom gin marac ma gubedo katimone.”<verse eid="JER 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35" />Rwot miyo ceng ryeny i dyeceng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">dwe ki lakalatwe en miyo giryeny i dyewor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">En rubu pii me nam, ci miyo mor;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">nyinge kilwongo ni Rwot me mony.<verse eid="JER 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36" />Rwot ocike ni Icrael kare ducu bibedo rok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">dong bibedo pi kare ma lac kun lubu kit ma cik ma en eketo i loboni birii kwede.<verse eid="JER 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37" />Rwot waco ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">kace onongo kitwero pimo pol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">nyo ka kitwero roto te guti me lobo ki piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">meno keken aye bimiyo akwero jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">pi gin ducu ma dong gutyeko timo.<verse eid="JER 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38" />“Nen, kare tye kabino, man Rwot ma owaco, ma taun madit man kibigero odoco pi Rwot cake ki ikom lubele ma kilwongo ni Kananel o kwede wa i dogcel ma kilwongo ni Dogcel ma Ogone. <verse eid="JER 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39" />Dong tol me pimone kibimiyo cito wa kamabor woto atir o kwede wa i got Gareb, ka bigono dok piny o kwede i Goa. <verse eid="JER 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40" />Nota kama kicoro iye kom jo ma oto ki bur yugi, ki tim ducu ma inget laora kulu me Kidron nio kwede wa i Dogcel me Aguragura dok kwede yo tung kunyango, ci bibedo gin maleng bot an Rwot. Pe dok kibiputu taun madit man nyo kituru woko matwal.”<verse eid="JER 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia owilo lobo i Anatot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:1-7">2 Luk 25:1-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot oloko kweda i mwaka me apare me loc pa Jedekia rwot me Juda, ma en aye bene obedo mwaka me apar wiye aboro me loc pa Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon. <verse eid="JER 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2" />Ikare meno dul mony pa rwot me Babilon obedo ka lweny ikom Jerucalem, dok kiloro wiya woko idyekal pa lukurpiny matye i gangkal pa rwot me Juda. <verse eid="JER 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3" />Rwot Jedekia onongo otweya i buc kunu pien gidota ni atyeto lok ni Rwot owaco ni, “Nen, abimiyo taun madit man woko i cing rwot me Babilon, ci en bimayo woko bene doko mere. <verse eid="JER 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4" />Rwot Jedekia pe bibwot wa ki acel ki i cing jo Kaldaya. Kibimiye woko i cing rwot me Babilon; en binene wang kiwang dok bene bilok kwede atyer kamaleng. <verse eid="JER 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5" />Kibitero Jedekia woko i Babilon, en bibedo kunu nio wang ma an aye abilime. Kadi bed en obedo ka lweny ikom jo Kaldaya, ento en pe biloyogi. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6" />Rwot owaco bota ni <verse eid="JER 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7" />Kanamel, ma en wod pa nera Calum, bibino bota kun mito ni awil lobone matye i Anatot, pien an a wate macok kwede adada, dok atye ki twero me wilone. <verse eid="JER 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8" />Cutcut kit macalo Rwot owaco, omara Kanamel obino bota idyekal pa lukurpiny, ci owaco bota ni awil lobone matye i Anatot i lobo pa Benjamin. Ci angeyo woko ni Rwot aye ma ocika ni atim gin macalo man.<verse eid="JER 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9" />Ci awilo poto meno ki bot omara Kanamel kun apimo lime woko bene bote ma welle oromo cekel me ryal apar wiye abiro. <verse eid="JER 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10" />Aketo cinga i waragane ci amwono woko, caden ma guneno obedo tye, ka apimo lime woko ki mijan. <verse eid="JER 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11" />Ci akwanyo waragane me wilo lobo ma onongo amwono doge woko, ma tito kit kare ma birii kwede ki cik ma myero kilub, ki kopine ma onongo pe kimwono, <verse eid="JER 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12" />ci amiyo bot Baruk wod pa Neria ma wod pa Maceya. Amiyogi ducu bote inyim Kanamel, inyim caden ma guketo cinggi i waraga me wilo poto ca, ki inyim Lujudaya ducu ma onongo gubedo idyekal. <verse eid="JER 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13" />Aciko Baruk ki inyimgi ducu kun awaco ni,<verse eid="JER 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14" />“Rwot me mony, ma Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco ni i kwany waraga man me wil ma kimwono doge woko ki ma pe kimwono dogeni, ci i ketgi i abino ma kicweyo ki lobo, wek kigwokgi gurii pi kare malac. <verse eid="JER 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15" />Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco ni odi, poti ki poto olok pud dok ki biwilo ki i lobo man.”<verse eid="JER 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega pa Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16" />Lacen ma dong atyeko miyo waraga me wil bot Baruk, ci alego ni, <verse eid="JER 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17" />“Ai Rwot Lubanga, in aye ma i cweyo polo ki lobo ki tweroni dok ki teki! Pe tye gin mo matek ma in pe i romo tiyone. <verse eid="JER 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18" />Ibedo kanyutu mar meri ma pe loke bot jo alip ki alip, ento in bene iculu kwor ikom dano, iketo can ikomgi pi bal pa kwarigi. In Lubanga madit dok itye ki twero ducu; nyingi Rwot me mony. <verse eid="JER 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19" />Ibedo ki yub me aura, dok itiyo gin ma tego ma dano uru; ineno bene gin ducu ma dano tiyo, imiyo mot bot dano acel acel kun lubu kit kwo ma en obedo kwede ki kit gin ma en obedo katimone. <verse eid="JER 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20" />Yam itiyo tango ki lanyutgu i lobo Ejipt. Pud imede bene katiyogi wa onyo, itiyo i Icrael ki ikin rok mukene ducu, ma omiyo kombedi dong ki ngeyi i kabedo ducu. <verse eid="JER 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21" />Dong tango ki lanyut ma itiyogu omiyo lukworwa gubedo ki lworo marac, dok itiyo ki tweroni ki teki ci ikelo joni jo Icrael woko ki i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="JER 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22" />Imiyo botgi lobo man ma miu dok ceko cam mabup, kit macalo yam ikwongo ni i bimiyo bot kwarigini. <verse eid="JER 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23" />Ento ikare ma dong gubino gudonyo i lobo man dok gucamo obedo meggi, ci gin pe gulubu gin ma icikogi kwede dok bene pe gulubu pwonyi wa ki acel, bene pe gutiyo gin mo kadi ki acel ikom gin mayam icikogi ni gutiini. Pimeno en aye ma omiyo i kelo can man iketo ikomgi. <verse eid="JER 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24" />Nen, jo Kaldaya dong gutoro cel lobo gurumu ki taun madit litit wek gima woko, dong bene gitye ka lweny. Pi man lweny, kec ki two gemo biweko taun madit man bipoto woko i cing jo Kaldaya. Gin mayam iloko dong otime, kun in bene itye ma ineno giri. <verse eid="JER 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25" />Kadi bed in ai Rwot Lubanga, in aye mayam ibedo kawaco bota ni awil poto man ki lim inyim lucaden, kadi bed taun madit dong cok poto woko i cing jo Kaldaya.”<verse eid="JER 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26" />Cutcut Rwot owaco bota ni, <verse eid="JER 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27" />“An a Rwot Lubanga pa dano ducu. Tye gin mo mono matek bota ma pe aromo tiyone? <verse eid="JER 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-11">2 Luk 25:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17-21">2 Tek 36:17-21</ref></char></note>Pimeno abimiyo taun madit man woko bot rwot Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon ki jo Kaldaya, ci gin gibimonyo taun madit man gimayo woko. <verse eid="JER 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29" />Jo Kaldaya ma gitye ka lweny ikom taun madit man gibibino gicwinyo mac ikome, ci gibiwangone woko kacel wa ki odi kama yam kiwango iye odok eceta bot jok Baal iwi otgu, kun gionyo gityer amatagu bot lubanga mukene me ngeto cwinya wek kiniga omaka. <verse eid="JER 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30" />Cake wacon i acaki me kwogi, jo Icrael ki jo Juda gubedo katiyo gin ma pe yomo cwinya keken; gin jo Icrael gumiyo kiniga omaka pi cal lubanga ma gutiyo ki cingini. <verse eid="JER 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31" />Taun madit man omiyo kinigana ki akemona obedo kamede woko ameda, cake ikare ma kigero kwede nio wa onyo. Dong atyeko moko me kwanyone woko ki ka wanga, <verse eid="JER 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32" />pi gin marac ma jo magi gutimo: jo Icrael ki jo Juda, kacel ki lukergi, ki lutela ma meggi, ajwakigi ki lunebigi, jo Juda ki jo Jerucalem. <verse eid="JER 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33" />Gin guloko ngegi gubwota woko; dok bene kadi bed abedo kapwonyogi teretere ento gin pe guwinyo pwony ma abedo kapwonyogi kwede. <verse eid="JER 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:10">2 Luk 23:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:30-31">Jer 7:30-31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:1-6">19:1-6</ref></char></note>Guketo cal lubangagi ma en gin me kweri wa i ot ma kilwongo ki nyinga, pi balone woko. <verse eid="JER 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:10">2 Luk 23:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:31">Jer 7:31</ref></char></note>Gugero wang jogi mapol me woro Baal i nota me Kinom kama gityero iye awobegi ki anyiragi bot jok Molek. Pe awaco botgi ni gutim man, dok bene gin ma kitmeno onongo pe odonyo i tama ni gibitimo gin macalo meno ma bimiyo jo Juda timo bal.”<verse eid="JER 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cike pi gin maber ma bitime i anyim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36" />Rwot, ma en Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco lok ma okemo taun madit man kuman ni, “Jeremia, in dong itito bot lwak man ni lweny, kec ki two gemo biweko kimiyo taun madit man woko i cing rwot me Babilon. Kombedi winy lok mukene ma an abiwaco. <verse eid="JER 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37" />Nen, abicito kacoko lwak man woko ducu ki i lobo ducu kama yam aryemogi gucito iye ikare ma onongo kiniga ki akemo ki akeca omaka ikomgi; abidwokogi i kabedo man, abimiyo gibedo maber dok ki kuc. <verse eid="JER 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38" />Gin gibibedo jona, ki an bene abibedo Lubangagi. <verse eid="JER 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39" />Abimiyo gibedo ki cwiny acel ki kit acel, wek gubed kawora matwal, wek gin ki lutinogi ma bilubugi i anyim gubed maber. <verse eid="JER 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40" />Abiketo gicike ma bedo nakanaka kwedgi, ki ni pe abiloke aweko timo gin maber botgi, dok bene abimiyo gibedo kalwora ki i cwinygi, wek pe guloke gubwota woko. <verse eid="JER 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41" />Cwinya bibedo yom katimo gin maber botgi, dok abikelogi gibedo i lobo man matwal ki gen madit kun nongo aketogi ki cwinya ducu ki tipuna ducu.<verse eid="JER 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42" />Kit macalo akelo can man aketo ikom lwak man, pimeno bene abicito kamiyogi jami ducu mabeco mayam acike ni abimiyo botgi. <verse eid="JER 32:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43" />Ento kibiwilo poti ki i lobo man ma ceng giwaco ni dong odoko tim aroo kama dano ki lee dong pe gibedo iye, dok bene onong giwaco ni kibimiyo woko i cing jo Kaldaya. <verse eid="JER 32:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44" />Dong potti dano gibiwilone ki lim, ki waraga me wilo lobo bene gibiketo iye cing ci gimwono woko maber kun nongo caden gumoko coc me wilone bene. Man bitime i lobo pa Benjamin, ki i kabedo me gangi ducu ma gurumu Jerucalem, ki i taun ducu me Juda, ki i taun me lobo godigodi, atika ne i gangi me Cepela ki i gangi me Negeb. Ci abidwoko gum pa jo man botgi kun adwokogi cen i lobogi kikome. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 32:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33" />
  <para style="s1">Cike mukene pi gin maber ma bitime i anyim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1" />Rwot dok oloko bota tyen me aryone ikare ma onongo pud kitweya woko i ot buc matye idyekal pa lukurpiny. <verse eid="JER 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2" />Rwot ma ocweyo lobo, ma omiyo lobo ocung i kabedone kikome, oloko kweda. En ma nyinge kilwongo ni Rwot owaca kuman ni, <verse eid="JER 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3" />“Lwonga, ci abigamo dogi; abititi pi gin madito dok ma kiuru ma pud peya ingeyo gin mo ikomgi liweng. <verse eid="JER 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4" />An a Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, awaco ni odi ma i Jerucalem ki gangkal pa luker me Juda ma kibimukugi kiretogi woko piny me keto lageng me gengo lumerok me donyo kalweny ikom kabedo man. Dong konye pe me cito kalweny ikom cel lobo ma jo Kaldaya gutoroni: <verse eid="JER 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5" />kadi bed kumeno, jo Kaldaya gitye kabino ka lweny ki ka pongo taun madit man woko ki kom jo ma oto, ma an ki koma aye dong abinekogi pi kinigana kacel ki akemona. An dong aloko ngeya woko ikom taun madit man pi tim ducu maracu ma jo ma bedo iye gutimo.<verse eid="JER 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6" />Ento abicango taun madit man dok abimiyo jo ma iye gibedo ma komgi yot. Abicango jo ma gibedo iye kun abinyutu botgi kuc madit ma bimiyo gibibedo labongo lworo. <verse eid="JER 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7" />Abidwoko gum pa jo Juda botgi ki pa jo Icrael, abigerogi odoco kit macalo yam gubedo con. <verse eid="JER 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8" />Abilonyogi woko maleng ki ikom bal aliigi ki bal mayam gutimo ikoma, ci abiweko bal aliigi ki lok me jemo mayam gujemo kwede ikoma. <verse eid="JER 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9" />Pimeno Jerucalem bibedo taun madit me yomcwiny, me pak, ki me deyo bota; dok rok ducu ma iwi lobo bilworo, dok komgi bene bimyel, ka onongo guwinyo pi gin maber ma atye katiyone pi jo Jerucalem, ki pi berbedo ma atye kakelone ikom taun madit man.”<verse eid="JER 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Dano giwaco ni kabedo man obedo calo tim aroo; dok dano kadi ki lee ma bedo iye peke. Man obedo lok ada ni taun magi me Juda ki yoo me Jerucalem gitye nono; dano nyo lee mo peke ma bedo kunu. Ento i kabedo magi dok wubiwinyo iye <verse eid="JER 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Tek 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Tek 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Eji 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Jab 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136:1</ref></char></note>dwon me yomcwiny ki yomcwiny madwong, dwon anyira ger ki dwon lunyom. Wubiwinyo dano ka giwero wer ka gikelo gityer me pwoc i oda; ma gibiwaci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">‘Wumii pwoc bot Rwot me mony, pien en Rwot ber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">mar mere ma pe loke bedo nakanaka.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 33:11">Abimiyo lobo man bedo lobo mulony kit macalo yam onongo tye kwede wacon, man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12" />Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, “I lobo man kama obedo calo tim aroo, dok kama kadi dano nyo lee pe bedo iye, ikare me anyim lum dok bibedo tye iye kama lukwat gitero romigi iye kacam. <verse eid="JER 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13" />I taun ducu me lobo godigodi, i taun me Cepela, ki i taun me Negeb, i lobo pa Benjamin, i kabedo ducu ma orumu Jerucalem, ki i taun me Juda, lukwat dok gibikwano romigi. Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:5-6">Jer 23:5-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nen, kare tye kabino, en aye kare ma abicobo iye cike mayam aketo ki jo Icrael ki jo Juda. <verse eid="JER 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15" />Inino meno ki ikare meno abiketo iye lakwar Daudi kikome me bedo rwot. En bibedo jang yat ma bilot ki kit ma atir, ma biloyo loc ki ryeko, dok bitiyo gin matye atir dok kakare i lobo man. <verse eid="JER 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16" />Ikare ma nongo en tye rwot, jo Juda gibibedo mot labongo lworo mo, ki jo Icrael bene dong gibibedo ki kuc. Gibilwongo taun madit meno ki nying ni, ‘Rwot aye ma Lalarwa.’<verse eid="JER 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">2 Cam 7:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:4">1 Luk 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-14">1 Tek 17:11-14</ref></char>
    </note>An Rwot, dong atyeko cike ni kare ducu dano mo bibedo tye ma en lakwar Daudi ma myero obed rwot me Icrael, <verse eid="JER 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-10">Wel 3:5-10</ref></char></note>dok bene kare ducu ajwaki bibedo tye ma gia ki i kaka pa Levi ma gin aye gibicung inyima nakanaka katyero gitum awanga, gityer me moko kwon, ki gitum mukenegu ducu.”<verse eid="JER 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19" />Rwot dok owaca ni, <verse eid="JER 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20" />“Bedo tek me turu gicikena ki dyeceng ki dyewor, wek pe omii dyeceng ki dyewor gubin i karegi ma mite kikome, <verse eid="JER 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21" />kitmeno bene bedo tek me turu gicikena ki latica Daudi, wek pe en obed ki lakware mo ma myero obed rwot, ki dok bene me turu gicikena ki ajwaki ma gua ki i kaka pa Levi ma gin aye gitye katic bota. <verse eid="JER 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22" />Abimedo wel likwayo pa latica Daudi ki wel ajwaki bene ma gua ki i kaka pa Levi ma gitiyo bota, wek bene kwanogi obed tek kit macalo kwano lakalatwe ma i polo nyo nyig kweyo me dog nam tek kwede.”<verse eid="JER 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23" />Rwot dok owaca ni, <verse eid="JER 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24" />“Tika ingeyo kit ma dano giloko kwede ni an dong atyeko kwero Icrael ki Juda woko, gin kaka aryo ma onongo ceng ayerogini? En aye gin ma omiyo gineno jona ki wang me cac dok bene pe gitamo pirgi ni gin rok. <verse eid="JER 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25" />Ento an, a Rwot, aketo gicikena ki ceng ki dwe, dok bene aketo cik ma tye ka loyo polo ki lobo. <verse eid="JER 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26" />Dong kit macalo ada atyeko timo man, kitmeno bene abigwoko gicikena ki likwayo pa Yakobo ka dok ki latica Daudi. Kare ki kare abiyero dano ki ikom likwayo pa Daudi me loyo likwayo pa Abraim, Icaka ki Yakobo. Abidwoko gumgi kakare botgi, dok kica bibedo ka maka ikomgi.”<verse eid="JER 33:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34" />
  <para style="s1">Lok pa Jeremia ma oloko bot Jedekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:1-11">2 Luk 25:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17-21">2 Tek 36:17-21</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot oloko kweda ikare ma Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon ki dul monye, ki dul mony pa lurok ducu ki jo me rok ducu mapatpat ma gitye ite loce, onongo gitye ka lweny ikom Jerucalem ki i taun ducu ma gurumu ma cokcok kwede. <verse eid="JER 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2" />Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco bota ni acit awac ki Jedekia rwot me Juda ni, “Nen, abimiyo taun madit man woko i cing rwot me Babilon, ci en biwango woko licwic ki mac. <verse eid="JER 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3" />Pe ibibwot ki i cinge, kibimaki woko ci kibimiyi bote. Ibineno rwot me Babilon ki wangi dok bene ibilok kwede wang ki wang; ci ikare meno kibiteri woko i Babilon. <verse eid="JER 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4" />Rwot Jedekia, winy gin ma an Rwot atye kawacone mukemo in. Pe kibineki i lweny ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JER 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5" />In ibito ki kuc, dok kit macalo gibedo kawango angwece ikare ma kiyiko kwarowu, ma onongo gin luker ma gukwongo nyimwu, kitmeno dano bene gibiwango gin ma ngwece kur piri. Kibikoki kun kiwaco ni, ‘Rwotwa dong oto woko do!’ An a Rwot dong atyeko loko lok man.”<verse eid="JER 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6" />Cutcut atito lok man bot Jedekia rwot me Juda ki i Jerucalem, <verse eid="JER 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7" />ikare ma dul mony pa rwot me Babilon tye ka lweny ikom Jerucalem ki ikom taun ducu me Juda mayam kiweko gudong. Lakic ki Ajeka; magi keken aye onongo gubedo taun madito ma kirumu ki cel gogo ma gudong i Juda.<verse eid="JER 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitiyo ki yo me bwola ikom opii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8" />Rwot oloko kweda lacen ikare ma dong rwot Jedekia otyeko keto gicike ki jo ducu ma i Jerucalem me tito pi gonyo opiigi woko. <verse eid="JER 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9" />Guketo gicike ni dano acel acel bigonyo opiine ma gin jo Ibru, laco kacel ki dako, wek ngat mo pe olok Lajudaya lawote obed opii. <verse eid="JER 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10" />Ci dano ducu kacel ki lutelagi gumoko gicike meno pi gonyo opiigi woko, pe dok me makogi wek gubed opii tyen me aryo. Gugonyo opiigi woko guweko gucito gire. <verse eid="JER 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11" />Ento lacen dok gumako opii ma co ki ma mon ci gudwokogi cen kun gimiyogi me dok ite locgi macalo opiigi.<verse eid="JER 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12" />Ikare meno en aye Rwot, <verse eid="JER 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13" />Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco bota ni, “Yam aketo gicike ki kwarowu ikare ma akwanyogi ki i lobo Ejipt, ki i ot me can. Awaco botgi ni, <verse eid="JER 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:2">Nia 21:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:12">Nwo 15:12</ref></char></note>‘I tum mwaka me abicel dano acel acel myero ogony Laibru lawote mayam kicato bote macalo opii ma dong otyeko tic bote pi mwaka abicel; myero kigonygi woko wek dong pe gutii botgi. Ento kwarowu yam pe guketo cwinygi i loka dok bene pe guciko itgi me winyone. <verse eid="JER 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15" />Ento ikare ma okato ma cokcoki onongo wun wungut ci wutiyo gin ma tye atir i wanga kun wutito lok me gonyo opiiwu, dano acel acel ki lawote, dok bene wuketo gicike inyima i ot ma kilwongo ki nyingani. <verse eid="JER 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16" />Ento lacen dok wuloke ci wupyedo nyinga kun dano acel acel dok okwanyo opii ma co ki ma mon ci gudwokogi cen bote, ma onongo nene dong wugonyogi woko macalo mitigi tye, ci wukelogi wuketogi ite loc me opii dok aye.’ <verse eid="JER 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17" />Pimeno, an Rwot awaco kuman ni, ‘Wun pe wulubu cika me gonyo opiiwu, pe wugonyo jo Ibru wadiwu woko ki i opii. Pimeno, an aye dong atito botwu ni, abigonyowu wek kinekwu woko i lweny, two gemo binekowu ki kec bene binekowu woko. Man an Rwot ma awaco. Abimiyo wudoko gin makelo lworo bot ker ducu matye iwi lobo. <verse eid="JER 34:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="JER 34:18-19" />Lutela me Juda ki Jerucalem kacel ki ludito ma giloyo gangkal, ajwaki, ki jo me lobo meno ducu, guketo gicike kweda kun giwoto ki ikin wod twon ma gungolo i dul aryo. Ento guturu gicike ma gin guketo ki inyimani, pe gugwoko gin ducu ma mako gicike man. Kitmeno abitimo ikom jo man gin ma gin gutimo ikom wod twon. <verse eid="JER 34:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20" />Abimiyogi woko i cing lukworgi. Abimiyogi woko i cing jo ma mito nekogi, dong komgi ma otoni winyo ki nguu me tim aye ma bicamo. <verse eid="JER 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21" />Abimiyo Jedekia rwot me Juda kacel ki rwodine i cing lukworgi ma gimito nekogi. Abimiyogi woko bot dul mony pa rwot me Babilon, ma gugiko lweny woko i komwuni. <verse eid="JER 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22" />Nen, abicikogi, ci gibidwogo cen i taun madit man. Gibilweny ikome, gibimako, ci giwango woko licwic ki mac. Abimiyo taun me Juda ducu loke doko macalo tim aroo kama dano mo pe bedo iye. Man an Rwot ma awaco.’”<verse eid="JER 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia ki jo Rekab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:6">2 Luk 23:36—24:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2 Tek 36:5-7</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare ma Yekoyakim wod pa Yocia onongo obedo rwot me Juda, Rwot oloko kweda ni, <verse eid="JER 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2" />“Cit i kaka pa jo Rekab ci ilok kwedgi. Ka dong ikelgi i kicika matye i Ot pa Rwot ci imii botgi kongo bwino wek gumat.” <verse eid="JER 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3" />Ci akwanyo Jajania wod pa Jeremia mukene, wod pa Kabajinia, ki omegine, ki awobene ducu, ki jo Rekab ducu, <verse eid="JER 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4" />ci akelogi i Ot pa Rwot. Aterogi i kicika pa awobe pa Kanan, wod pa Igdalia, ma en dano pa Lubanga. Kicika man onongo tye cok ki kicika pa rwodi, matye malo ka wi kicika pa Mecaya wod pa Calum, ma en dano ma lakur dogola me Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="JER 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5" />Ci aketo kikopo ki abino ma kongo bwino opong iye inyimgi, ka dong awaco botgi ni, “Wumat kongo.”<verse eid="JER 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6" />Ento gin gudok iye ni, “Wan pe wamato kongo bwino pien Jonadab wod pa Rekab, ma en kwarowa, otito ni wan kacel ki likwayowa ducu pe wa bimato kongo bwino matwal. <verse eid="JER 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7" />En bene otito botwa ni pe myero wa ger odi, pe wa pur poto, pe bene wapit olok kadi ki wilone ki lim bene pe wa wil. Ocikowa me bedo i kema pi kare me kwowa ducu, wek wabed kamede ki bedo i lobo ma wan wawelo iyeni pi kare malac. <verse eid="JER 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8" />Wan walubu pwony pa Jonadab wod pa Rekab, ma en obedo kwarowa. Wan kikomwa pe wamato kongo, kadi monwa, awobewa ki anyirawa bene pe gimato. <verse eid="JER 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9" />Pe wagero odi ma myero wabed iye, pe watye ki poto olok mo, kadi ki poti mukene, kodiwa bene peke; <verse eid="JER 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10" />wan giwa wabedo i kema. Wan wabedo kalubu kit cik ducu ma kwarowa Jonadab ocikowa kwede. <verse eid="JER 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11" />Ento ikare ma Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon obino omonyo kwede lobo man, wamoko tamwa me bino i Jerucalem pi ringo woko ki bot mony pa jo Kaldaya ki Ciria. Meno aye gin ma omiyo kombedi watye kabedo i Jerucalem.”<verse eid="JER 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12" />Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael dok owaco bota me cito kawaco bot jo Juda ki Jerucalem ni, <verse eid="JER 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13" />“An Rwot apenyowu ni pingo wukwero gamo pwonya ki winyo loka? <verse eid="JER 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14" />Likwayo pa Jonadab ducu gulubu dok gugwoko cik ma en ocikogi kwede, pe gumato kongo bwino, kadi wa onyo pe tye ngat mo ikin gi ma mato kongo, pien gilubu cik ma kwarogi ocikogi kwede. Abedo kalok botwu teretere ento wun pe wuwinyo lok doga. <verse eid="JER 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15" />Abedo kacwalo botwu lutica lunebi teretere, gin bene gubedo katito botwu ni wuloke wuwek kit yo mewu maraci dok wutii gin matye atir. Gin guciko bene matek ni pe myero wuwor lubanga mogo mukene dok pe wutii botgi, wek pud wumede ki bedo i lobo mayam amiyo botwu ki bot kwarowu. Ento wun pe wuciko itwu dok bene pe wuwinyo loka. <verse eid="JER 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16" />Likwayo pa Jonadab gire gulubu gin ma kwarogi ocikogi kwede, ento wun pe wulubu loka wa ki acel. <verse eid="JER 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17" />Pimeno, an Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, abikelo can mayam acike pire me keto ikom jo Juda ki Jerucalem. Abitimo man pien wun pe wuwinyo loka ikare ma aloko kwedwu, dok bene ka alwongowu wun pe wugamo doga.”<verse eid="JER 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18" />Ci awaco ki jo me kaka pa Rekab ni, Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco ni, “Wun dong wutyeko lubu cik ma kwarowu Jonadab yam ocikowu kwede; wulubu pwonye woko ducu liweng, dok bene wutiyo gin ducu ma onongo en ocikowu ni wutii. <verse eid="JER 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19" />Pimeno, omiyo an Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, acike ni Jonadab wod pa Rekab kare ducu bibedo ki lakware mo ma laco ma bitic bota.”<verse eid="JER 35:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36" />
  <para style="s1">Baruk okwano buk adola i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:1">2 Luk 24:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2 Tek 36:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-2">Dan 1:1-2</ref></char>
    </note>I mwaka me angwen me loc pa Yekoyakim wod pa Yocia rwot me Juda, Rwot owaco bota ni, <verse eid="JER 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2" />“Kwany buk adola ci i coo iye lok ducu ma atito boti mukemo Icrael ki Juda, kacel ki rok ducu. Coo gin ducu ma atito boti tyen mukwongo, ikare ma onongo Yocia aye rwot o kwede wa onyo. <verse eid="JER 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3" />Gwok nyo jo Juda ka guwinyo pi can ma ayube me kelo ikomgi, miyo gin ducu gibiloke giweko yogi maraci. Ci abiweko balgi ki gin maracu ducu mayam gutimo.”<verse eid="JER 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4" />Kitmeno alwongo Baruk wod pa Neria, ci atito kore ki kore bot Baruk gin ducu ma onongo Rwot owaco bota, kun Baruk obedo kacoyogi woko liweng i buk adola. <verse eid="JER 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5" />Ka dong aciko Baruk kun awace ni, “An dong kigenga woko ni pe adony i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="JER 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6" />Ento amitoni i cit kunu ikare mo ma nongo dano tye ka rii kec, ci i kwan lok ma i buk adolani woko matek ki dwon malongo, wek jo ducu ma gitye i Ot pa Rwot guwiny lok ma Rwot onongo owaco bota, en lok ma an atitogi boti ci i coyogi i buk adolani. Myero i kwan lok magi bot jo Juda ducu ma gua ki i gangigi wek guwiny. <verse eid="JER 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7" />Gwok nyo gibilego lega me bako doggi bot Rwot, ci giloke giweko timo gin marac, pi lok ma Rwot dong oloko ikom lwak man ki kiniga kacel ki akemo mager.” <verse eid="JER 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8" />Kitmeno Baruk okwano lok pa Rwot i Ot pa Rwot kit macalo acike kwede ni myero en otii.<verse eid="JER 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9" />I dwe me abongwen i mwaka me abice me loc pa Yekoyakim rwot me Juda, dano gubedo ka rii kec wek Rwot okonygi. Jo ma gubedo ka rii kec onongo obedo jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem kacel ki jo ma gua ki i taun ducu me Juda. <verse eid="JER 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10" />Ci dano guciko itgi kawinyo lok, ma Baruk kwano, kit lok ducu ma awace ma en ocoyo i buk adola. Baruk otiyo man i Ot pa Rwot i kicika pa Gemaria wod pa Capan ma karan. Kicikane onongo tye cok ki dyekal mamalo, i kabedo ma kidonyo kwede i dog gang Manyen me Ot pa Rwot.<verse eid="JER 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikwano buk adola bot luloc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11" />Mikaya wod pa Gemaria, ma wod pa Capan, owinyo ka Baruk kwano lok ma Rwot owaco ki i buk adola. <verse eid="JER 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12" />Cutcut en oa ocito i gangkal, ci odonyo i kicika pa karan pa rwot, kama onongo luloc ducu gucoke iye. Elicama, karan, Delaya wod pa Cemaya, Elnatan wod pa Akbor, Gemaria wod pa Capan, Jedekia wod pa Anania ki luloc ducu. <verse eid="JER 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13" />Ci Mikaya owaco botgi lok ducu ma en owinyo ikare ma Baruk okwano lok ki i buk adola inyim lwak. <verse eid="JER 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14" />Ci luloc guoro Jekudi wod pa Netania, wod pa Celemia, wod pa Kuci, me waco bot Baruk ni, “Kwany buk adola ma i kwano bot lwak i mak i cingi ci ibin kwede.” Kitmeno Baruk wod pa Neria okwanyo buk adola omako i cinge ci obino kwede botgi. <verse eid="JER 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15" />Ci guwaco bote ni, “Bed piny i kwan buk meno.” Kitmeno Baruk okwano botgi lok meno. <verse eid="JER 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16" />Ikare ma dong guwinyo lok magi woko ducu, ngat acel acel oloke bot lawote ki lworo madwong, ci guwaco bot Baruk ni, “Myero wawac lok man woko bot rwot.” <verse eid="JER 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17" />Ka gupenyo Baruk ni, “Titiwa, lok magi ducu i coyogi ningning? Jeremia aye ma obedo kawacone boti ka in i coyo?” <verse eid="JER 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18" />Baruk odok iye ni, “Jeremia obedo kawaco lok magi ducu bota ki acel acel, ka acoyogi i buk adola ki kalam bwino.” <verse eid="JER 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19" />Ci luloc guwaco bot Baruk ni, “In kacel ki Jeremia myero wucit wukane woko, pe wuwek ngat mo onge kama wutye iye.”<verse eid="JER 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot owango buk adola woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20" />Lacen luloc gucito guketo buk adola i kicika pa Elicama, ma karan, ka dong gucito i gang pa rwot, ci gutito loke woko ducu bot rwot. <verse eid="JER 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21" />Cutcut rwot ooro Jekudi me cito ka gamo buk adola. Jekudi ocito okwanyo ki i kicika pa Elicama ka okwano bot rwot kacel ki luloc ducu ma onongo gucung kangete. <verse eid="JER 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22" />Ikare meno obedo dwe me abongwen ma en kare me cwir, ma rwot onongo tye i gang kale ma en bedo iye i cwir, ci onongo obedo ka oyo mac. <verse eid="JER 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23" />Ikare ma Jekudi obedo kwano buk adola, ka okwano oo i dul coc me adek nyo me angwen, ci rwot ngolo woko cutcut ki pala matidi ci bolo woko i mac. Obedo katimo man nio ka buk adola owang otum woko ducu. <verse eid="JER 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24" />Ento ngat mo kadi rwot nyo lutice ma guwinyo lok magi ducu pe gubedo ki lworo, dok bene pe guyeco bongigi me nyutu cwercwinygi. <verse eid="JER 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25" />Kadi bed Elnatan, Delaya, kacel ki Gemaria gulego rwot ni pe owang buk adolani woko, ento rwot pe oketo cwinye me winyo lokgi kadi ki acel. <verse eid="JER 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26" />Lacen rwot Yekoyakim ociko wode Jeramel, kacel ki Ceraya wod pa Ajriel, ki Celemia wod pa Abdeel ni gumaka kacel ki Baruk ma karan, ento Rwot Lubanga okanowa woko.<verse eid="JER 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeremia dok ocoyo buk adola mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27" />Lacen ma dong rwot otyeko wango buk adola ma awaco loke bot Baruk ka en ocoyoni, Rwot dok ocika <verse eid="JER 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28" />ni akwany buk adola mukene ka acoo iye lok ducu ma onongo tye i buk adola mukwongo ca ma rwot Yekoyakim dong otyeko wango wokoni. <verse eid="JER 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29" />Rwot otita me waco bot rwot Yekoyakim ni; “Dong ityeko wango buk adola ca woko, dok bene i penya ni pingo an ocoyo ni rwot me Babilon bibino ada ci tyeko lobo man woko kun neko jo ducu kacel ki lee matye iye. <verse eid="JER 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30" />Pimeno an Rwot, awaco bot in Yekoyakim rwot me Juda ni, pe tye dano mo ki ikom likwayu ma bibedo rwot. Ka i to komi mutoni kibibolo woko kama lyeto ceng biwango ki i dyeceng ki ngico me pee bijingo woko ki i dyewor. <verse eid="JER 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31" />Abiketo can ikomi kacel ki likwayi, ki lutici, pi balwu ducu ma wutye katimone. Dok in, kadi ki jo Jerucalem nyo jo Juda, pe wubedo kaketo cwinywu me winyo lok ma abedo kawaco botwu teretere, pimeno abikelo can ma onongo yam dong aciko pire ni aketo ikomwuni.”<verse eid="JER 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32" />Ci dok akwanyo buk adola mukene ci amiyo bot Baruk karan, ci Baruk ocoyo lok woko ducu ki acel acel kit macalo abedo kawaco. Baruk ocoyo lok ducu ma onongo tye i buk adola mukwongo ma rwot Yekoyakim owango woko ki mac ci. An dok amedo iye lok mapol marom ki lok me wi atii ca.<verse eid="JER 36:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37" />
  <para style="s1">Lega pa Jedekia bot Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:17">2 Luk 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Tek 36:10</ref></char>
    </note>Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon yam oketo Jedekia wod pa Yocia me bedo rwot me Juda ma ka Yekonia wod pa Yekoyakim. <verse eid="JER 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2" />Ento Jedekia ki lutice, ki lwak bene pe guwinyo lok pa Rwot ma omiyo bota ni atit botgini.<verse eid="JER 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3" />Rwot Jedekia ocwalo Yekukal wod pa Celemia, ki ajwaka Jepania wod pa Maceya bota, kun guwaca ni, “Myero ileg Rwot Lubangawani pirwa.” <verse eid="JER 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4" />Ikare meno onongo pud atye ka wire ata ikin dano, adonyo i ot ci akato woko gira kit ma cwinya mito, pien onongo pud peya gitweya i buc. <verse eid="JER 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5" />Ikare meno bene mony pa Parao oa ki i Ejipt obino; ento ka jo Kaldaya ma onongo gitye karumu Jerucalem guwinyo lok man, ci gin gucako jer woko ki i Jerucalem gudok woko cen ki ngegi.<verse eid="JER 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6" />Ka dong Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco bota ni, <verse eid="JER 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7" />“Wac bot rwot me Juda ma ocwali me lok kweda ni, ‘Dul mony pa Parao ma onongo bino kakonyini dong bidok woko i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="JER 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8" />Ci jo Kaldaya bidwogo cen. Gibibino gilwenyo ikom taun madit man, gimayo woko ka dong giwango woko ki mac. <verse eid="JER 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9" />An Rwot acikowu matek ni pe myero wubed ka bwole kekenwu kun wutamo ni jo Kaldaya pe bidwogo cen, myero wuniang ni gibidwogo. <verse eid="JER 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10" />Kadi bed wuloyo dul mony pa jo Kaldaya ma gibino ka lweny i komwuni, ma nongo dong jo mudonge keken en aye jo ma nongo kiketo ret ikomgi ma gibutu i kemagi, jonu bene pud gibiromo a malo ci gibiwango taun madit man woko ki mac.’”<verse eid="JER 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimako Jeremia ci kitweye woko i buc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11" />Dul mony pa jo Kaldaya gudok woko cen ki i Jerucalem ki ngegi pien onongo mony pa Parao dong onyiko cok mada. <verse eid="JER 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12" />Ci aa ki i Jerucalem acito i lobo pa jo Benjamin kagamo dul lobo ma ki poko bota ki ikin lutuwa. <verse eid="JER 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13" />Ento ikare ma ao i Dogcel me Benjamin, onongo ladit maloyo acikari tye katic kunu, nyinge kilwongo Irija wod pa Celemia ma wod pa Anania; cutcut omaka woko kun waca ni, “In i tye kalwi woko icito bot jo Kaldaya.” <verse eid="JER 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14" />Ci an adok iye ni, “Meno lok goba, an pe atye kalwi woko me cito bot jo Kaldaya.” Ento Irija onongo pe twero winyo loka ci omaka otera bot luloc. <verse eid="JER 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15" />Ci kiniga omako luloc matek ikoma, gugoya ka gutweya kwede woko i buc i ot pa Yonacan ma karan, pien onongo dong kiloko odoko ot buc.<verse eid="JER 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16" />Kitweya i ot ma obedo bur matye ite ngom, ci kiweko arii kunu pi kare malac. <verse eid="JER 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17" />Lacen rwot Jedekia ocwalo dano kakela bote, ka kikela, ci en ojola maber. Ci openya ki i ot i mung ni, “Tye lok mo ma Rwot otiti?” Ci agamo ni, “Lok tye.” Dok amedo lok kun awace ni, “Kibimiyi woko i cing rwot me Babilon.”<verse eid="JER 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18" />Ci awaco bene ki rwot Jedekia ni, “Gin marac ango ma an atimo boti nyo bot lutici kadi ki bot lwak man, ma omiyo itweya woko i buc? <verse eid="JER 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19" />Gin ango ma otime ikom lunebini mayam gutyeto lok boti ni, rwot me Babilon pe bibino ka lweny ikomi kadi ki ikom lobo man? <verse eid="JER 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20" />Kombedi dong, ai ladita, alegi iwiny kokona; pe dok i dwoka cen i ot pa Yonacan karan, weko abito woko ki kunu.”<verse eid="JER 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21" />Pimeno Jedekia omiyo cik ni pe kidwoka i buc ma i ot pa Yonacan, ci gukela guketa me bedo i buc ma idyekal pa lukurpiny, kun en bene oye ni kibed ka miya mugati ma a ki bot jo ma gitedo nino ki nino, nio ka mugati dong otum woko liweng ki i taun madit. Kitmeno an abedo kunu idyekal pa lukurpiny.<verse eid="JER 37:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia iwang it mutwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1" />Ikarenu Cepatia wod pa Matan, Gedalia wod pa Packur, Jukal wod pa Celemia ki Packur wod pa Malkia gubedo kawinyo lok ma abedo kawacone bot lwak ni <verse eid="JER 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2" />Rwot owaco ni, “Ngat mo ma bidong i taun madit man kibineko woko ki pala lucwan nyo kec bineke woko nyo two gemo aye bipoto ikome ci neke woko. Ento ngat ma bia cito kamine kene bot jo Kaldaya pe kibineke, bibedo kwo; en bilaro kwone ci bedo bote macalo mot me lweny.” <verse eid="JER 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3" />An bene onongo abedo katito lok bot lwak ni Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Abimiyo taun madit man woko i cing dul mony pa rwot me Babilon, ci en bimako woko.” <verse eid="JER 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4" />Ci luloc guwaco bot rwot ni, “Laco man myero ki nek woko, pien en miyo cwiny acikari kacel ki lwak ma odong i taun madit man doko lwor, pi lok ma en loko botgini. Dano man pe tye kayenyo yo me miyo kony pi berbedo pa lwak, ento mito kelo can ikomgi keken.” <verse eid="JER 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5" />Ci rwot Jedekia owaco ni, “Nen, twero tye i cingwu, wutim gin ma wumito ikome; an pe atwero gengowu gira.” <verse eid="JER 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6" />Ci gumaka gubola woko iwang it pa Malkia, ma en wod pa rwot, ma onongo obedo idyekal pa lukurpiny. Gutweya ki tol gucwala kwede piny iwang it kunu. Pii onongo pe iwang ite, ento coto keken aye onongo odong, ci acako mwony woko i coto.<verse eid="JER 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7" />Kadi bed kumeno, Ebed-melek Laetiopia, dano ma kikolo, mayam tiyo i gangkal pa rwot, owinyo ni kibola woko iwang it. Ikare meno onongo rwot obedo ki lukikone i Dogcel me Benjamin. <verse eid="JER 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8" />Ci Ebed-melek oa ki i gangkal pa rwot ocito bot rwot ci owace ni, <verse eid="JER 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9" />“Ladita, jo magi gutimo gin marac atika. Gubolo Jeremia woko iwang it, kama ageno ni kec bineke woko ki kunu. Cam mo maromo dong pe i gang.” <verse eid="JER 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10" />Ci rwot omiyo twero bot Ebed-melek Laetiopia me kwanyo jo adek wek gucit kwede kaywaya woko ki iwang it ma peya nongo ato. <verse eid="JER 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11" />Ci Ebed-melek okwanyo jo meno adek ka ocito kwedgi i ot pa rwot, ci odonyo kama kiketo iye bongo i ot kano jami, ci okwanyo oketoket bongo ma otii ki bongo mogo ma oyec, ci otweyo ki tol ocwalo piny iwang it bota. <verse eid="JER 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12" />Ci Ebed-melek owaca ni, “Ket oketoket bongo ma oyeci ite yweti ka iket tol ikome.” Ci atimo kitmeno, <verse eid="JER 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13" />ci guywaya ki tol meno ki iwang it gukela woko kamaleng. Ci amede ki bedo idyekal pa lukurpiny.<verse eid="JER 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jedekia openyo tam ki bot Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14" />Rwot Jedekia ocwalo dano gukela bote ki i dogola me adek me donyo i Ot pa Rwot, ci rwot Jedekia owaco bota ni, “Abipenyi peny acel, dong pimeno pe amito i mung lok mo woko bota.” <verse eid="JER 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15" />Ci awaco bot Jedekia ni, “Kace atiti lok ada, ci i bineka woko, dok bene kace amiyi tam, ci pe i ibiketo cwinyi iye.” <verse eid="JER 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16" />Pimeno rwot Jedekia okwonge bota i mung kun waco ni, “Macalo Rwot tye kwoni, ma omiyowa kwo, pe abineki, dok bene pe abimiyi i cing jo ma gimito neki wokoni.”<verse eid="JER 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17" />Ci awaco bot Jedekia ni Rwot Lubanga me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kuman ni, “Kace ibimiine keni bot luloc pa rwot me Babilon, ci gibiweki ibedo kwo, ki taun madit man bene pe kibiwango woko ki mac. Ento in kacel ki jo ma i odi wubikwo. <verse eid="JER 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18" />Ento kace pe ibimiine keni bot luloc pa rwot me Babilon, ci taun madit man kibimiyo woko i cing jo Kaldaya, ci gibiwango woko, pimeno in pe ibibwot ki i cinggi wa ki acel.”<verse eid="JER 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19" />Ci rwot Jedekia owaco bota ni, “Alworo Lujudaya ma dong gumine woko ken gi bot jo Kaldayani, pien gitwero miya woko i cinggi, ci gibitima ki tim anywar marac.” <verse eid="JER 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20" />Ci awace ni, “Pe kibimiyi botgi. Kombedi dong ilub lok pa Rwot i gin ducu ma awaci, ci ibibedo maber, dok bene kibibwoti ibedo kwo. <verse eid="JER 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21" />Ento Rwot dong onyuta ginanyuta iwang lek, gin ma bitime kace i kwero miine woko keni botgi. <verse eid="JER 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22" />Nen, mon ducu mayam kiweko gudong i gangkal pa rwot me Juda dong kitye katerogi woko bot luloc pa rwot me Babilon. Winy lok ma gitye kawacone ka giwoto gicito kwede ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">‘Lurem rwot mayam en genogini dong gubwole, dok bene guloyo tame woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Dong kombedi kit macalo tyene omwony woko i cotoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">guloke guweke woko kene.’”<verse eid="JER 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23" />Ci an dok amede kiwaco ni, “Moni ducu kacel ki lutinoni kibiterogi woko bot jo Kaldaya, ki in bene pe ibibwot ki i cinggi. Rwot me Babilon bimaki woko macalo opii, ki taun madit man bene kibiwango woko ki mac.”<verse eid="JER 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24" />Jedekia owaco bota ni, “Pe iwek ngat mo onge lok ma waloko, ci pe i bito. <verse eid="JER 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25" />Kace luloc guwinyo ni aloko kwedi, ka gubino boti guwaci ni, ‘Tit botwa gin ma in iwaco bot rwot ki gin ma rwot owaco boti, pe i mung lok mo botwa pien wan giwa pe wa bineki,’ <verse eid="JER 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26" />ci i biwaco botgi ni, ‘Akok bot rwot ki mwolo kun abako doga bote ni pe myero odwoka cen i ot pa Yonacan me to kunu.’” <verse eid="JER 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27" />Ci luloc ducu gua gubino bota gupenya ci an bene adok iye botgi kit macalo rwot opwonya kwede. Ma omiyo guweko lok kweda woko, pien lok ma wabedo kalokoneni ngat mo ma owinyo obedo peke. <verse eid="JER 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:21">Eje 33:21</ref></char></note>Ci gugwoka idyekal pa lukurpiny nio ka merok omayo Jerucalem.<verse eid="JER 38:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39" />
  <para style="s1">Jerucalem opoto i cing jo Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1" />I mwaka me abongwen me loc pa Jedekia, rwot me Juda, i dwe me apar en aye Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon obino kwede ki monye ducu ikom Jerucalem, ci orumu woko. <verse eid="JER 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2" />I mwaka me apar wiye acel me loc pa rwot Jedekia, i dwe me angwen, ninone abongwen, en aye gumuku kwede cel gogo me taun madit me Jerucalem. <verse eid="JER 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3" />(Ikare ma dong kimayo Jerucalem woko, ci luloc ducu pa rwot me Babilon gubino gubedo i dogcel ma idyere matye i gangkal: gin aye Nergal-carejer, Camgar-nebo, Carcekim Larabcaric, Nergal-carejer ma Larabmag, ki ludito mukene ducu pa rwot me Babilon.) <verse eid="JER 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4" />Ikare ma Jedekia rwot me Juda kacel ki acikarine ducu guneno gin matye katime, ci gin guweko gang woko guringo ki i dyewor, kun giwok ki i dog gang ma ikin cel aryo me gang ma wok ki i poto pa rwot; ci gucito gulubu yoo ma dok tung Araba.<verse eid="JER 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5" />Ento mony pa jo Kaldaya guryemo korgi, ci gumako Jedekia wa i bar me Jeriko. Ikare ma gumake ci gukele bot Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon i Ribla, ma i lobo Kamat; ci ongole iye kop. <verse eid="JER 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6" />Ci rwot me Babilon oneko awobe pa Jedekia woko i Ribla ki inyime ma wange neno, dok rwot me Babilon oneko ludito me awora me Judagu woko ducu. <verse eid="JER 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7" />Ci okolo wang Jedekia oloyo woko, ka dok kitweye ki nyor, ci kitere kwede wa i Babilon. <verse eid="JER 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8" />Jo Kaldaya guwango ot pa rwot, ki odi pa lwak ducu, ci gumuku kicika cel ma orumu Jerucalem woko. <verse eid="JER 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9" />Nebujaradan ma ladit pa lugwok rwot yam otero jo ma gudong i gang, ki jo mayam gukobo gigi ken gi bot rwot me Babilon, woko i opii macalo mabuc i Babilon. <verse eid="JER 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10" />Ento Nebujaradan ladit pa lugwok rwot bene yam oweko lucan mogo ma limgi peke gudong i lobo Juda, ci en omiyogi poto olok ki poti mukene bene ikare meno.<verse eid="JER 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kigonyo Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11" />Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon omiyo cik mukema kun wok ki bot Nebujaradan, ladit pa lugwok rwot kun waco ni, <verse eid="JER 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12" />“Tere, ci i gwoke maber, pe i tim gin mo marac ikome, ento tii kwede i yo ducu kit macalo en titi.” <verse eid="JER 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13" />Ci Nebujaradan ladit pa, lugwok rwot, Nebucajban Larabcaric, Nergal-carejer ma Larabmag, ki ludito madongo ducu pa rwot me Babilon <verse eid="JER 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14" />gucwalo dano okela ki idyekal pa lukurpiny, ci gumiya bot Gedalia wod pa Akikam, ma wod pa Capan, wek otera paco. Ci omiyo abedo ikin dano.<verse eid="JER 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gen pi Ebed-melek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15" />Rwot oloko kweda ikare ma onongo kitweya woko idyekal pa lukurpiny. Owaco bota <verse eid="JER 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16" />me tito bot Ebed-melek Laetiopia ni Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco ni, “Nen, abicobo loka kun aketo can ikom taun madit man, pe abitimo gin mo maber, lok man bicobe inyimi in kikomi inino meno. <verse eid="JER 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17" />Ento an Rwot abilari, pe kibimiyi i cing jo meno ma itye kalworogini. <verse eid="JER 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18" />Pien adada an abilari, ma omiyo pe kibineki woko ki pala lucwan, ento ibibedo kwo, ci kwoni bibedo boti macalo mot me lweny, pien iketo geni ducu ikoma, man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 39:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia ki jo mudong gubedo bot Gedalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1" />Rwot oloko kweda ikare ma dong Nebujaradan, ladit pa lugwok rwot ogonya woko ki i Rama. Onongo yam kitweya woko ki nyor kacel ki jo mapol ma kimakogi ki i Jerucalem ki Juda, ma kiterogi woko i opii i Babilon. <verse eid="JER 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2" />Ladit pa lugwok rwot okwanya otera woko cen ci owaca ni, “Rwot Lubangani dong otyeko tito pi kit can ma bipoto i kabedo man. <verse eid="JER 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3" />Rwot dong otimo gin ma nene en owaco ni ebitimoni. Man ducu otime pien lutuwu gutimo bal ikom Rwot dok bene pe guwinyo loke. <verse eid="JER 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4" />Kombedi dong abigonyo nyor woko ki i cingi ci abiweko ibicito labongo ayela mo. Kace imito wot kacel kweda me cito i Babilon, ci tye itweroni, ci an abigwoki. Kace pe imito cito ci itwero bene bedo giri. Nen loboni ducu tye ene, yer kamo ma itamo ni ber nyo opore me cito ni iye.”<verse eid="JER 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5" />Ento pe aye me cito kwede, ma omiyo Nebujaradan owaca ni, “Dok cen bot Gedalia wod pa Akikam, ma wod pa Capan, ma nene rwot okete me bedo laloc me taun me Juda ducu. Itwero bedo kacel kwede ikin lwak, nyo itwero giri cito kama itamo ni ber me cito iye.” Ci ladit pa lugwok rwot omiya cam ki mot mogo ka dong oweko an acito gira. <verse eid="JER 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6" />An acito bot Gedalia wod pa Akikam i Mijpa, ci abedo kacel kwede ikin lwak ma onongo gudong i lobo meno.<verse eid="JER 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gedalia laloc me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:22-24">2 Luk 25:22-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:22-24">2 Luk 25:22-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ludito mogo ki acikari pa Lujudaya onongo pud gibedo i tim. Guwinyo ni rwot me Babilon otyeko keto Gedalia wod pa Akikam me bedo laloc me lobo, dok oketo en me loyo jo ducu ma gudong; co, mon kacel ki lutino, mayam pe kiterogi i opii i Babilon, ma gin aye onongo jo ma lucan adada i lobo meno. <verse eid="JER 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8" />Ci Icmael wod pa Netania, Yokanan wod pa Karea, Ceraya wod pa Tanumet, likwayo pa Epai ma jo Netopa, ki Jejania ma Lamaaka gucito kacel ki lwak meggi bot Gedalia i Mijpa. <verse eid="JER 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9" />Gedalia wod pa Akikam, ma wod pa Capan, okwonge botgi kacel ki lwakgi ducu kun waco ni, “Pe myero wubed ki lworo me tic bot jo Kaldaya. Wubed kunu ci wutii bot rwot me Babilon, ci wubibedo maber ki kuc. <verse eid="JER 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10" />An gira abibedo i Mijpa kun abedo macalo lawangwu ka jo Kaldaya gubino kany. Ento wun wutwero kano kongo bwino, nyig yat ki moo jeituni, ci wubed kwede i taunwu ma dong yam odok lobowu ma wumayoni.” <verse eid="JER 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11" />Kitmeno bene, Lujudaya ducu ma onongo yam gitye i lobo Moab, Ammon, Edom ki lobo mukene ducu mayam kiryemogi gucito iye, guwinyo ni rwot me Babilon oweko jo mukene odong i Juda, dok bene en oketo Gedalia wod pa Akikam, ma wod pa Capan me bedo laloc maloyogi. <verse eid="JER 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12" />Ci Lujudaya ducu guweko lobo kama yam kiryemogi gucito iyeni, ci gucako dwogo cen i Juda. Gubino bot Gedalia i Mijpa, ci gucoko kongo bwino mapol ki nyig yadi me oro madwong adada.<verse eid="JER 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kineko Gedalia woko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:25-26">2 Luk 25:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13" />Inge meno, Yokanan ki ludito ducu ma giloyo acikari ma onongo gitye i tim gubino bot Gedalia i Mijpa, <verse eid="JER 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14" />ci guwace ni, “Tika ingeyo ni Baalic rwot pa jo Ammon otyeko cwalo Icmael wod pa Netania me neki woko?” Ento Gedalia wod pa Akikam pe oye lokgi. <verse eid="JER 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15" />Ka dong Yokanan oloko ki Gedalia i mung i Mijpa, kun wace ni, “Wek acit anek Icmael wod pa Netania woko, pien ngat mo pe bingeyo lok man. Pingo en mito neki woko, kun miyo Lujudaya ducu ma gurumi woko gibiket woko, dok bene miyo jo mayam gudong i Juda gito woko?”<verse eid="JER 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16" />Ento Gedalia wod pa Akikam owaco ki Yokanan wod pa Karea ni, “Pe ibitimo gin ma kitmeno, pien itye kaloko lok goba keken ikom Icmael.”<verse eid="JER 40:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:25">2 Luk 25:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>I dwe me abiro, Icmael wod pa Netania ma wod pa Elicama, ma kinywale i ot ker, ma en ngat acel ikin ludito pa rwot, obino ki jo apar bot Gedalia wod pa Akikam i Mijpa. Ikare ma gitye i Mijpa kacamo cam kacel, <verse eid="JER 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2" />ci cutcut Icmael ki jo apar ma guwoto kwedeni gua gutongo Gedalia wod pa Akikam, ma wod pa Capan woko ki pala lucwan ci guneke woko. En aye onongo ngat ma rwot me Babilon oketo me bedo laloc me loboni. <verse eid="JER 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3" />Icmael bene oneko Lujudaya ducu ma onongo gitye kacel ki Gedalia i Mijpa: kadi wa acikari pa jo Kaldaya ma kinongogi kunu.<verse eid="JER 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4" />Orwone, ma pud peya ngat mo ongeyo pi neko Gedalia, <verse eid="JER 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5" />jo pyere aboro gua ki i Cekem, Cilo ki i Camaria gubino. Gubino ma gulyelo tikgi woko, guruku bene bongi ma oyecoyec, ma komgi bene gungolo woko. Gin onongo gitye katero gityer me moko kwon ki odok eceta me atyera i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="JER 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6" />Icmael wod pa Netania oa ki i Mijpa obino karwate kwedgi, kun woto ki koko. Ikare ma en rwate kwedgi ci owaco botgi ni, “Wubin wudony bot Gedalia wod pa Akikam.” <verse eid="JER 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7" />Ikare ma dong gubino, ma gudonyo i dye taun madit, ci Icmael wod pa Netania ki jo ma onongo gitye kacel kwede gunekogi woko, ci gutingo komgi gubolo woko i bur ma ki kwinyo ikom got me lagwok pii.<verse eid="JER 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8" />Ento onongo tye jo apar ikin gi ma guwaco bot Icmael ni, “Pe i nekwa, wan wa tye ki ngano, kal, moo jeituni, ki moo kic ma kikano i poto.” Ci en ojuke kene pe onekogi ki luremgi ducu. <verse eid="JER 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9" />Bur meno ma kikwinyo ikom got me lagwok pii ma Icmael obolo iye kom dano ma en onekogini onongo dit dok lac mada. En aye bur lagwok pii ma rwot Aca yam okwinyo me gwoko kwo pa dano ki ikom rwot Baaca me Icrael. Icmael opongo bur lagwok pii meno woko ki kom jo ma en onekogini <verse eid="JER 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10" />Ci Icmael omako anyira pa rwot ki jo ducu mayam gudong i Mijpa gudoko opiine, gin jo ma Nebujaradan, ladit pa lugwok rwot, yam omiyogi icing Gedalia wod pa Akikam. Icmael wod pa Netania oterogi woko i opii kun giwoto gicito me ngolo kulu pi kato loka tung bot jo Ammon.<verse eid="JER 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11" />Yokanan kacel ki ludito monye ducu guwinyo pi lok me nek ma Icmael otimoni. <verse eid="JER 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12" />Ci gucoko jo ma meggi, gucito kwede ka lweny ikom Icmael wod pa Netania. Gubino ka lweny ikome i joro madit matye i Gibeon. <verse eid="JER 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13" />Ikare ma opii pa Icmael guneno Yokanan kacel ki ludito monye, ci cwinygi obedo yom. <verse eid="JER 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14" />Kitmeno jo ducu mayam Icmael omakogi macalo opii ki i Mijpa, guloke guringo gudwogo cen, ci gucito bot Yokanan wod pa Karea. <verse eid="JER 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15" />Ento Icmael wod pa Netania olwi woko ki jo aboro, ci gucito bot jo Ammon.<verse eid="JER 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16" />Lacen Yokanan wod pa Karea ki ludito monye, gukwanyo dano mayam gudong, ma Icmael wod pa Netania omakogi ki i Mijpa oterogi woko i opii inge neko Gedalia wod pa Akikam: acikari, mon, lutino, ki jo ma kikologi, ma Yokanan odwokogi cen ki i Gibeon. <verse eid="JER 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17" />Ci gucito gubedo i Gerut Kimam macok ki Beterekem pien onongo gilworo jo Kaldaya. Onongo dong gitye ki tam me cito woko wa i Ejipt <verse eid="JER 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18" />Gin gubedo ki lworo ni gwok nyo mony pa jo Kaldaya bitimo gin marac pien Icmael onongo oneko Gedalia, wod pa Akikam, ma rwot me Babilon onongo ceng oketo me bedo laloc me lobo.<verse eid="JER 41:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42" />
  <para style="s1">Lwak gupenyo Jeremia me lega pirgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1" />Ludito wi mony ducu, kacel ki Yokanan wod pa Karea ki Ajaria wod pa Kocaya, gubino ki lwak dano ma kitgi patpat, jo matino ki jo madito ducu, gubino cok, <verse eid="JER 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2" />ci guwaco bota ni, “Tim gin ma wan wabako dogwa boti pire! Leg Rwot Lubangawa pirwa. Leg pi wan ducu ma wabwot. Yam onongo wadwong, ento kit macalo i neno, kombedi dong wadong jo manok keken. <verse eid="JER 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3" />Leg wek Rwot Lubangawa onyut botwa yo ma myero walub ki gin ma myero watim.” <verse eid="JER 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4" />Ci adok botgi iye ni, “Dong awinyo lokwu; pimeno abilego Rwot Lubangawa pirwu kit macalo onongo wupenya, ci kit gin ducu ma Rwot bidok iye ki wun an abitito botwu. Pe abikano kit gin mo wa ki acel ma pe atito botwu.”<verse eid="JER 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5" />Ci guwaco bota ni, “Rwot myero obed caden me ada dok ngat ma gene ikomwa me timowa rac kace pe wabilubu lok ducu ma Rwot Lubangani bicwali kwede botwa. <verse eid="JER 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6" />Kadi bed gin maber nyo marac, wan wabilubu lok pa Rwot Lubangawa ma wacwali boteni. Ka walubu loke ci wabibedo giwa maber.”<verse eid="JER 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot ogamo lega pa Jeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7" />Lacen inge nino apar Rwot oloko kweda. <verse eid="JER 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8" />Ci alwongo Yokanan wod pa Karea, ki ludito wi mony ducu ma onongo gitye kacel kwede, ki lwak dano ducu, jo matino ki madito. <verse eid="JER 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9" />Ka dong awaco botgi ni, “Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, ma wucwala bote ki lega me bako dogwuni owaco ni, <verse eid="JER 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10" />‘Kace wumito bedo i lobo man ci abiyubuwu wek wucung matek macalo ot, pe abiretowu woko piny; abipitowu pe abiputuwu woko. Atye ki aremcwiny pi can ma dong aketo ikomwu ca. <verse eid="JER 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11" />Pe dong wubed ki lworo mo ikom rwot me Babilon. Pe wulwore, pien atye kwedwu; abilarowu dok abikwanyowu woko ki i cinge. <verse eid="JER 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12" />Pien an lakica, pi man abimiyo en bene kica make ikomwu ci bimiyo wun wubidok cen i lobowu kikome.’ <verse eid="JER 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13" />Ento wun jo ma wudong i Juda pe myero wukwer winyo lok pa Rwot Lubangawu kun wukwero bene bedo i lobo man woko. <verse eid="JER 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14" />Pe myero wuwac ni, ‘Pe, wan giwa wabicito wabedo i Ejipt, kama pe wabineno iye lweny mo doki ki wangwa, dok bene pe wabiwinyo koko tum ma kikutu pi lweny, ki kec bene pe binekowa.’ <verse eid="JER 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15" />Wuwiny lok pa Rwot, wun jo ma wudong i Juda. Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco kuman ni, ‘Kace dong wumoko tamwu me cito me bedo i Ejipt, <verse eid="JER 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16" />ci lweny ma wulworoni binongowu kunu i lobo Ejipt; ki kec bene ma wulworoni bilubuwu kunu, ci wubito woko ki i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="JER 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17" />Jo ducu ma dong gumoko tamgi me cito me bedo i Ejipt gibito, i lweny, nyo kec aye ma binekogi, nyo ki two gemo. Pe tye ngat mo ikin gi ma bidong ma kwo, ngat mo bene pe ma bibwot ki i can ma abiketo ikomgi.’<verse eid="JER 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18" />Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco kuman ni, ‘Kit macalo yam atoyo kinigana ki akemona ikom jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem, kitmeno bene abionyo akemona woko ikomwu kace wucito i Ejipt. Wubidoko lok lacen dano, gin makelo lworo madwong, ki gin ma dano gibedo kaloko lok agec ikomgi. Pe dok wubineno kabedo man matwal.’”<verse eid="JER 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19" />Ci dok amede kun awaco botgi ni, “Rwot dong owaco botwu wun jo ma wudong i Juda ni pe wucit i Ejipt. Myero wunge atikatika ni an dong atyeko cikowu ikare man <verse eid="JER 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20" />ni wun dong wungak woko ma dong wumito ada ni kwowu orweny woko. Wun wucwala ni acit bot Rwot Lubangawa kun wuwaca ni, ‘Leg Rwot Lubanga pirwa! Tit botwa bene gin ducu ma en owaco ni watii, ci wan bene wabitiyo.’ <verse eid="JER 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21" />Nen, kombedi dong atito botwu, ento wun wukwero lubu gin ducu ma Rwot Lubangawa oora ni atit botwu. <verse eid="JER 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22" />Pimeno kombedi myero wunge atikatika ni wubito i lweny, kec binekowu, ki two gemo bene binekowu ki i kabedo ma wumito tutwal me cito iyeni.”<verse eid="JER 42:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43" />
  <para style="s1">Kitero Jeremia woko i Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1" />Ikare ma dong atyeko loko lok ducu bot lwak ducu ma gucoke, ma Rwot Lubangagi aye oora me tito botgi, <verse eid="JER 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2" />ci Ajaria wod pa Kocaya ki Yokanan wod pa Karea, ki jo ducu mayam gin lungala guwaco bota ni, “Itye katito lok goba. Rwot Lubangawa pe ocwali ni itit botwa ni pe myero wucit kabedo i Ejipt.<verse eid="JER 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3" />Ento Baruk wod pa Neria aye opiyo in ikomwa, wek i miwa i cing jo Kaldaya, wek gunekwa woko, nyo guterwa woko i opii i Babilon.” <verse eid="JER 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4" />Kitmeno Yokanan wod pa Karea ki ludito wi mony ducu kacel ki lwak ducu pe gulubu lok pa Rwot, me dong i lobo Juda. <verse eid="JER 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:26">2 Luk 25:26</ref></char></note>Ento Yokanan wod pa Karea ki ludito wi mony ducu gumako dano ducu ci guterogi woko i Ejipt, kacel ki jo ducu mayam gudwogo ki i rok mapatpat kama yam kiryemogi guket iye ci gudwogo cen kabedo i Juda; <verse eid="JER 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6" />co, mon, lutino kacel ki anyira pa rwot. Gutero jo ducu mayam Nebujaradan ladit pa lugwok rwot owekogi bot Gedalia wod pa Akikam; ma wod pa Capan; guterowa kacel ki Baruk wod pa Neria. <verse eid="JER 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7" />Pe gulubu gin ma Rwot ociko, ma omiyo gubino i lobo Ejipt wa i kabedo ma kilwongo ni Tapanec.<verse eid="JER 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8" />Ki kunu i Tapanec, Rwot owaco bota ni, <verse eid="JER 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9" />“Kwany gweng madito imak i cingi, ci iyikgi woko ite cementi ma ikin gweng ma kicano ma kidonyo kwede i gangkal pa rwot Parao i Tapanec, yikgi inyim jo Juda ma gin bene gineno. <verse eid="JER 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10" />Ci i wac botgi ni an Rwot me mony, abikelo latica Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon, ci abicibo komkere iwi gweng man ma ayikoni, ka dong abiyaro kema me ker woko i wigi. <verse eid="JER 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11" />Nebukadnejar bibino ci loyo jo Ejipt woko. Jo ma myero guto ki two, two gemo binekogi woko, ki jo ma myero kitergi i opii, kibiterogi woko i opii, ki jo ma myero guto i lweny kibinekogi woko ki pala Lucwan. <verse eid="JER 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12" />An abimoko mac i odi pa lwak lubanga pa jo Ejipt, ci rwot me Babilon biwango lubangagi woko liweng, nyo bitingone ci cito gire kwede woko. Kit macalo lakwat yero nyuggi ki ikom bongone, i yo acelu bene rwot me Babilon biyero kit jami ducu ki i lobo Ejipt, ka dok bene en bia ki kunu ci cito gire ki loc madit. <verse eid="JER 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13" />En bimuku wir me got matye i Eliopolic matye i lobo Ejipt ma kiworogini; dok en biwango odi pa lwak lubanga me Ejipt gu woko ducu ki mac.”<verse eid="JER 43:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44" />
  <para style="s1">Jeremia otito lok pa Rwot bot Lujudaya ma gitye i Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1" />Rwot oloko kweda lok ma okemo Lujudaya ducu ma gibedo i Ejipt, i taun madito me Migdol, Tapanec, ki Mempic, ki i lobo Patroc. <verse eid="JER 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2" />Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco kuman ni, “Wun kikomwu dong wutyeko neno kit can ducu ma aketo ikom Jerucalem ki ikom taun madito ducu ma i Juda. Kadi wa kombedi gitye macalo wi obur, dok ngat mo pe ma bedo i igi. <verse eid="JER 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3" />Atimo man pien onongo dano gutimo gin maracu dok bene gungeto cwinya omiyo kiniga omaka. Gubedo kawango odok eceta bot lwak lubanga mogo ma gin kikomgi pe gingeyo, wun bene pe wungeyo dok bene kadi wa kwariwu bene yam pe guworo lwak lubanga macalo meno. <verse eid="JER 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4" />Abedo kacwalo lutica lunebi botwu teretere, kun gitito botwu ni pe myero wutim gin marac me kwer ma iya daggini. <verse eid="JER 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5" />Ento wun pe wuwinyo dok pe wuketo cwinywu i lok ma mera. Pe bene wumedo ki weko timo gin marac me wango odok eceta bot lwak lubanga mukenegu wa ki acel. <verse eid="JER 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6" />Pimeno omiyo aonyo kinigana ki akemona mager woko ikom taun ducu me Juda wa ki ikom yoo ducu ma i Jerucalem. Omiyo gudoko obur kit macalo tye kwede wa onyooni.<verse eid="JER 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7" />Pimeno an Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, kombedi apenyowu gin ango ma omiyo wutimo gin marac madit macalo man ikomwu kekenwu. Wun mono wumito kelo can ikom co ki mon, ikom lutino ki lutino lukere, wek ngat mo obed pe ma bidong ki ikin lutuwu i lobo Juda? <verse eid="JER 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8" />Pingo wungeto cwinya miyo kiniga maka pi woro cal jogiwu ma wutiyo atiya ki cingwu, ki dok pi wango odok eceta bot lwak lubanga mukenegu i lobo Ejipt, kama dong wubino me bedo iye? Wun mono wutimo man ni wek wuto woko, wek rok ducu ma iwi lobo gulok lok me cac ikomwu, dok bene gutii ki nyingwu macalo gin me ceno dano? <verse eid="JER 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9" />Wiwu mono dong owil woko ikom gin maracu ma kitimo i taun ducu me Juda ki iwanga yoo me Jerucalem, ma kwariwu gutimo, dok luker me Juda kacel ki mon gi, ki wun bene kacel ki monwu wutimo? <verse eid="JER 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10" />Ento kadi wa onyo pe wumedo ki mwole kenwu pe wubedo ka woro an, dok bene pe wubedo kalubu cik ma mera wa ki gin ducu ma an aciko ma amiyo botwu ki bot kwariwu.<verse eid="JER 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11" />Pimeno an Rwot Lubanga me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, abiketo can ikomwu, abineko jo Juda woko ducu. <verse eid="JER 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12" />Dong pi jo Juda ma onongo gumoko tamgi me cito me bedo i Ejipt, gin ducu kibinekogi woko, gin ducu cake ikom jo matino o kwede ikom jo madito, gibito i lobo Ejipt, i lweny nyo kec ma binekogi. Gibidoko lok lacen dano, dok gin makelo lworo madwong bot dano; dano bibedo kaloko lok cac ikomgi kun gitiyo ki nyinggi macalo gin me ceno dano. <verse eid="JER 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13" />Abiketo can ikom jo ma gibedo i Ejipt, kit macalo aketo can ikom Jerucalem ki lweny, kec ki two gemo. <verse eid="JER 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14" />Pe tye ngat mo ki ikom jo Juda ma gudong ma gubino kabedo i Ejipt ma bibwot dok bedo kwo. Dano mo acel ikin gi pe bidok cen i Juda, kama gitye ka tamo ni myero gidok cen wek gicit gibed iyeni. Ngat mo bene ma bidok cen pe, kono luring ayela mogo manok keken aye gibidok kunu.”<verse eid="JER 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15" />Lacen jo ducu ma gungeyo ni mon gi gutyero odok eceta bot lwak lubanga mukene, ki mon ma gucung kawinyo loke, ki jo ducu ma gubedo i Patroc i lobo Ejipt, gudok iye bota ni, <verse eid="JER 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16" />“Wadag winyo lok ma itito botwa i nying Rwot. <verse eid="JER 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17" />Ento wan wabitiyo gin ducu ma dong watyeko kwongo kwong pire; wabiwango odok eceta bot Rwot ma Dako me Polo kun waonyo gityer amatagu bene bote, kit macalo yam watimo, wan ki kwariwa, lukerwa ki lulocwa, i taun ducu me Juda ki i yoo matye i Jerucalem. Ikare meno onongo watye ki cam madwong, onongo walony, dok bene pe onongo waneno kit can mo. <verse eid="JER 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18" />Ento ikare ma dong waweko wango odok eceta bot Rwot ma Dako me Polo ki onyo gityer amatagu bote, jami ducu dong ocako remowa woko, ki cako nekowa woko i lweny, ki kec bene onekowa otyekowa woko.”<verse eid="JER 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19" />Mon gumede ki lokgi kun giwaco ni, “I ada wan giwa wabimede ki tyero gityerwa bot Rwot ma Dako me Polo, kun wawango bote odok eceta, dok waonyo bote gityer me amata, pien ikare ma onongo watedo mugati ma pore ki cale, cogwa onongo guye dok bene guneno gin ma wabedo katiyone.”<verse eid="JER 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20" />Ci awaco bot lwak ducu, mon kacel ki co ma gudoka iye kit man ni, <verse eid="JER 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21" />“Odok eceta ma wubedo ka wangone i taun ducu me Juda ki i yoo me Jerucalem, wun ki kwariwu, lukerwu ki lulocwu, kacel ki jo me lobo meno onongo wutamo ni Rwot dong wiye owil woko ikom gin ma wutimoni bo? Onongo wutamo ni Rwot pe ngeyo? <verse eid="JER 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22" />Ikare man lobowu dong odoko obur labongo dano mo ma bedo iye. Odoko gin makelo lworo madwong bot dano, ma dano gitiyo ki nyinge macalo gin me ceno dano, pien Rwot dong onongo pe twero ciro gin maracu ki gin me kwer ma wubedo katimoni. <verse eid="JER 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23" />Can man opoto ikomwu kit macalo tye wa onyooni, pien wubedo kawango odok eceta dok wutimo bal ikom Rwot. Pe wubedo kalubu cik ma mere ki gin ducu ma en ocikowu kwede.”<verse eid="JER 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24" />Ci atito ki lwak ducu, makatone bot mon, gin ma Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, onongo owaco bot jo Juda ma gibedo i lobo Ejipt ni, <verse eid="JER 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25" />“Wun kacel ki monwu wucike acika bot Rwot ma Dako me Polo. Wucike ni wubiwango odok eceta bote, kun bene wuonyo gityer amatagu bote, ci wun giwu wugwoko kwong ma wukwongo, dok wucobogi bene kakare. Pimeno wumok kwongwu wutii bene wucob woko liweng! <verse eid="JER 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26" />Ento wuwiny lok me cike ma an Rwot dong atyeko ketone kun akwonge ki nyinga madit bot jo Juda ducu ma gibedo i lobo Ejipt; pe dok abimiyo ngat mo kwongo kwong ki nyinga kun waco ni, ‘Ma calo Rwot Lubanga tye kwoni.’ <verse eid="JER 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27" />Nen, abineno ni guneno can, wek pe gubed maber wa ki acel; jo Juda ducu ma gitye i lobo Ejipt kibinekogi woko i lweny, kec binekogi, nio wang ma guto gutum woko liweng. <verse eid="JER 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28" />Ento jo manok ki ikinwu gibibwot ki i lak to, gin aye gibia ki i lobo Ejipt gidok i lobo Juda. Ci jo Juda ducu ma gudong ki ikin jo mayam gubino i Ejipt gibingeyo lok pa anga ma obedo me ada, mera nyo meggi. <verse eid="JER 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29" />An Rwot abinyutu botwu lanyut man ma nyutu ni abiketo can ikomwu i kabedo man, wek wunge ni lok ma aloko me keto can ikomwu bibedo ada. <verse eid="JER 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1-7">2 Luk 25:1-7</ref></char></note>Abimiyo Parao Kopra rwot me Ejipt woko i cing lukwore ma gimito neke, kit macalo amiyo Jedekia rwot me Juda woko i cing Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon, ma onongo obedo lakwore ma omito neke woko.”<verse eid="JER 44:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45" />
  <para style="s1">Cike pa Lubanga bot Baruk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:1">2 Luk 24:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2 Tek 36:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-2">Dan 1:1-2</ref></char>
    </note>I mwaka me angwen me loc pa Yekoyakim wod pa Yocia rwot me Juda, en aye Baruk wod pa Neria ocoyo iye lok ma awaco bote kore ki kore. An onongo awaco bot Baruk ni, <verse eid="JER 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2" />“Rwot, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco kuman ni, Baruk, <verse eid="JER 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3" />in iwaco ni, ‘Can iwiya gira! Rwot dok omedo cwercwiny ikom arem ma atye kwede. Dong aol woko ki cur dok pe alimo yweyo mo wa ki acel!’”<verse eid="JER 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4" />Pimeno Rwot owaco bota me tito bot Baruk ni, “Abimuku gin mayam agero dok aputu gin mayam apitoni woko. Abitimo man ikom wi lobo kulu. <verse eid="JER 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5" />Itye kayenyo yo ma wek kiteri maber ce? Pe iyeny. Pien nen, abikelo can ikom dano ducu ma bedo i lobo, ento olo twal ibibwot ki i to i kabedo ducu ma itye kacito iye. An Rwot kikoma aye dong atyeko loko man.”<verse eid="JER 45:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46" />
  <para style="s1">Kiloyo Ejipt i Karkemic</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1" />Rwot oloko kweda lok ma okemo lurok. <verse eid="JER 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:1-25">Ica 19:1-25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:1-32:32">Eje 29:1—32:32</ref></char></note>Man aye lok ma en owaco ma okemo Ejipt, Rwot oloko ikom mony pa Parao Neko, rwot me Ejipt, mayam Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon oloyo i lweny i Karkemic macok ki kulu Euprate i mwaka me angwen me loc pa Yekoyakim wod pa Yocia rwot me Juda, kun waco ni,<verse eid="JER 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3" />“Ludito me Ejipt gidange ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:3">‘Wuruk nyonyo me gengo korwu dok wuyube ki kwotwu bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:3">ci wucit i lweny!<verse eid="JER 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4" />Wutwe kom me bedo iwi aguragura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">wubed iwigi, wun wegi aguragura!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Wucung i tyeng ci wuruk otangwic me nyonyo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Wupak leb tongwu obed mabit!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Wuruk koti nyonyowu ikomwu!’”<verse eid="JER 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5" />Rwot penyo ni, “Gin ango mono ma atye kanenoni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Aneno gitye kaloke gidok woko cen ki lworo madwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">kun cwinygi bene obale woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Twoni lwenygi ducu kiketo ret woko ikomgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">ci gitye karingo woko oyotoyot; ma pe gineno ngegi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">pien lworo dong oketo komgi woko!<verse eid="JER 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6" />Jo ma gidwir i ngwec pe gitwero bwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">ki lulweny matego bene pe gitwero bwot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Ki tung kumalo inget kulu Euprate giyoke atata ci gipoto woko.<verse eid="JER 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7" />Man anga matye ka tinge malo calo pii me kulu Nail,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:7">macalo pii ma opong woko libyeny wa i dog geng ma mol amola?<verse eid="JER 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8" />Ejipt aye tye katinge calo pii me kulu Nail,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">calo kulu ma piine opong woko libyeny wa i dog geng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Ejipt owaco ni, ‘Abitinge aumu lobo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">ci abijwero taun madito kun aneko jo ducu ma bedo iye woko.’<verse eid="JER 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9" />Cok aguragura gucak wot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">ki gadigadi bene gucak lore!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Cwal lulweny gucit gukat anyim:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">jo Etiopia ki Put ma gumako kwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">wegi atum ma ludiro i mako atum</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">ma gua ki i Lud.”<verse eid="JER 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10" />Man aye nino pa Rwot Lubanga me mony;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">tin dong en biculu kwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">tin dong en biketo can ikom lukwore.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">En binekogi woko ki pala lucwan nio wang ma otyekogi woko liweng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">ma nongo leb palane dong opune woko ki remo keken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">tin en aye Rwot Lubanga me mony tyero lukwore macalo gitum i lobo matye tung kumalo, inget kulu Euprate.<verse eid="JER 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11" />Wun jo Ejipt, wucit i Gilead,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">ci wuyeny yat me cango two!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Yatwugu ducu nen gin ma konye peke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">gin mo matwero cangowu peke.<verse eid="JER 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12" />Lurok dong guwinyo pi kit lewic ma wutye kwede;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">jo ducu dong guwinyo kokowu oromo i lobo woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">pien lalweny acel acel dong tye kayoke ki lawote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">ci gin ducu gipoto woko i ngom.<verse eid="JER 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nebukadnejar olwenyo ikom Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 43:10-13">Jer 43:10-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot dok oloko kweda ikare ma Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon bino ka lweny ikom Ejipt, kun waca ni,<verse eid="JER 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14" />“Tuc lok man i taun ducu me Ejipt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">kun itito i Migdol, Mempic, ki Tapanec ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">‘Wucung matek, dong wuyube bene me lweny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">gin ducu ma wutye kwede kibibalo woko i lweny!’<verse eid="JER 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15" />Pingo Apic ma lubangawu dong owekowu opoto woko piny?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:15">Cal twon ma wutiyoni kono pe romo cung pingo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:15">Pien Rwot obijwere woko lirwat piny yoko poto wa ingom.<verse eid="JER 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16" />Lwakwu guyoke ci gupoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">kun dano acel acel waco bot lawote ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">‘Wot oyotoyot! Wek wadok cen bot lutuwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">wek wabwot woko ki i lak pala pa lukworwa!’<verse eid="JER 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17" />Lwong Parao, rwot me Ejipt, ki nying manyen ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:17">‘Ngat ma woo tutwal ma oweko gume okato.’<verse eid="JER 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18" />An a Rwot me mony, an aye Rwot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">An Lubanga makwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">Calo got Tabor ma wiye bor kato wi godi ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">ki got Karmel ma ocung mabor i dognam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">tek pa ngat ma bino ka lweny ikomwu tye kitmeno.<verse eid="JER 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19" />Wuyube kun wutweyo yecwu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">woko me cito i opii, wun jo Ejipt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">Pien Mempic dong bidong nono, bidong wi obur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">ma dano mo peke iye.<verse eid="JER 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20" />Ejipt nen calo laroya dyang maber mucwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:20">ento lwango ma gikayo dyangi ma gua ki tung kumalo gitye ka lweny ikome.<verse eid="JER 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21" />Kadi acikarine bene ma kipangogi apanga ki lim</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">gicalo roya mucwe kun gimoo adada gudoko goro ma tekogi peke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Gin guloke guringo woko kacel, pe gucung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">pien nino me keto can ikomgi onongo dong oromo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">en aye bene nino me pwodogi.<verse eid="JER 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22" />Ejipt tye karingo woko kun kok cur acura calo twol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">pien lukwore gitye kabino ki tek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">ma gibino ka lweny ikome ki latong</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">calo jo matye katongo yadi.<verse eid="JER 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23" />Kibitongo yadi me bunganegu woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">kadi bed onongo bungane pe kiromo kato ki iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">pien jone gidwong mada ma pe kitwero kwano welgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">acikarigi pol ma welgi kato wel bonyo woko.<verse eid="JER 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24" />Kibimiyo lewic bimako jo Ejipt woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:24">kibimiyogi woko i cing jo ma gua ki i lobo matye tung kumalo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:24">Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25" />Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco ni, “Abiketo can ikom Amon, ma en lubanga me Tebec, kacel ki Ejipt ki lwak lubangane ki lukerne ducu. Abiketo can ikom Parao kacel ki jo ducu ma gigeno en. <verse eid="JER 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26" />Abimiyogi i cing jo ma mito nekogi, abimiyogi i cing Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon ki luditone. Ento lacen dano dok gibibedo i Ejipt aye, kit macalo yam gubedo ikare ma okato con. An a Rwot me mony dong aloko.”<verse eid="JER 46:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot bilaro jone</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 30:10-11">Jer 30:10-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Pe wulwor, wun likwayo pa latica Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">wun jo Icrael, cwinywu pe myero obale woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Abilarowu ki i lobo ca matye kama bori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">abilaro likwayowu bene ki i lobo mayam kiterowu iye i opii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Likwayo pa Yakobo gibidwogo cen ci gibedo mot ki kuc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">ngat mo pe dok bimiyo gibedo ki lworo.<verse eid="JER 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28" />Pe wulwor, wun likwayo pa latica Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">man an Rwot ma awaco, pien atye kwedwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Abijwero jo me rok ducu atyekogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">ki kama yam aryemowu wuket iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">ento pe abityekowu woko liweng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Pe abiwekowu ma pe aketo can ikomwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">abipwodowu ma berber pe ki kiniga tutwal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 46:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47" />
  <para style="s1">Lok pa Rwot ma okemo jo Piliciti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">Ica 14:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Eje 25:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Jep 2:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Jek 9:5-7</ref></char>
    </note>Ma pud peya Parao olwenyo ikom Gaja, Rwot oloko kweda lok ma okemo jo Piliciti.<verse eid="JER 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2" />Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">“Nen, pii otinge yo tung kumalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">bimol calo kulu ma opong woko libyeny ma piine mol calo lalele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Bimwonyo lobo woko calo pii aluka ki gin ducu matye iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">taun madito ducu kacel ki jo ma bedo i igi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Dano gibidange matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">ki jo ducu ma gibedo i lobo gibikok.<verse eid="JER 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3" />Gibiwinyo obot tyen aguragura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">ki mor pa gadigadi lweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">ki koko pa lawala me gadigadi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">Lunyodo pe dong gibiloke me neno lutinogi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">dong cinggi bene nongo okwe woko.<verse eid="JER 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4" />Pien kare dong oo me tyeko jo Piliciti woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">wek kijuk kit lukony ducu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">ma pud gudong i taun me Turo ki Cidon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">An Rwot kikoma aye ma abityeko Lupiliciti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">gin jo ducu ma gua gubino ki i dog nam me Kaptor.<verse eid="JER 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5" />Cwercwiny madit dong obino bot jo Gaja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">ki jo Acikelon guto gutum woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Wun jo Anak ma odong wubikumu pi kare marom mene?<verse eid="JER 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6" />Wun Piliciti wudange ni, ‘Pala lucwan pa Rwot!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Ibibedo ka jwerowa woko pi kare marom mene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Rwake kekeni i akurani, wek iywe, ibed mot!’<verse eid="JER 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7" />Ento loki biywe maber ningning?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">Ma kun an Rwot dong atyeko miyo tic woko bot pala lucwan me atiyani?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">Atyeko cikone pi lweny ikom jo Acikelon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">ki ikom jo ma gibedo i lobo matye i dog nam.”<verse eid="JER 47:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48" />
  <para style="s1">Kibibalo Moab woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 15:1-16:14">Ica 15:1—16:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">25:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8-11">Eje 25:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Jep 2:8-11</ref></char>
    </note>Man aye lok ma Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, owaco ikom Moab ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">“Can iwi jo Nebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">pien taun gi dong kijwero woko odong nono!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">Kiriataim dong kimako woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">cel gogone mategogu ducu dong kimukugi woko piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">ki jone dong kiketo lewic iwigi matek;<verse eid="JER 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2" />deyo pa Moab dong orwenyo woko matwal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Lumerok tye kapiro lok me timo gin marac ikom Moab i Kecbon, ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">‘Wek watyek rok me Moab woko.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">In taun me Madmen bene ibiling woko litik;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">dul mony biwot kun cito ka lweny ikomi.<verse eid="JER 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3" />Jo Koronaim gitye kadange ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:3">‘Lobowa dong odong woko nono! dano ducu dong kinekogi woko liweng!’<verse eid="JER 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4" />Dong kijwero Moab woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:4">lutinone gitye kakok.<verse eid="JER 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5" />Winy kit ma gikok kwede matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">kun giito cere me Lukit;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">gikok pi neno kit macalo lobo dong kibalo kwede woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">ki i yoo ma dok piny i Koronaim.<verse eid="JER 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6" />Gin giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:6">‘Wuring oyot! Wuring, wular kwowu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:6">Wuring calo kana me tim!’<verse eid="JER 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7" />Wun jo Moab, yam wugeno cel gogowu ki lonyowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">ento kombedi dong kibiterowu woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">ki Kemoc ma lubangawuni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">kibitero kacel kwedwu i opii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">kacel ki ajwakine ki rwodine ducu.<verse eid="JER 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8" />Lamerok ma gibalo taun madit gibibino ikom taun ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">ma pe tye taun mo ma bibwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">nota kacel ki bar bene kibibalogi woko liweng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">kit macalo an Rwot dong atyeko lokoneni.<verse eid="JER 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9" />Wuket gweng lyel i Moab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">pien dong kibijwero woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">Taun gi ducu kibiweko dong obur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">dano mo pe ma bibedo kunu dok aye.”<verse eid="JER 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10" />(Kicen dano ma pe tiyo tic pa Rwot ki cwinye ducu! Kicen ngat ma pe neko dano ki pala lucwane!)<verse eid="JER 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kijwero taun madito ducu me Moab woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11" />Rwot owaco ni, “Moab yam obedo mot maber, dok bene yam pe kitero jone i opii. Moab obedo calo kongo bwino ma kiweko ni ocek mot, ma pe kiyelo, dok pe kionyo woko ki i opoko matye iyeni i i opoko mukene. Mite bene pe obale, bile mere mamit kit macalo yam tye kwede con.<verse eid="JER 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12" />Pimeno, nen, kare tye kabino, ma abicwalo dano gionyo Moab woko calo kionyo kongo bwino. Kibionyo kongo bwinone woko piny, ci kineko opokone kingido woko matinotino. <verse eid="JER 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13" />Man bimiyo lewic mako jo Moab pi Kemoc ma lubangagi, kit macalo lewic yam omako jo Icrael pi Betel, ma en lubanga ma onongo yam gigeno tutwali.<verse eid="JER 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14" />Wun jo Moab, pingo wun wuete kawaco ni wun cogi oteka lweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:14">wutamoni wun lulweny ma cwinywu tek dok wuloyo lweny?<verse eid="JER 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15" />Kijwero Moab woko liweng ki taun gi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:15">awobene mabeco ma kiyerogi ayera kinekogi kityekogi woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:15">An Rwot, Rwot me mony, aye ma awaco man.<verse eid="JER 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16" />Can ma bio ikom Moab dong tye cok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:16">kare me tyekone woko dong tye kabino oyotoyot.<verse eid="JER 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17" />Wukum pi rok meno, wun jo ma wubedo cok kangete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">wun ducu ma wungeyo ywekane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">Wuwac ni, ‘Dong kituru twero matek me loce woko do!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">Deyone ki teke dong pe matwal.’<verse eid="JER 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18" />Wun jo ma wubedo i Dibon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">wulor woko ki i kabedowu me deyo wubin woko piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">ci wubed i ngom i apwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">Pien lamuk Moab dong obino ikomwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">omuku cel gogone mategogu ducu woko wuweko odong obur.<verse eid="JER 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19" />Wun jo ma wubedo i Aroer,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">wucung inget yoo kong wukur;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">wupeny co ki mon ma gitye kalwi gicito woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">wek gutit botwu gin ma otime.<verse eid="JER 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20" />Ci gibidok iye botwu ni, ‘Moab dong otyeko poto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">wukok pire, dong kityeko keto lewic woko iwiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Tit lok man inget kulu Amon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">ni Moab dong kijwero woko, iye odong nono!’<verse eid="JER 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21" />Ngolo kop dong obino ikom taun madito matye i apyel; ma gin aye, Kolon, Jakaja, Mepat, <verse eid="JER 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22" />Dibon, Nebo, Bet-diblataim, <verse eid="JER 48:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23" />Kiriataim, Bet-gamul, Bet-meon, <verse eid="JER 48:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24" />Keriot, Bojra ki taun ducu me lobo Moab matye kamabor ki matye kamacok. <verse eid="JER 48:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25" />Moab dong ki nginyo adada, tekone bene kityeko woko. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kibimiyo lewic mako Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26" />Rwot owaco ni, “Wumii Moab omat mat wek omer woko, pien dong ojemo woko ikoma. Moab bibedo kangene i ngoke kekene, ci dano gibinyere kun gicaye. <verse eid="JER 48:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27" />In Moab kong i po kit macalo ibedo kacayo kwede jo Icrael. Itamo ni onongo gin gubedo lukwo omiyo itimogi maraci? Pien ikare ducu ma iloko pirgi nongo i yengo wii ayenga.<verse eid="JER 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28" />Wun jo ma wubedo i Moab myero wuwek taunwu woko! Wucit wubed ikin got ma obar. Wubed calo akuri magero ode i kor got ma ocule. <verse eid="JER 48:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29" />Moab luwake tutwal! Dong watyeko winyo kit wake, nyate, ki bwola ma dano gitye kwede i cwinygi kun gitamo pirgi ken gi. <verse eid="JER 48:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30" />An Rwot, angeyo cacgi. Dok nyategi bene obedo gin me bwolo, kadi gin ma gitiyo ducu bene obedo gin me bwolo. <verse eid="JER 48:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31" />Pimeno, abikok pi Moab, kun akumu pi jo Moab ducu. Abikumu bene pi jo Kir-kerec. <verse eid="JER 48:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32" />Abikok pi jo Cibma makato ma akok pi jo Jajer. In i taun madit me Cibma ibedo calo yat olok ma jange boco ongolo nam oo wa loka tungcel, ma ocito oo wa i Jajer. Ento nyig yadiwu me oro ki nyig olokwu dong kibalo woko. <verse eid="JER 48:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33" />Yomcwiny ki yomic madwong mayam dano gitye kwede dong kikwanyo woko ki i lobo Moab ma onongo ceko cami. Ajuku kongo bwino woko omiyo pe mol ki i bur kama ginyono nyig olok; pe tye ngat mo ma nyono nyig olok kun dange pi yomcwiny.<verse eid="JER 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34" />Jo Kecbon ki Eleale gitye ka dange ma dwon gi winye kamabor wa i Jakaj; jo matye i Joar bene winyo dwon gi, dok bene winye kamabor wa i Koronaim ki i Eglat-celiciya. Pii me Nimrim bene dong otyeko two woko liweng. <verse eid="JER 48:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35" />Abijuku jo Moab pe dok gibityero gitum ki wango odok eceta iwang jogi bot lubangagi. An Rwot, dong aloko man. <verse eid="JER 48:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36" />Ma omiyo atye ka kumu i cwinya pi Moab ki pi jo Kir-kerec calo dano matye kakutu nyamulere ki wer lyel, pien lonyo ki jami ducu mayam gulimo dong orwenyo woko matwal. <verse eid="JER 48:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37" />Dano acel acel olyelo wiye dok onyaro yer tike woko pi kwero cola. Cinggi ducu kingolo bedo bur, dok dano acel acel tye oruku bongo cola ipyere. <verse eid="JER 48:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38" />Iwi odi ducu matye i Moab ki i dye taun gi ducu iwinyo koko keken, pe gin mo mukene mapat. Dong atyeko neko Moab woko macalo agulu ma ngat mo pe paro pire. An Rwot dong aloko. <verse eid="JER 48:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39" />Nen kit ma kibalo kwede Moab! Winy kit ma jone gikok kwede! Nen kit ma kikelo kwede lewic ikom Moab! Moab dong odoko gin ayeta, gin makelo lworo madwong bot rok ducu ma gurume.”<verse eid="JER 48:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moab pe twero bwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40" />Rwot dong otyeko cike woko ni tye rok mo ma bituk oyotoyot bino lyane piny ikom Moab calo ocur ma oyaro bwome woko. <verse eid="JER 48:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41" />En owaco ni, “Taun ducu kacel ki cel gogo ducu ki bimakogi woko. Inino meno cwiny lulweny me Moab bipong ki lworo calo dako matye ka rem ki nywal. <verse eid="JER 48:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42" />Kibijwero Moab woko dong pe bibedo rok matwal, pien dong onongo ojemo woko ikoma. <verse eid="JER 48:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43" />Gin makelo lworo madwong, bur ki owic dong tye kakuruwu wun jo Moab. An Rwot, dong aloko. <verse eid="JER 48:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44" />Ngat mo ma bitemo ni ering gin man makelo lworo madwongi bipoto i bur, ki ngat ma bia ki i bur kati woko bimoko i owic, pien dong atyeko keto kare me keto can ikom jo Moab. An Rwot, dong aloko. <verse eid="JER 48:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45" />Luring ayela ma gigoro gitye kayenyo kagwoke i taun madit me Kecbon. Ento Kecbon, ma en aye taun madit mayam rwot Cikon obedo iye, dong tye kawang ki mac. Mac dong otyeko wango kacungu pa jo Moab ki wi godigi ma boco mayam lulweny me Moab gimaroni. <verse eid="JER 48:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46" />Can iwiwu, wun jo Moab! Dong kityeko neko jo mayam giworo Kemoc woko, dok awobegi ki anyiragi bene dong kiterogi woko i opii. <verse eid="JER 48:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47" />Ento ikare matye anyim, abidwoko gum pa Moab bote kakare. Man lok pa Rwot kikome.” Kop ma kingolo ikom Moab ogik kany.<verse eid="JER 48:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49" />
  <para style="s1">Kop ma Rwot ongolo ikom jo Ammon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 21:28-32">Eje 21:28-32</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:1-7">25:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:13-15">Amo 1:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Jep 2:8-11</ref></char>
    </note>Man aye lok ma Rwot owaco ma okemo jo Ammon. En openyo ni, “Jo Icrael gitye kwene? Gin mono pe gitye ki laleyo mo ma myero ocung ikom lobogi? Pingo guweko jo ma giworo Molek gukwanyo dul lobo ma i kaka pa Gad dok gudoko lubedo i taun gi? <verse eid="JER 49:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2" />Pimeno, nen, nino tye kabino, en kare ma abimiyo jo me Raba winyo dwon me koko me lweny, ci taun madit pa jo Ammon kibiweko dong obur ki gangine ducu bene kibiwangogi woko ki mac. Lacen jo Icrael dong bimayo lobogi woko ki i cing jo mayam gumayo woko ki botgi ca. An Rwot, dong aloko. <verse eid="JER 49:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3" />Wukok atika, wun jo Kecbon! Pien Ai ma taunwu dong kijwero woko, iye odong nono! Wukok ki kumu madit atika, wun anyira Raba! Wuruk bongo cola ci wubed kakumu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:3">Wubed kangwec atata ki iwi celgu. Molek ma lubangawuni kibitero woko i opii, kacel ki ajwakine ki luloce bene. <verse eid="JER 49:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4" />Pingo wun jo ma pe wugeneni wutye kanyate pi tekowu? Pingo wugeno tekwu kun wuwaco ni ngat mo pe ma bitwero bino ka lweny ikomwu? <verse eid="JER 49:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5" />Nen, abikelo gin mamiyo lworo madwong makowu ki i kabedo ducu. Wun ducu kibiryemowu woko. Dano acel acel biringo laro kwone, ngat mo bene bibedo pe ma bicoko luring ayela dwokogi cen kacel.<verse eid="JER 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6" />Ento lacen abidwoko gum pa jo Ammon botgi doki. An Rwot, dong aloko.”<verse eid="JER 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kop ma Rwot ongolo ikom Edom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Ica 34:5-17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eje 25:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1:2-5</ref></char>
    </note>Man aye gin ma Rwot me mony owaco ma okemo Edom ni, “Ryeko me ngolo kop maber mono dong orweny woko ki bot jo Teman? Lumii tamgi dong mono pe twero tito botgi gin ma myero kitim? Ryekogi mono dong orywenyo woko liweng? <verse eid="JER 49:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8" />Wun jo Dedan, wuloke wuring woko! Wucit wukane woko kamatut! Abineko likwayo pa Ecau woko, pien kare dong oo ma myero aket iye can ikomgi. <verse eid="JER 49:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9" />Ka dano gubino kapwono olok, ci giweko mogo iwi yate; dok bene ka lukwo gubino idyewor, giyako jami ma oromo kit ma gimito keken. <verse eid="JER 49:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10" />Ento ajwero likwayo pa Ecau woko adada, dok ajwero kabedogi ma onongo gukane iye abalo woko, man miyo dong pe gibikane matwal. Jo Edom ki wadigi ki luwotgi ducu dong kinekogi woko, ngat mo pe odong. <verse eid="JER 49:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11" />Wuwek lutino kicwu ma wegigi peke bota, an abigwokogi. Mon towu ducu gibigeno an.<verse eid="JER 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12" />Kace onongo jo ma pe myero kiket can ikomgini gumato gin matye i kikopo me can, dong wutamo ni wun wubibwot ma pe kong nongo kiketo can ikomwu? Pe gire, myero kong wumat gin matye i kikopo me can! <verse eid="JER 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13" />An dong atyeko kwongo kwong woko ki nyinga kekena ni taun madit me Bojra bidoko gin marac ma dano uru, dok tim aroo ma iye odong nono; dano gibiloko lok agec ikome kun gitiyo ki nyinge macalo gin me ceno dano. Gangi ma i ngetegu ducu bidoko wi obur matwal. An Rwot, dong aloko.”<verse eid="JER 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14" />Ci awaco ni, “Anongo lok ma oa ki bot Rwot. En ooro lakwena me tito bot rok ducu ni, ‘Wucok dul monywu ducu kacel wubin ka lweny ikom Edom! Wuyube pi lweny! <verse eid="JER 49:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15" />Rwot bimiyo rokwu bedo goro, dok dano gibicayowu mada. <verse eid="JER 49:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16" />Wake ma wubedo kwede obwolowu mere nono. Ngat mo pe ma lworowu kit macalo wutamo ni kilworowuni. Wubedo ikin got ma obar, malo wa iwi got mabor; ento kadi bed wuger odiwu malo calo ocur ma ogero ode malo, Rwot bikelowu woko ki kunu wa piny. Man lok pa Rwot kikome.”<verse eid="JER 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17" />Rwot owaco ni, “Can marac kit man bipoto ikom Edom ma bimiyo jo ma gikato ki ka kenyo gibedo ki ur, dok lworo makogi marac pi gin ducu ma guneno ma dong otyeko time ikom Edom. <verse eid="JER 49:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Aca 19:24-25</ref></char></note>Kit gin acel ma otime ikom Codom ki Gomora ikare ma gin ki taun gi ma cokcok kwedgi kityekogi woko bitime bene ikom Edom. Ngat mo ma bibedo kunu pe bibedo tye, kadi bed pi kare mo manok keken. An Rwot, dong aloko. <verse eid="JER 49:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19" />Nen, abibino macalo labwor ma bino i dye olet romi kun a ki i bunga ma yadine gucule woko liking matye i dog kulu Jordan, abimiyo jo Edom giringo woko ki i lobogi, ka dong lacen dano mo ma ayero ni obed latela aye biloyo rok meno. Anga ma kitwero poro ki an? Anga matwero ette me pyem kweda? Kit laloc ango mono matwero cung inyima? <verse eid="JER 49:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20" />Pimeno, dong wuwiny kit yub ma an Rwot, dong atyeko yubune ikom jo Edom, ki gin ma dong ayube me timone ikom jo ma bedo i taun madit me Teman. Kadi bed wa lutinogi kibiywayogi woko, ci bimiyo dano ducu gibedo ki ur matek ikom can meno ma opoto ikomgini. <verse eid="JER 49:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21" />Ka Edom opoto ci more bimiyo lobo yenge, ki koko odurugi bene biwinye kamabor wa i Nam Makwar. <verse eid="JER 49:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22" />Nen, lamerok bibino lwenyo ikom Bojra calo ocur ma tuk ki malo i pol kun lyane piny ma nongo oyaro bwome woko. Inino meno lulweny me Edom cwinygi bibedo ki lworo calo cwiny dako matye karem ki nywal.”<verse eid="JER 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kop ma Rwot ongolo ikom Damaciko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:1-3">Ica 17:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo 1:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1">Jek 9:1</ref></char>
    </note>Man aye lok ma Rwot oloko ma okemo Damaciko ni, “Jo ma i taun madito me Kamat ki Arpad alee dong otwodogi woko, pien guwinyo lok marac, ci cwinygi dong tye ma ongabe angaba ki lworo, calo nam ma twage, ma pe twero limo yweyo mo wa ki acel. <verse eid="JER 49:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24" />Jo Damaciko ducu dong gudoko goro, dong guloke me ringo woko ki lworo madwong. Gitye ki arem me cwercwiny madwong calo dako matye karem ki nywal. <verse eid="JER 49:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25" />Taun madit mayam oywek ma onongo yomcwiny dwong iyeni dong kibalo woko iye odong nono. <verse eid="JER 49:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26" />Inino meno awobe kacel ki acikari ducu ki binekogi woko i dye taun madit. An Rwot me mony, dong aloko. <verse eid="JER 49:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27" />Abimoko mac ikom odi madongo me Damaciko, ci abiwango gangkal pa Benadad woko.”<verse eid="JER 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kop ma kingolo ikom kaka me Kedar ki ker me Kajor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28" />Man aye lok ma kitito ikom kaka me Kedar ki ker ducu me Kajor mayam Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon olwenyo ikomgi ci oloyogi wokoni, Rwot owaco kuman ni, “A icit ka lweny ikom jo Kedar, ci inek jo me kaka matye kunyangoni woko. <verse eid="JER 49:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29" />Yak kemagi, ki romigi, ki bongo kicika me kemagi wa ki jami ducu matye i kemagi. Yak kinagagi kun itito bot lwak ni, ‘Lworo madwong dong oromo i lobo ducu!’<verse eid="JER 49:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30" />Wun jo Kajor, acikowu ni myero wuring wukane woko kamabor. Pien Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon dong otyeko yubu yub me timo gin marac ikomwu, kun waco ni dong bene etyeko piro lok woko ikomwu.<verse eid="JER 49:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31" />Wua wubin, wucit ka lweny ikom rok mayam bedo ki kuc labongo ayelayela mo! Taun gi madit pe tye ki dogcel kadi wa rii me lorone bene peke, pimeno tye kene, ngat mo ma gwoko bene peke.<verse eid="JER 49:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32" />Kinagagi kacel ki dyangigi kibiyako woko! Abikeyo jo ma nyaro yer wigi dong ma cegoni woko i kabedo ducu, dok bene abikelo can madit ki i kabedo ducu aketo ikomgi. Man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33" />Kajor bidoko tim aroo matwal, i kabedo ma too keken aye bedo iye. Ngat mo pe bibedo kunu, dok ngat mo bene pe bicito kunu me bedo iye.”<verse eid="JER 49:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kop ma kigolo ikom Elam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34" />Cutcut i acaki me loc pa Jedekia rwot me Juda, Rwot oloko kweda lok ma mako lobo Elam. <verse eid="JER 49:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35" />Rwot me mony owaca kuman ni, “Abineko wegi atum ma gumiyo lobo Elam odoko mateki woko ducu liweng. <verse eid="JER 49:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36" />Abimiyo yamo a ki i twok piny ducu ci bikodo ikom Elam kun keyo jone woko ki i kabedo ducu, nio wang ma lobo mo pe bidong ma luring ayelagi bibedo ma pe gularo i iye. <verse eid="JER 49:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37" />Abimiyo jo Elam gibibedo ki lworo ikom lukworgi ma mito nekogi wokoni. Abikelo gin marac ikomgi pi kinigana madit dok abicwalo mony ikomgi nio ka kityekogi woko liweng. <verse eid="JER 49:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38" />Abineko luker ki rwodi pa jo Elam woko, ci abicibo komkera woko kunu. Man an Rwot ma awaco. <verse eid="JER 49:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39" />Ento lacen abidwoko gum pa jo Elam botgi doki. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 49:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kitito ikom Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:1—51:64: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:1-14:23">Ica 13:1—14:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:1-15">47:1-15</ref></char>
    </note>Man aye lok ma Rwot oloko bota ikom Babilon ma en aye lobo pa jo Kaldaya ni,<verse eid="JER 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2" />“Wutuc lok man bot rok ducu dok wutit pire bene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Wuting bendera malo kamaleng ci wutit lok man.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Pe wugwok lok man obed macalo lok me mung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">ento wuwac ni, ‘Babilon dong opoto!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Bel ma lubangane dong lewic omako woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Merodak bene cwinye obale woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Cal lubanganegu ducu dong lewic omakogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">ki cal jogine dong ki nginyo woko!’<verse eid="JER 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3" />Rok ma oa ki i lobo matye yo tung kumalo obino ka lweny ikom Babilon, bibalo lobo miyo doko tim aroo. Dano ki lee gibiringo woko, dong ngat mo ma bibedo kunu bibedo peke.”<verse eid="JER 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwogo pa jo Icrael i lobogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4" />Rwot owaco ni, “Ka kare meno oo jo Icrael ki jo Juda gibibino ki koko, kun giyenyo an Rwot Lubangagi. <verse eid="JER 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5" />Gibipenyo pi yoo ma cito i Cion, ci gibicito gikemo kunu atir. Ci gibiketo gicike ma bedo nakanaka ki Rwot ma pe gibiturune, dok wigi bene pe biwil iye.<verse eid="JER 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6" />Jona dong gitye macalo romi ma gurwenyo woko, ma lukwatgi aye oweko gurwenyo woko ki iwi godi. Gubedo kawot ki ikom got man kun gicito ikom got mukene, ma wigi owil woko kama dwolgi tye iye. <verse eid="JER 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7" />Jo ducu ma onongogi onekogi woko. Lukworgi dong guwaco ni, ‘Gin gubalo ikom Rwot, piman gin ma watimo ikomgini pe gin mo marac. Kwarigi yam guketo gen gi ikom Rwot, ci gin kikomgi onongo bene myero gubed lugen ikome.’<verse eid="JER 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:4">Niy 18:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wun jo Icrael wuring woko ki i Babilon! Wuwek lobo pa jo Kaldaya! Wubed dong jo mukwongo me weko lobo macalo nyok dyel ma telo nyim dyegi! <verse eid="JER 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9" />Nen, abitugu lwak pa rok ma gitego ma gitye yo tung kumalo, ci abimiyo gibino ka lweny ikom Babilon. Gibirye woko i tyeng pi lweny ikom Babilon ci gibimako woko. Gibicelo atero macalo lulweny ma gikwiri ma pe gicelo aterogi piny nono. <verse eid="JER 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10" />Kibiyako lobo pa jo Kaldaya; jo ma biyako bene gibiyako gin ducu ma igi mito, man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poto pa Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11" />Wun jo Babilon dong wuyako roka woko. Kadi bed cwinywu yom, kun wuwake macalo laroya dyang ma camo lum, nyo macalo twon aguragura ma bwaro, <verse eid="JER 50:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12" />gangwu dong bipong ki lewic dok ki cac madit. Lobo Babilon ma en aye minwu dong biloke doko rok mo matidi adada ikin rok ducu; bidoko lobo mutwo dok tim aroo ma pii pe iye. <verse eid="JER 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13" />Pi kinigana, ngat mo pe ma bibedo i Babilon; lobo man ducu bidoko obur ma iye odong nongo. Jo ducu ma gibikato ki inget Babilon gibibedo ki ur madit kun gibijwat pi gin man ma otimeni.<verse eid="JER 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14" />Wun wegi atum, wucung i tyeng pi lweny ikom Babilon, ci wurum woko. Wucel aterowu ducu ikom Babilon, pien dong otyeko timo bal woko ikoma, an Rwot. <verse eid="JER 50:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15" />Wudange ki woo me lweny kun wurumu kwede ki taun madit man woko. Babilon kombedi dong omiine woko kene. Cele ducu dong kimuku kireto woko piny. Man an Rwot aye atye kaculu kwor ikom jo Babilon. Pimeno wucul kwor ikomgi, wutimgi kit macalo yam gin gutimo kwede jo mukeneni. <verse eid="JER 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16" />Pe wuwek jo ma coyo kodi obed tye i Babilon, ki jo ma gimako pala me kayo kac bene gubed peke. Larok mo keken ma bedo kunu bibedo ki lworo ikom mony matye ka lweny ci bimiyo dok cen i lobone kikome.<verse eid="JER 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwogo pa jo Icrael i lobogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17" />Jo Icrael gubedo calo romi ma labwor dwaro ci oryemogi oketogi woko ata. Mukwongo rwot me Aciria yam olwenyo ikomgi, ka dok Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon omwodo cogogi woko. <verse eid="JER 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18" />Pimeno, an Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, abiketo can ikom rwot Nebukadnejar ki lobone, kit macalo yam aketo kwede can ikom rwot me Aciriani. <verse eid="JER 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19" />Abidwoko jo Icrael woko cen i lobogi. Gibibedo kacamo cam ma cek iwi got Karmel ki i dul lobo me Bacan, dok bene gibicamo gin ducu ma igi mito ma ocek iwi cere i lobo Epraim ki Gilead. <verse eid="JER 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20" />Ka kare meno oromo, ci pe kibinongo bal mo i Icrael, kadi ki tim maracu bene pe kibinongo i Juda, pien dong abitimo kica bot jo ma aweko gibedo kunu. Man an Rwot ma awaco.”<verse eid="JER 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kop ma Rwot ongolo ikom Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Wucit wulweny ikom jo Merataim, ki Pekod. Wunekgi wutyekgi woko liweng. Dok wutii gin ducu ma acikowu. <verse eid="JER 50:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22" />Woo me lweny dong tye kawinye i lobo dok lobo bene dong kibalo woko marac adada. <verse eid="JER 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23" />Babilon dong ogoyo lobo woko piny ki nyol, ento koni nyol meno dong ongide woko matinotino. Rok ducu gitye ki ur madit pi gin ma dong otime ikom Babilon. <verse eid="JER 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24" />Babilon, dong ityeko moko woko i owic ma aciko piri, kun pe onongo ingeyo. Kinongi dong imoko woko pien onongo ipyem kweda. <verse eid="JER 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25" />Dong ayabo kabedo kama akano iye jami lwenya, akwanyogi akelogi woko ki kiniga, pien an Rwot Lubanga me mony, atye ki tic ma myero atii i lobo Babilon. <verse eid="JER 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26" />Wubin wucak lweny ikome i kabedo ducu; wuyab derone wokogu ducu. Wucan jami ma kiyakoni wek odure lipim calo ngano ma kiduru. Wujwer lobone woko ni rwatrwat! Pe wuwek gin mo odong iye kadi ki acel. <verse eid="JER 50:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27" />Wunek twonigi woko ducu! Wunekgi woko liweng. Can iwi jo Babilon, pien karegi dong oromo. Kare dong oo me keto can ikomgi!<verse eid="JER 50:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28" />(Luring ayela ma gin jo ma gubwot ki i Babilon gubino i Cion, dok gutito kit macalo Rwot Lubangawa oculu kwede kwor pi gin mayam jo Babilon otimo ikom ot ma mere.)<verse eid="JER 50:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:6">Niy 18:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Wulwong wegi atum me lweny ikom Babilon. Wucwal jo ducu ma gingeyo telo atum ki celo atero gucit. Wurum gang woko, pe wuwek ngat mo obwot. Wucul kwor ikome pi gin ducu mayam en otimo, dok bene wutim en kit macalo yam en otimo kwede jo mukeneni, pien en yam oete ikoma ki wake madit, an a Rwot ngat Maleng pa Icrael. <verse eid="JER 50:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30" />Pimeno awobegi kibinekogi woko i dye taun madit, ki acikarine bene kibinekogi kityekogi woko inino meno. Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 50:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31" />Nen, atye ki lok ikomwu wun jo ma luwake, man Rwot me mony ma owaco; pien ninowu dong oo, en aye kare ma abiketo iye can ikomwu. <verse eid="JER 50:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32" />Rok ma lawakeni biyoke ci poto woko, dong ngat mo ma bikonyone me ilone malo bibedo peke. Abicwinyo gangiwu woko ducu ki mac, dok gin ducu ma orumu gangi kibibalo woko liweng.”<verse eid="JER 50:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33" />Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, “Kitye ka unu jo Icrael ki jo Juda matek mada. Jo ma dong gumakogi macalo opii gitye kagwokogi adada, ma pe giye ni gucit wa ki acel. <verse eid="JER 50:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34" />Ento ngat ma kokogini tek, nyinge Rwot me mony. En kikome aye ma dong bipido lokgi, dok bikelo kuc i lobo, ento bikelo can ikom jo Babilon.”<verse eid="JER 50:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35" />Rwot waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">“Kinek jo Babilon! Kinek jo Kaldaya woko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">Kinek rwodine ki luryekone ducu woko.<verse eid="JER 50:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36" />Kinek lutyet ma lugoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">ma gin cogi luming mogo ma pe twereni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Kinek lulwenye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">myero kinekgi kityekgi woko.<verse eid="JER 50:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37" />Wunek aguragurane dok wubal gadigadi lwenye wutyek woko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Wunek jo me dul mony pa lurok ma kiwilogi ki lim me bino ka lweny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">dong gibidoko goro calo mon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Wubal lonyonegu woko ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">wuyak jamigi woko liweng.<verse eid="JER 50:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38" />Wek kot pe ocwer i lobone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">wek piine otwo woko liweng!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">Babilon aye lobo ma opong ki cal jogi mapol adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">omiyo jo ma worogi gudoko calo lupoya.<verse eid="JER 50:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:2">Niy 18:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pimeno lee me tim gibibedo kacel ki lalur ki udu i Babilon, dano dong pe bibedo kunu matwal, dok bene dano pe dong bibedo iye pi kare pa yalwak ducu. <verse eid="JER 50:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Aca 19:24-25</ref></char></note>Kit gin acelu bitime ikom Babilon, mayam otime ikom Codom ki Gomorani, ki ikom taun pa luwotgi ma orumu ka ngetgi ma Lubanga otyekogi. Dano mo pe bibedo kunu, dok ngat mo bene pe bibedo iye macalo welo. Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 50:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41" />Nen, lwak me rok moni tye kabino kun gia ki i lobo matye yo tung kumalo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:41">rok matek ki luker mapol matye kamabor mada gitye kayube pi lweny.<verse eid="JER 50:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42" />Dong gumako atumgi ki tonggi woko liking;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">giger adada, pe gitye ki kica mo wa ki acel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">woogi winye calo nam matye kamor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Guringo ki aguragura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">ma gurye woko calo jo ma dong kuru lweny akura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">ikomwu, wun jo Babilon!<verse eid="JER 50:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43" />Rwot me Babilon bene dong otyeko winyo lok ikomgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">ci cinge bene dong okwe woko ma pe dong twero timo gin mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">remcwiny madwong dong oketo kome woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">calo arem pa dako matye karem ki nywal.<verse eid="JER 50:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44" />Nen, abibino macalo labwor i olet romi kun aa ki i bunga me Jordan ma yate ocule liking, ci abimiyo jo Babilon giringo woko ki i lobogi. Dong lacen dano mo ma ayero ni obed latela aye biloyo rok meno. Anga mono ma kitwero poro ki an? Anga matwero ete me pyem kweda? Kit laloc ango mono matwero cung inyima? <verse eid="JER 50:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45" />Pimeno, dong wuwiny kit yub ma an Rwot, dong atyeko yubune ikom jo Babilon, ki gin ma dong ayube me timone ikom lobo pa jo Kaldaya. Kadi wa lutinogi kibiywayogi woko, ci bimiyo dano ducu gibedo ki ur matek ikom can meno ma opoto ikomgini. <verse eid="JER 50:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46" />Ka Babilon opoto, ci more bimiyo lobo yenge, ki koko oduru ma kigoyo pire bene biwinye wa ikin rok mukene ducu.”<verse eid="JER 50:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51" />
  <para style="s1">Kop ma Rwot ongolo ikom Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Abikelo gin ma neko piny ikom Babilon ki ikom jo Kaldaya. <verse eid="JER 51:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2" />Abicwalo lurok kapyeto Babilon calo cung kal ma kipyeto ma yamo kolo tero woko. Ka nino me can man obino ci kibilwenyo ikom dano i kabedo ducu, ci biweko lobo dong nono. <verse eid="JER 51:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3" />Pe wumii kare ki jo Babilon me celo aterogi nyo me ruku koti nyonyogi me lweny. Pe wubwot awobegi makwo. Wutyek dul monygi woko liweng. <verse eid="JER 51:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4" />Kibiketo ret ikomgi ci gibito i dye yoo me taun gi madito. <verse eid="JER 51:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5" />An Rwot Lubanga me mony, pe abwoto jo Icrael ki jo Juda, kadi bed onongo gutimo bal ikoma, an ngat Maleng me Icrael. <verse eid="JER 51:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6" />Wuring woko ki i Babilon! Wuring wular kwowu! Pe myero kinekwu woko pi bal me Babilon. Pien man en aye kare me culu kwora ki me keto can ikom Babilon ma oporo gin ma en otimo. <verse eid="JER 51:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:2-4">Niy 17:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:3">18:3</ref></char></note>Babilon onongo obedo macalo kikopo jabu i cinga, ma omiyo lobo ducu omer. Rok ducu gumato kongo bwinone, ci gudoko lupoya woko. <verse eid="JER 51:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8" />Babilon dong opoto woko oyotoyot, kun kijwero woko liweng. Wukok pire! Wukel yat wuket iwang rete, gwok nyo bimiyo en cang. <verse eid="JER 51:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:5">Niy 18:5</ref></char></note>Lurok ma onongo gibedo kunu guwaco ni, ‘Watemo konyo Babilon ki yat wek ocang, ento onongo dong pe twero lare. Wabwote, wek wacitu wadoku cen paco. Lubanga dong otyeko keto can ikom Babilon ki teke ducu, ci ojwero obalo woko adada.’”<verse eid="JER 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10" />Rwot owaco ni, “Jona gidange ni, ‘Rwot dong onyutu ni lokwa tye atir. Wubin wacitu watitu bot jo ma bedo i Cion gin ma Rwot Lubangawa dong otyeko timoneni.’”<verse eid="JER 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11" />Rwot dong otugu cwiny luker pa jo Medi woko, pien en dong oyube me tyeko Babilon woko. Man aye kit macalo en biculu kwede kwor pi Ot mere ma kimuku kireto woko pinyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:11">Ludito wi mony dong giwaco bot acikari ni, “Wupak leb aterowu! Wumak kwotwu i cingwu! <verse eid="JER 51:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12" />Wutwe bendera ocung ma nyutu lweny ikom cel me Babilon. Wucuk cwiny lukurpiny wek pe gubed lwor! Wupok lukurpiny woko i kabedo mapatpat. Wumii jo mukane woko gukii piny!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:12">Rwot dong otyeko timo gin mayam en oyube ni ebitimo, gin mayam en oloko ni ebitimo ikom jo ma gibedo i Babilon. <verse eid="JER 51:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:1">Niy 17:1</ref></char></note>Babilon tye ki kulu madwong ki lonyo mabup, ento karene dong otum, ci oweko tol uci me kwone dong kingolo woko. <verse eid="JER 51:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14" />Rwot me mony dong okwonge ki nyinge kekene ni ebikelo lwak dano mapol calo bonyo ka lweny ikom Babilon, ka dong gibidange ki dwon me woo me loyo lweny.<verse eid="JER 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wer me pako Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15" />Rwot oketo lobo ki twerone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:15">dok ocibo lobo ocung matek pi ryekone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:15">ki pi ryeko matut ma en tye kwede omiyo oyaro polo woko.<verse eid="JER 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16" />Ikare ma dwone mor, ci pii twage matek ki i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">dok miyo lupuu duny kun a ki agiki lobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">En miyo lutkot wil ka kot cwer,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">dok miyo yamo kodo kun a ki i ot kano jamine.<verse eid="JER 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17" />Ka dano guneno man, ci gin ducu gidoko luming ma wigi oding;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">lewic mako latet jabu pi cal joke ma en otiyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">pien cal jogine ducu pe lubanga me ada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">dok bene pe gitye ki kit kwo mo i igi.<verse eid="JER 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18" />Konygi peke, kitiyogi ci myero kicaagi acaya keken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:18">ikare ma Rwot bibino kaketo can ikomgi gibito gitum woko.<verse eid="JER 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19" />Lubanga pa Yakobo pe obedo calo cal jogi magi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">pien en aye ngat ma ocweyo jami ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">dok bene en oyero jo Icrael wek gubed jone kikome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">Nyinge Rwot me mony.<verse eid="JER 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyono pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">“Babilon, in ibedo nyonona, ki jami lwenya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">Atiyo kwedi me nginyo rok ducu woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">atiyo kwedi me tyero ker woko ducu,<verse eid="JER 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21" />atiyo kwedi me neko aguragura ki jo ma ringo kwedgi kun anyotogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:21">atiyo kwedi me turu gadigadi lweny kacel ki jo ma ngweco kwedgi atyeko woko,<verse eid="JER 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22" />atiyo kwedi me neko co wa ki mon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:22">me neko co ma otii wa ki awobegu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:22">me neko awobe wa ki anyira,<verse eid="JER 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23" />atiyo kwedi me nyoto lukwat ki romigi woko ni nginyinginyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:23">atiyo kwedi me neko lupur wa ki twoni ma gipuru kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:23">atiyo kwedi me neko luloc wa ki ludito wi mony woko ducu.<verse eid="JER 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwod ma kibiketo ikom Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24" />Wubineno gin me culu kwor ma abitimo ikom Babilon ki ikom jo kaldaya ducu pi gin marac ma gutimo ikom Cion. <verse eid="JER 51:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25" />In Babilon, ibedo calo got ma obalo lobo woko, ento an Rwot aye lakwori. Abimaki woko licwic, ci arudi woko i ngom, ci abiweki i dong i buru calo got ma owang. <verse eid="JER 51:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26" />Pe gibikwanyo gweng mo ki ikomi wa ki acel me tic kwede pi gedo doki, kadi me twok ot nyo me te guti me ot. Ibidoko dong tim aroo matwal. Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 51:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27" />Wugur bendera ocung i ngom pi lweny! Wukut tum wek rok ducu guwiny! Dong wulwong rok woko ducu pi lweny ikom Babilon! Wuwac ki ker me, Ararat, Mini, ki Acikenaj, wek gubin gulweny ikome. Wuket ladit maloyo wi mony ducu me lweny ikome. Wukel aguragura bene mapol macalo lwak bonyo ma core. <verse eid="JER 51:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28" />Wuyub rok ducu, luker pa jo Medi, luloc me lobo ki ludito ma konyogi, ki lobo ducu matye ite locgi me lweny ikom Babilon. <verse eid="JER 51:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29" />Lobo tye kayenge dok jo ma iye gitye kakayo lakgi ki arem madwong, pien Rwot dong tye kacobo gin ma en oyubu. En biloko Babilon doko tim aroo, kama dano mo pe bedo iye. <verse eid="JER 51:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30" />Lulweny matego me Babilon dong gugiko lweny woko, ci gubedo i cel gogogi labongo keru mo. Tekcwinygi dong otum woko, dong gudoko calo mon. Dogcel me taun gi madit ducu dong kituru woko; dok odigu ducu dong kicwinyo woko ki mac tye kawang. <verse eid="JER 51:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31" />Luor giringo teretere me rwate ki luwotgi, kun gicito katito bot rwot me Babilon ni dogcel ducu me taun gi madit dong kituru woko ki i kabedo ducu. <verse eid="JER 51:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32" />Lukworgi gumako mel ki yeya me ngolo kulu woko dok gucwinyo lum bene ki mac. Acikari me Babilon ducu dong lworo omakogi woko. <verse eid="JER 51:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33" />Lukworgi cok jwerogi woko piny ci binyonogi woko ki tyen gi calo bel matye i laro moyo.” Man an Rwot me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, aye ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 51:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34" />Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon ongolo Jerucalem ci ocamo woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">ci onginyo woko kicikici.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">En oweko taun madit odong woko ma iye nono calo i agulu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">ci omwonyo woko calo min kulu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Okwanyo gin ma iye mito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">ci obolo gin mukene mudonge woko.<verse eid="JER 51:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35" />Wek jo Cion guwac ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">“Alii myero obed iwi Babilon gire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">pi tim bwami ma gutimo ikomwa!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">Wek jo Jerucalem guwac ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">“Alii myero obed iwi jo Kaldaya gire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">pi danowa ma kinekogi!”<verse eid="JER 51:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot bikonyo jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36" />Pimeno Rwot owaco bot jo me Jerucalem kuman ni, “Abipido lokwu, dok abiculu kwor pirwu bene. Abimiyo pii me nam me Babilon two woko, ki wang itte bene ducu amiyo two woko. <verse eid="JER 51:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37" />Babilon dong bidoko odur ma obake lipim iwi obur kama too me tim gibedo iye. Bibedo kabedo marac mamiyo lworo, ngat mo pe ma bibedo kunu wa ki acel, dong jo ducu ma gibinene gibijwat mada ikom kabedo man ma odong nono labongo ngat mo ma bedo iye. <verse eid="JER 51:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38" />Jo Babilon ducu gibikok calo labwor, dok gibingur calo lutino labwor. <verse eid="JER 51:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39" />Ka gin jo ma owor, ci abitedo karama pirgi. Abimiyo gimato mat gimer woko ci cwinygi bedo mayom. Dong gibinino woko, ento pe gibico wa ki acel. <verse eid="JER 51:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40" />Abiterogi woko macalo lutino romi, macalo nyogi dyegi nyo nyogi romi. Man an Rwot ma awaco.<verse eid="JER 51:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto ikom Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41" />Babilon ma en aye taun madit ma wi lobo kulu pakoni, dong kimako woko! Babilon dong odoko gin makelo lworo marac bot rok ducu! <verse eid="JER 51:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42" />Nam dong ocore woko limuk ikom Babilon, ci biamwonyine ma mor oume woko lipuk. <verse eid="JER 51:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43" />Taun gi madito ducu dong odoko gin ma ki uru makelo lworo marac, dok tye macalo tim aroo ma pii pe iye, kama dano mo pe bedo iye dok pe bene giwoto iye. <verse eid="JER 51:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44" />Abiketo can ikom Bel, ma en lubanga me Babilon, dok abimiyo en ngoko jami mayam en omwonyogu woko ducu ki doge. Rok ducu pe dok gibicito kawore kit mayam con.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:44">Cel me Babilon dong opoto woko. Wun jo Icrael wuring woko ki kunu! <verse eid="JER 51:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45" />Wuring woko wun jo Icrael wek wular kwowu ki ikom kiniga mager pa Rwot. <verse eid="JER 51:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46" />Pe myero cwinywu obale woko, dok pe wubed ki lworo pi lok magi ma wuwinyoni. Mwaka ki mwaka lok mapatpat winye ci ket i kabedo ducu, lok me tim gero i lobo, ki dok lok ikom rwot mo matye ka lweny ki rwot lawote mukene. <verse eid="JER 51:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47" />Pimeno, kare tye kabino, en kare ma abitic kwede ikom cal jogi me Babilon. Lobo Babilon kulu bipong ki lewic madwong, ki jone ducu kibinekogi woko. <verse eid="JER 51:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:20">Niy 18:20</ref></char></note>Gin ducu matye iwi lobo ki i polo gibibedo ki yomcwiny kun giwero wer, kace Babilon opoto i cing jo ma gubino ki i lobo matye tung kumalo katyekone woko. <verse eid="JER 51:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:24">Niy 18:24</ref></char></note>Babilon aye ma okelo to ikom dano ducu ma bedo iwi lobo; kombedi dong Babilon bipoto, pien omiyo jo Icrael mapol ata guto.”<verse eid="JER 51:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok pa Lubanga bot jo Icrael ma gitye i Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50" />Rwot waco bot jone ma gitye i Babilon ni, “Wun dong wubwot ki i lak to! Kombedi dong wucit, pe dok wukur gin mo! Kadi bed wutye kamabor ki paco myero wutam pira, an a Rwotwu, ki wiwu bene myero opo pi Jerucalem. <verse eid="JER 51:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51" />Wun wuwaco ni, ‘Lewic omakowa pien wawinyo lok me cac ma gicayowa kwede; wadoko dong jo ma goro atika, pien lurok dong gubino i kabedo maleng ma i Ot pa Rwot.’ <verse eid="JER 51:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52" />Pimeno awaco ni kare tye kabino, en kare ma abitic kwede ikom jogi me Babilon, jo ma kiketo ret ikomgi gibibedo kacur i kabedo mapol i lobone ducu. <verse eid="JER 51:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53" />Kadi onongo Babilon oito malo wa i pol pi gero gang me cel gogone kunu, kono onongo pud acwalo dano aye me cito katyeke woko. An Rwot dong aloko.<verse eid="JER 51:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma pud tye ka mede ikom Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54" />Wuwiny dwon me koko matye i Babilon, wuwiny ka dano gidange pi can ma dong opoto i lobo pa jo Kaldaya.<verse eid="JER 51:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55" />Dong abijwero Babilon woko, kun amiyo teke bene tum woko ci biling mot. Mony tye karune bino oyotoyot calo pii biamwonyi ma mor, gibino ka lweny ikome ki woo matek.<verse eid="JER 51:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56" />Gin dong gubino woko kaketo can ikom Babilon, ma gimako lulwenye woko, ki atumgi bene kituru dok kingido woko matinotino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:56">An a Rwot Lubanga ma aketo can ikom dano pi bal, dok abiculu kwor ikom Babilon aketo can pi bal ma jone gutimo.<verse eid="JER 51:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57" />Abimiyo rwodine gimer woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">wa ki jone maryekgu, luloc me lobo, ki ludito wi mony ducu, ki lulweny.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">Gibinino woko, ka gin gunino ento pe dok gibico wa ki acel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">An Rwot dong aloko, an a Rwot me mony.<verse eid="JER 51:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58" />Cel me Babilon malaci kibimuku kireto woko wa ingom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">ki dog gange ma kigero wa maloni ducu kibiwango woko ki mac.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">Tic ma lurok gutiyo bene ducu obedo me nono;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">gin ma rok ducu guyele iye katiyo tice matek dong mac owango woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">Man lok pa an Rwot me mony kikome.”<verse eid="JER 51:58" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicwalo lok pa Jeremia i Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59" />Ceraya wod pa Neria ma wod pa Maceya, yam obedo ngat ma gwoko rwot Jedekia. I mwaka me angwen me loc pa Jedekia rwot me Juda, Ceraya onongo tye kacito i Babilon kacel ki rwot Jedekia, ci atite kit lok mogo ma myero en owot kwede. <verse eid="JER 51:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60" />Acoyo i buk lok kom can ma bipoto ikom Babilon, ki lok mukenegu ducu ma kicoyo ma okemo Babilon. <verse eid="JER 51:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61" />An awaco bot Ceraya ni, “Ka io i Babilon nen ni i kwano lok magi ducu kit macalo acoyo bot lwak. <verse eid="JER 51:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62" />Ci myero ileg ni, ‘Ai Rwot, yam onongo iwaco ni i bijwero kabedo man woko, wek pe gin makwo obed iye, dano nyo kadi lee, ci dong bibedo calo tim aroo matwal.’ <verse eid="JER 51:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:21">Niy 18:21</ref></char></note>Ka dong ityeko kwano buk man bot lwak, ci i twe gweng ikome, ka dong i bol kwede woko i dye kulu Euprate, <verse eid="JER 51:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64" />kun iwaco ni, ‘Man aye kit macalo Babilon bimwony kwede woko, ma pe dong bikati woko matwal, pi can ma abikelo ma abiketo ikome.’” Lok pa Jeremia ma en oloko ogik kany.<verse eid="JER 51:64" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52" />
  <para style="s1">Poto pa Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:18-25:7">2 Luk 24:18—25:7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1" />Jedekia ocamo ker ma mwaka me dite tye pyere aryo wiye acel, ci obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye acel. Nying mine Kamutal, nya pa Jeremia me Libna. <verse eid="JER 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2" />En obedo katiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kun lubu kit gin ducu mayam Yekoyakim otiyo. <verse eid="JER 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3" />Pi kiniga ma omako Rwot, ka kare oromo, ci omiyo Rwot obayo Jerucalem ki Juda woko ki inyime.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:3">Jedekia ocako jemo woko ikom rwot me Babilon. <verse eid="JER 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 24:2">Eje 24:2</ref></char></note>I mwaka me abongwen me loce, i dwe me apar, inino dwe apar, en aye Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon obino kwede ki monye ducu ikom Jerucalem, ci orumu taun madit woko, ka dok gutoro cel lobo orumu woko dyere. <verse eid="JER 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5" />Kitmeno gurumu taun madit nio wa i mwaka me apar wiye acel me loc pa rwot Jedekia. <verse eid="JER 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6" />Ikom nino dwe abongwen me dwe me angwen ma onongo kec dong odoko marac adada i Jerucalem, man bene omiyo cam pe dok onen pi lwak. <verse eid="JER 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:21">Eje 33:21</ref></char></note>Ka gumuku cel me taun madit woko, ci lulweny pa Jedekia ducu gumol guringo ki i dyewor, kun giwok ki i dog gang ma ikin cel aryo me Jerucalem, ma inget poto pa rwot, kadi onongo jo Kaldaya gurumu taun maditi woko. Gucito gulubu yoo ma dok tung Araba. <verse eid="JER 52:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8" />Ento mony pa jo Kaldaya guryemo kor rwot Jedekia, ci gumake woko i bar me Jeriko; ci monye guket woko ducu ki ikome. <verse eid="JER 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9" />Ka gumako rwot, ci gukele bot rwot me Babilon i Ribla, kama ongole iye kop. <verse eid="JER 52:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10" />Rwot me Babilon ocako neko awobe pa Jedekia woko ki inyime ma wange neno, dok bene oneko luloc me Juda woko ducu ki i Ribla. <verse eid="JER 52:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:13">Eje 12:13</ref></char></note> En okolo wang Jedekia oloyo woko ka omiyo kitweye ki nyor, ci kitere kwede wa i Babilon, ci kikete i buc nio wa inino me tone.<verse eid="JER 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiwango Ot pa Lubanga woko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:8-17">2 Luk 25:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12" />I dwe me abic, ikom nino dwe apar, ma en aye mwaka me apar wiye abongwen me loc pa rwot Nebukadnejar, ma rwot me Babilon, en aye Nebujaradan ma ladit pa lugwok rwot, ma latic pa rwot me Babilon, obino kwede i Jerucalem. <verse eid="JER 52:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:8">1 Luk 9:8</ref></char></note> Ci owango Ot pa Rwot woko, gangkal pa rwot, ki odi madito ducu matye i Jerucalem. <verse eid="JER 52:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14" />Ci mony pa jo Kaldaya ducu, mayam gitye kacel ki ladit pa lugwok rwot, gumuku kicika cel ma orumu Jerucalem woko. <verse eid="JER 52:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15" />Ki lwak mayam gudong i taun madit, ki jo mayam gukobo gigi ken gi bot rwot me Babilon, kacel ki lwak mayam gudong ducu, Nebujaradan ma ladit pa lugwok rwot oterogi woko i opii. <verse eid="JER 52:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16" />Ento en oweko jo mogo ma gin lucan adada gudong i lobo wek gubed lugwok poto olok ki lupur ki kweri dyang.<verse eid="JER 52:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:15-47">1 Luk 7:15-47</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jo Kaldaya guturu wir mola ci gungido woko, ka dok gutongo lutino gadigadi, ki lagwok pii me nyonyo bronze mayam gitye i Ot pa Rwot, ka gutero molane woko wa i Babilon. <verse eid="JER 52:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18" />Gutero lwak agulu ducu ki akwaya; latok buru, magac, becen, atabo me odok eceta, ki jami me mola ducu mayam kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="JER 52:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19" />Gutero jami ducu mayam onongo kiyubu ki jabu wa ki ma kiyubu ki ryal: atabo matino ki weer me wango mac, ki atabo me liyo gityer amata, agulu lagwok buru, okar mac, weer ma kiwango ki angwece wa ki weer me gityer amata. <verse eid="JER 52:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20" />Lok ma dok ikom wir aryoni, ki nam acel, ki lutino gadigadi ducu mayam Solomon otiyogi pi Ot pa Rwot, pek me mola ma oa ki ikom jami magi ducu dwong ma pe pime.<verse eid="JER 52:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21" />Bor pa wir acel acel onongo romo puti pyere aryo wiye abiro, ka kipimo kor wir ki tol ci dite oromo puti apar wiye aboro. Iye onongo twolo, kome ducu kinong maromo nyig cing angwen. <verse eid="JER 52:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22" />Iwiye yam kiketo iye lalukana me mola, kun lalukana bore romo puti abiro ki nucu. Ikom lalukana onongo kiketo iye obwo ki cal nyig okwer pomegranat, ma gin ducu kitiyogi ki mola ma girumu lalukana dyere. Wir me aryo bene rom ki lawote, kun tye ki cal nyig pomegranat. <verse eid="JER 52:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23" />Cal pomegranat onongo romo pyere abongwen wiye abicel ki tung kungeye; cal pomegranat ducu oromo miya acel ma orumu obwo ma kitiyo orumu woko ducu.<verse eid="JER 52:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitero Lujudaya i Babilon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:18-21">2 Luk 25:18-21</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 25:27-30">27-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24" />Nebujaradan bene otero Ceraya ma ajwaka madit, ki Jepania ajwaka me aryone, ki lukur dogola me Ot pa Rwot gin adek. <verse eid="JER 52:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25" />Ka dok okwanyo ladit maloyo lumony ki i dye gang, ki lumemba abiro mamiyo tam ki rwot ma onongogi i dye taun madit; ki karan pa ladit me mony, mayam coyo lok me lweny; ki jo pyere abicel ma ikin wegi lobo ma kinonogi i dye taun madit man. <verse eid="JER 52:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26" />Nebujaradan, ladit pa lugwok rwot omakogi, oterogi wa i Ribla bot rwot me Babilon. <verse eid="JER 52:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27" />Ci rwot me Babilon onekogi woko ducu ki i Ribla ma i lobo Kamat. Kitmeno kikwanyo jo Juda woko ki i lobogi ci kiterogi woko i opii.<verse eid="JER 52:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28" />Man aye wel dano mayam Nebukadnejar omako otero woko i opii: i mwaka me abiro en otero Lujudaya maromo alip adek ki pyere aryo wiye adek. <verse eid="JER 52:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29" />I mwaka me apar wiye aboro me loce en okwanyo dano maromo miya aboro ki pyere adek wiye aryo ki i Jerucalem oterogi woko i opii. <verse eid="JER 52:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30" />I mwaka me pyere aryo wiye adek me loc pa Nebukadnejar, Nebujaradan ladit pa lugwok rwot otero Lujudaya maromo dano miya abiro ki pyere angwen wiye abic i opii. Wel dano ducu ma kiterogi i opii dong oribe oromo alip angwen ki miya abicel.<verse eid="JER 52:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31" />Ikare me mwaka pyere adek wiye abirone nia ma kitero kwede Yekoyakin rwot me Juda i opii, i dwe me apar wiye aryo, ikom nino dwe pyere aryo wiye abic, en aye Evil-merodak, rwot me Babilon, otimo kica ki Yekoyakin rwot me Juda, ogonye woko ki i buc i mwaka ma en ocamo iye ker. <verse eid="JER 52:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32" />Evil-merodak obedo kalok kwede mot maber, oketo en obedo ikom madit makato ducu ki ikin kom pa luker mayam gibedo kwede i Babilon. <verse eid="JER 52:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33" />Kitmeno aye kiweko Yekoyakin olunyu bongo me buc mere woko, ci obedo ka cam iwi meja pa rwot jwijwi, pi kare me kwone ducu. <verse eid="JER 52:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34" />Pi nino ducu me kwone, kun rwot dok obedo kamiye lim me tic kwede jwijwi, wek en okonye kwede.<verse eid="JER 52:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52" />
</usx>